-- us-tech-outages-five-days-chase-united-apple-20261120 (news; English 523 words; Nepali 165 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'us-tech-outages-five-days-chase-united-apple-20261120', 'news', 'USA',
'US Tech Outages: Chase, United, Apple and Microsoft Hit in One Week',
'अमेरिकी प्रविधि अवरोध: एक हप्तामा चेस, युनाइटेड, एप्पल र माइक्रोसफ्ट',
'Six days, at least six major systems down: Microsoft, the FAA, banks, United, the NSA and Apple. What happened, what caused it, and what is not true.',
'छ दिनमा कम्तीमा छ ठूला प्रणाली बन्द भए: माइक्रोसफ्ट, FAA, बैंक, युनाइटेड, NSA र एप्पल। के भयो, कारण के हो र के सत्य होइन।',
$$<p>In six days, at least six major systems failed in the United States: Microsoft 365, the Federal Aviation Administration, the big banks, United Airlines, the National Security Agency and Apple. Every company and agency involved says the failures were technical, not a cyberattack, and officials say they have found no connection between them. Here is the week, day by day.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>System</th><th>Stated cause</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>12-13 Nov</td><td>Microsoft 365 (Outlook, Teams, Copilot)</td><td>Latent software defect, traffic surge after a Teams failover, reduced capacity</td></tr><tr><td>13 Nov</td><td>FAA nationwide ground stop</td><td>Telecommunications failure in air traffic control</td></tr><tr><td>16 Nov</td><td>Chase, Bank of America, Wells Fargo, US Bank; Zelle delays</td><td>Software bug in on-premise hardware at Chase</td></tr><tr><td>16 Nov</td><td>United Airlines</td><td>Internal technology issue; more than 90 minutes, about 945 flights affected</td></tr><tr><td>17 Nov</td><td>NSA classified network</td><td>Network offline; cause not published</td></tr><tr><td>17 Nov</td><td>Apple (iCloud, App Store, Apple Pay, Apple Music)</td><td>Faulty internal update; about 11:45am to 6pm ET</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>US tech outages: the banks and the airlines</h2><p>On Monday 16 November, customers at Chase, Bank of America, Wells Fargo and US Bank reported problems with online accounts and payments, and some Zelle transfers were delayed. Chase said a software bug in on-premise hardware was to blame, that customers kept access to their accounts and funds, and that the issue was not cyber-related. Downdetector logged nearly 4,800 Chase reports by 2pm ET, and the bank said transactions were posting normally again by Monday evening. The same day, United Airlines reported a system outage lasting more than 90 minutes that delayed departing flights; about 945 flights were affected, and the airline said it had no indication of a cyber incident.</p><h2>Microsoft, the FAA and Apple</h2><p>The week began on 12 November, when Microsoft 365 went down worldwide for more than a day. Microsoft's preliminary report blamed a latent software defect from a July change to its gateway servers, extra load as Teams traffic shifted to a shared system, and about 14 percent of that system's capacity already offline. On Friday 13 November, the FAA ordered a nationwide ground stop after a telecommunications failure disrupted air traffic control. On Tuesday 17 November, the NSA's classified network went down and Apple's services failed after an internal update locked users out of iCloud and stopped the App Store, Apple Pay and Apple Music for several hours. Workday's HR and payroll platform also went down during the week.</p><h2>What officials say about a cyberattack</h2><p>Director of National Intelligence Jay Clayton said on 17 November that officials saw no sign of a coordinated cyberattack or nation-state effort. Homeland Security Secretary Markwayne Mullin said on 16 November that investigators had found no proof of a cyberattack, and suggested the outages may have been caused by a malfunction brought on by incorporating artificial intelligence into existing systems. That is his suggestion, not an official finding.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not establish any link between the outages, and two real attacks in the same week are separate: the Optimizely supply-chain attack that hit 178 websites, and the Java4Shell flaw in Java that was patched on 17 November. Read our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/jpmorgan-chase-outage-delays-us-bank-transactions-20261119'>Chase outage report</a>, our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/united-airlines-tech-outage-flights-delayed-faa-ground-stop-20261118'>United Airlines outage report</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/optimizely-supply-chain-attack-178-websites-20261118'>Optimizely supply-chain attack report</a> for the details of each.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.sarahcollins.online/2026/11/a-week-of-outages-microsoft-faa-and.html'>Sarah Collins</a>; <a href='https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2026/11/16/bank-outage-nationwide-chase-bofa--live/92814152007/'>USA Today</a>; <a href='https://www.jagranjosh.com/general-knowledge/apple-microsoft-banks-and-airlines-hit-by-tech-outages-list-of-5-major-tech-disruptions-in-one-week-1820013933-1'>Jagran Josh</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>छ दिनमा अमेरिकामा कम्तीमा छ ठूला प्रणाली बिग्रिए: माइक्रोसफ्ट ३६५, संघीय उड्डयन प्रशासन (FAA), ठूला बैंक, युनाइटेड एयरलाइन्स, राष्ट्रिय सुरक्षा एजेन्सी (NSA) र एप्पल। संलग्न सबै कम्पनी र निकायले यी प्राविधिक समस्या भएको र साइबर आक्रमण नभएको बताएका छन्, र अधिकारीहरूले यीबीच कुनै सम्बन्ध फेला नपरेको बताएका छन्।</p><p>१२-१३ नोभेम्बरमा माइक्रोसफ्ट ३६५ (आउटलुक, टिम्स, कोपाइलट) बन्द भयो। १३ नोभेम्बरमा FAA ले देशभर उडान रोक्यो। १६ नोभेम्बरमा चेस, बैंक अफ अमेरिका, वेल्स फार्गो र US बैंकमा समस्या देखियो; चेसले अन-प्रेमिस हार्डवेयरमा सफ्टवेयर बग भएको बताएको छ। सोही दिन युनाइटेड एयरलाइन्सको प्रणाली ९० मिनेटभन्दा बढी बन्द भयो र करिब ९४५ उडान प्रभावित भए। १७ नोभेम्बरमा NSA को वर्गीकृत नेटवर्क र एप्पलका सेवा (आइक्लाउड, एप स्टोर, एप्पल पे, एप्पल म्युजिक) बन्द भए।</p><p>राष्ट्रिय गुप्तचर निर्देशक जे क्लेटनले समन्वित साइबर आक्रमण वा राष्ट्र-राज्य प्रयासको कुनै संकेत नदेखिएको बताए। गृह सुरक्षा सचिव मार्कवेन मुलिनले साइबर आक्रमणको प्रमाण नभेटिएको र कृत्रिम बुद्धिमत्ता समावेश गर्दा खराबी भएको हुन सक्ने सुझाव दिए, जुन उनको सुझाव हो, आधिकारिक निष्कर्ष होइन।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Sarah Collins; USA Today; Jagran Josh।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.sarahcollins.online/2026/11/a-week-of-outages-microsoft-faa-and.html', 'https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2026/11/16/bank-outage-nationwide-chase-bofa--live/92814152007/', 'https://www.jagranjosh.com/general-knowledge/apple-microsoft-banks-and-airlines-hit-by-tech-outages-list-of-5-major-tech-disruptions-in-one-week-1820013933-1'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- target-q3-earnings-results-beat-forecasts-20261120 (news; English 307 words; Nepali 133 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'target-q3-earnings-results-beat-forecasts-20261120', 'news', 'USA',
'Target Q3 Earnings Beat Forecasts: Sales Up 7.1 Percent',
'टार्गेट Q3 आम्दानी अनुमानभन्दा माथि: बिक्री ७.१ प्रतिशत बढ्यो',
'Target earned 2.65 dollars a share on 27.1 billion dollars in sales, beating forecasts as comparable sales rose 5.6 percent. The results and the new outlook.',
'टार्गेटले $२७.१ अर्ब बिक्रीमा प्रतिशेयर $२.६५ कमायो, तुलनात्मक बिक्री ५.६ प्रतिशत बढ्दै अनुमानभन्दा माथि। नतिजा र नयाँ अनुमान।',
$$<p>Target earned $2.65 a share on $27.1 billion in sales in its fiscal third quarter, beating Wall Street forecasts and posting its fastest sales growth in more than five years. Comparable sales rose 5.6 percent, and the retailer raised its full-year outlook ahead of the holiday season. The results were reported on Wednesday 18 November before the market opened.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Measure</th><th>Q3 2026</th><th>Expected</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Earnings per share</td><td>$2.65</td><td>About $2.07</td></tr><tr><td>Net sales</td><td>$27.1 billion (+7.1%)</td><td>About $26.5 billion</td></tr><tr><td>Comparable sales</td><td>+5.6%</td><td>About +3.8%</td></tr><tr><td>Traffic</td><td>+5.0%</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Digital comparable sales</td><td>+9.8%</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Full-year EPS guidance</td><td>$10.65-$11.40</td><td>$9.90-$10.90 (prior)</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Target earnings: what drove the beat</h2><p>Net sales of $27.1 billion were 7.1 percent higher than a year earlier, with merchandise sales up 6.9 percent and non-merchandise sales up 19.3 percent. Comparable sales rose 5.6 percent, driven by a 5.0 percent increase in traffic, with store sales up 4.6 percent and digital sales up 9.8 percent. Net income rose 75.8 percent to $1.21 billion, or $2.65 a diluted share, against $1.51 a year earlier on a GAAP basis and $1.78 on an adjusted basis.</p><h2>The tariff refund caveat</h2><p>The results include $301 million of pretax tariff refund benefits, worth $0.50 a share. Without them, Target says adjusted earnings per share would still have risen 21 percent, so the beat is not only the refund. The company also raised its full-year outlook to net sales growth of about 6 percent and earnings of $10.65 to $11.40 a share, from $9.90 to $10.90. Chief executive Michael Fiddelke called the quarter another encouraging step in Target's turnaround.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a holiday-quarter forecast, and they do not break out sales by category. The full-year operating margin guidance includes about 1.1 percentage points of benefit from tariff refunds, so not all of the improvement is purely operational. For other results this week, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/nvidia-q3-earnings-results-20261119'>NVIDIA Q3 results</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/walmart-earnings-what-to-watch-20261119'>Walmart earnings preview</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.morningstar.com/news/pr-newswire/20261118cg00216/target-corporation-reports-third-quarter-earnings'>Target Corporation via PR Newswire</a>; <a href='https://theapexwire.com/business/target-q3-earnings-beat-raises-guidance/'>The Apex Wire</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>टार्गेटले आफ्नो वित्तीय तेस्रो त्रैमासिकमा $२७.१ अर्ब बिक्रीमा प्रतिशेयर $२.६५ कमायो, जुन वाल स्ट्रिटको अनुमानभन्दा बढी हो र पाँच वर्षभन्दा बढी यताको सबैभन्दा छिटो बिक्री वृद्धि हो। तुलनात्मक बिक्री ५.६ प्रतिशत बढ्यो र खुद्रा विक्रेताले बिदाको मौसमअघि पूर्ण वर्षको अनुमान बढाएको छ। नतिजा बुधबार १८ नोभेम्बरमा बजार खुल्नुअघि प्रकाशित भयो।</p><p>शुद्ध बिक्री अघिल्लो वर्षभन्दा ७.१ प्रतिशत बढेर $२७.१ अर्ब पुग्यो। तुलनात्मक बिक्री ५.६ प्रतिशत बढ्यो, ग्राहक आवागमन ५.० प्रतिशत बढ्यो, स्टोर बिक्री ४.६ प्रतिशत र डिजिटल बिक्री ९.८ प्रतिशत बढ्यो। शुद्ध नाफा ७५.८ प्रतिशत बढेर $१.२१ अर्ब पुग्यो।</p><p>नतिजामा $३०१ मिलियन करपूर्व ट्यारिफ फिर्ता लाभ समावेश छ, जुन प्रतिशेयर $०.५० हो। त्योबिना पनि समायोजित प्रतिशेयर आम्दानी २१ प्रतिशत बढ्थ्यो, त्यसैले सफलता केवल फिर्ताको कारण होइन। कम्पनीले पूर्ण वर्षको प्रतिशेयर आम्दानी अनुमान $९.९०-$१०.९० बाट $१०.६५-$११.४० मा बढाएको छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Target Corporation via PR Newswire; The Apex Wire।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.morningstar.com/news/pr-newswire/20261118cg00216/target-corporation-reports-third-quarter-earnings', 'https://theapexwire.com/business/target-q3-earnings-beat-raises-guidance/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- ukraine-prisoner-exchange-abu-dhabi-talks-20261120 (news; English 458 words; Nepali 129 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'ukraine-prisoner-exchange-abu-dhabi-talks-20261120', 'news', 'Ukraine',
'Ukraine Prisoner Exchange: Zelenskyy Prepares Swap After Abu Dhabi Talks',
'युक्रेन युद्धबन्दी आदानप्रदान: अबु धाबी वार्तापछि जेलेन्स्की तयारीमा',
'Ukraine is preparing a prisoner exchange with Russia after the Abu Dhabi talks, Zelenskyy said on 18 November. The numbers, the Berlin meeting and what is next.',
'अबु धाबी वार्तापछि युक्रेनले रुससँग युद्धबन्दी आदानप्रदानको तयारी गरिरहेको जेलेन्स्कीले १८ नोभेम्बरमा बताए। संख्या, बर्लिन बैठक र आगामी कदम।',
$$<p>Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy said on Tuesday 18 November that Ukraine is preparing a prisoner of war exchange with Russia, following the trilateral talks in Abu Dhabi. He called it one of the most important agreements reached at the meeting, and said Ukraine will submit its proposals to the American side and is already communicating through intelligence channels.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Talks</td><td>Two days, 10-11 November 2026, Abu Dhabi; US-mediated</td></tr><tr><td>US envoys</td><td>Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff</td></tr><tr><td>Numbers discussed</td><td>1,000 for 1,000, potentially rising to 1,500 each</td></tr><tr><td>Next meeting</td><td>Berlin, this week, with European and American partners</td></tr><tr><td>Trilateral meeting</td><td>Scheduled for 19 November, announced by Moscow on 14 November</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Ukraine prisoner exchange: what was agreed in Abu Dhabi</h2><p>The two days of talks in Abu Dhabi ended on Wednesday 11 November with an agreement in principle on a large prisoner exchange, but no breakthrough on a ceasefire or territory. Kushner announced that the sides had agreed to the largest humanitarian release of prisoners of the war, with final numbers to be settled the next day. Zelenskyy said the delegations discussed releasing 1,000 prisoners from each side, potentially rising to 1,500 each, and that the ambitious goal was an exchange of everyone for everyone. The head of the Ukrainian delegation, Rustem Umerov, and the Russian delegation head, Vladimir Medinsky, both confirmed the planned exchange.</p><h2>What happens next</h2><p>After Abu Dhabi, the American envoys travelled to Moscow on 12 November to meet President Vladimir Putin, then to Dublin to meet Zelenskyy. On 18 November, Zelenskyy said Ukraine's diplomatic team, intelligence officials, the head of the Security Service of Ukraine and the Commander-in-Chief discussed priorities for the next meeting in Berlin this week, including the parameters for releasing civilian hostages still held in Russia. He said Ukraine is ready to deliver results in the coming weeks, and that the timeline depends on how quickly the Russian side acts. He also expressed hope that the UAE can host another round of talks, praising Abu Dhabi's role in mediating prisoner exchanges.</p><h2>The fighting continues</h2><p>Ukraine struck the Kerch bridge to Crimea two nights running, with a road section collapsing into the sea, road traffic halted and rail partly resumed. Russia hit two Kyiv bridges across the Dnipro, disrupting heating and water. Territory remains the biggest obstacle: Russia still demands that Ukraine withdraw from the part of Donbas that Kyiv controls, while Zelenskyy says territory is a matter for leaders to decide. For earlier reporting, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/ukraine-strikes-crimean-bridge-second-day-record-drones-20261118'>Ukraine strikes on the Crimean bridge</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/trump-may-meet-kim-jong-un-china-apec-20261118'>Trump at the APEC summit</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>No side has announced a final number or a date for the exchange, and the sources do not say how many civilian hostages are held. The exchange is agreed in principle, not confirmed as scheduled.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/world/zelenskyy-says-ukraine-preparing-for-prisoner-exchange-with-russia-after-abu-dhabi-talks/amp'>The Tribune</a>; <a href='https://www.thenationalnews.com/news/us/2026/11/16/zelenskyy-hopes-uae-can-host-another-round-of-ukraine-peace-talks/'>The National</a>; <a href='https://english.nv.ua/nation/talks-in-abu-dhabi-parties-discuss-large-scale-prisoner-exchange-and-energy-truce-50659179.html'>The New Voice of Ukraine</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>युक्रेनी राष्ट्रपति भोलोदिमिर जेलेन्स्कीले मंगलबार १८ नोभेम्बरमा अबु धाबीमा भएको त्रिपक्षीय वार्तापछि रुससँग युद्धबन्दी आदानप्रदानको तयारी गरिरहेको बताए। उनले यसलाई बैठकमा भएको सबैभन्दा महत्त्वपूर्ण सम्झौतामध्ये एक भने र युक्रेनले आफ्ना प्रस्ताव अमेरिकी पक्षलाई बुझाउने र गुप्तचर माध्यमबाट पहिले नै संवाद गरिरहेको बताए।</p><p>अबु धाबीमा १०-११ नोभेम्बरमा दुई दिने वार्ता भयो, जसमा अमेरिकी दूत जारेड कुस्नर र स्टिभ विटकफ मध्यस्थ थिए। प्रत्येक पक्षबाट १,०००, सम्भवतः १,५०० जनासम्म आदानप्रदान गर्ने छलफल भएको थियो। अर्को बैठक यस हप्ता बर्लिनमा हुने र मस्कोले १९ नोभेम्बरका लागि त्रिपक्षीय बैठक तय भएको घोषणा गरेको छ।</p><p>यसैबीच लडाइँ जारी छ: युक्रेनले केर्च पुलमा दुई रात लगातार आक्रमण गर्‍यो, सडक खण्ड समुद्रमा खस्यो र सडक यातायात रोकियो। रुसले किभका दुई पुलमा आक्रमण गर्‍यो, जसले ताप र पानी आपूर्ति प्रभावित भयो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> The Tribune; The National; The New Voice of Ukraine।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/world/zelenskyy-says-ukraine-preparing-for-prisoner-exchange-with-russia-after-abu-dhabi-talks/amp', 'https://www.thenationalnews.com/news/us/2026/11/16/zelenskyy-hopes-uae-can-host-another-round-of-ukraine-peace-talks/', 'https://english.nv.ua/nation/talks-in-abu-dhabi-parties-discuss-large-scale-prisoner-exchange-and-energy-truce-50659179.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- nepal-home-minister-sudan-gurung-resigns-20261120 (news; English 284 words; Nepali 112 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'nepal-home-minister-sudan-gurung-resigns-20261120', 'news', 'Nepal',
'Nepal Home Minister Sudan Gurung Resigns After One Month',
'नेपालका गृहमन्त्री सुदन गुरुङले एक महिनामा राजीनामा दिए',
'Nepal home minister Sudan Gurung resigned 18 November, less than a month into the job, citing questions about his investments. What happened and what is next.',
'नेपालका गृहमन्त्री सुदन गुरुङले १८ नोभेम्बरमा राजीनामा दिए, एक महिना नपुग्दै, लगानीबारे प्रश्न उठेपछि। के भयो र अब के हुन्छ।',
$$<p>Nepal's Home Minister Sudan Gurung resigned on Wednesday 18 November, less than a month into the job, citing questions about his investments. It is the second cabinet exit in a month for Prime Minister Balendra Shah's government. Shah, who took office after the February election, will take charge of Home Affairs himself until a new minister is appointed.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Resigned</td><td>Home Minister Sudan Gurung, 18 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Time in office</td><td>Less than one month</td></tr><tr><td>Reason given</td><td>Questions about his investments</td></tr><tr><td>Who takes over</td><td>Prime Minister Balendra Shah, until a new appointment</td></tr><tr><td>Cabinet exits</td><td>Second in a month</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Nepal home minister resigns: what happened</h2><p>Gurung's resignation letter was received by the Prime Minister's Office, press adviser Dipa Dahal confirmed. Gurung said questions about his investments had made his position difficult, and he stepped down less than a month after taking office. The resignation is the second cabinet exit in a month, an early test for a government that came to power promising clean politics.</p><h2>Who is Balendra Shah</h2><p>Balendra Shah, known as Balen, is 35 and a former rapper who became Prime Minister after his party, the Rastriya Swatantra Party, won 182 of 275 seats in the February election. He has now taken charge of the Home Affairs portfolio himself. Nepal ranks 109 out of 180 countries on Transparency International's Corruption Perceptions Index, and the new government faces pressure to show that its anti-corruption promises are real.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not name Gurung's investments or say whether any formal investigation is under way, and they do not say when a new home minister will be appointed. For more on Nepal, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/nepal-imports-350-mw-electricity-india-winter-20261118'>Nepal imports 350 MW of electricity from India</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/shenzhen-bans-horns-drones-trump-apec-visit-20261119'>Shenzhen bans horns and drones for the Trump visit</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://aljazeeranews-mggx1uo47w.edgeone.app/news/2026/4/22/nepals-home-minister-resigns-second-cabinet-exit-in-one-month'>Al Jazeera</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>नेपालका गृहमन्त्री सुदन गुरुङले बुधबार १८ नोभेम्बरमा राजीनामा दिए, पद सम्हालेको एक महिना पनि नपुग्दै। उनले आफ्नो लगानीबारे उठेका प्रश्नलाई कारण बताएका छन्। प्रधानमन्त्री बालेन्द्र शाहको सरकारमा एक महिनाभित्र यो दोस्रो मन्त्रिपरिषद् निकास हो। शाहले नयाँ मन्त्री नियुक्त नहुँदासम्म गृह मन्त्रालय आफैं सम्हाल्नेछन्।</p><p>गुरुङको राजीनामा पत्र प्रधानमन्त्री कार्यालयले प्राप्त गरेको प्रेस सल्लाहकार दीपा दाहालले पुष्टि गरिन्। बालेन्द्र शाह ३५ वर्षका पूर्व र्‍यापर हुन्, जसको पार्टी राष्ट्रिय स्वतन्त्र पार्टीले फेब्रुअरी चुनावमा २७५ मध्ये १८२ सिट जितेको थियो। नेपाल ट्रान्सपरेन्सी इन्टरनेसनलको भ्रष्टाचार धारणा सूचकांकमा १८० मध्ये १०९ औं स्थानमा छ।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले गुरुङको लगानीको नाम वा कुनै औपचारिक अनुसन्धान चलिरहेको छ कि छैन भनेका छैनन्, र नयाँ गृहमन्त्री कहिले नियुक्त हुन्छन् भन्ने पनि बताएका छैनन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Al Jazeera।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://aljazeeranews-mggx1uo47w.edgeone.app/news/2026/4/22/nepals-home-minister-resigns-second-cabinet-exit-in-one-month'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- trump-xi-putin-shenzhen-summit-what-to-watch-20261120 (news; English 375 words; Nepali 141 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'trump-xi-putin-shenzhen-summit-what-to-watch-20261120', 'news', 'China',
'Trump Xi Putin Shenzhen Summit: What to Watch on 19 November',
'ट्रम्प सी पुटिन सेन्जेन शिखर: १९ नोभेम्बरमा के हेर्ने',
'Donald Trump, Xi Jinping and Vladimir Putin meet in Shenzhen on 19 November in the first US-China-Russia trilateral. The agenda, the stakes and what to expect.',
'डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प, सी जिनपिङ र भ्लादिमिर पुटिन १९ नोभेम्बरमा सेन्जेनमा पहिलो अमेरिका-चीन-रुस त्रिपक्षीय बैठकमा भेट्दैछन्। एजेन्डा, दाउ र अपेक्षा।',
$$<p>Donald Trump, Xi Jinping and Vladimir Putin meet in Shenzhen on Thursday 19 November in the first ever US-China-Russia trilateral summit, held on the sidelines of the APEC leaders' meeting. The White House says Trump will hold a bilateral meeting and a working lunch with Xi first, and US officials say no agreement is expected: this is a first conversation, not a deal-making session. Here is what to watch.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Meeting</td><td>First US-China-Russia trilateral, Thursday 19 November 2026, Shenzhen</td></tr><tr><td>Setting</td><td>On the sidelines of APEC, 18-19 November</td></tr><tr><td>Trump agenda</td><td>Denuclearisation, Iran, Ukraine, trade and economics</td></tr><tr><td>Format</td><td>Trump bilateral and working lunch with Xi first, then the trilateral</td></tr><tr><td>Expectation</td><td>No agreement expected, per US officials</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Trump Xi Putin summit: the agenda</h2><p>Trump's agenda for the Shenzhen meeting covers denuclearisation, Iran, Ukraine and trade and economics, according to reports of the White House briefing. The timing matters: the New START nuclear arms treaty between the US and Russia expired on 5 February 2026, leaving the two largest nuclear powers without a bilateral arms control treaty for the first time in decades. Trump has said he wants a deal that brings China into nuclear arms control as well.</p><h2>What each side wants</h2><p>The Kremlin confirmed the meeting on 14 November, and China has said the talks are about safeguarding world peace. At the APEC meeting on 18 November, Xi and Putin both criticised US trade policy and sanctions, setting a tense tone for the trilateral. US officials have lowered expectations, describing the meeting as a first conversation between the three leaders rather than a negotiation with an outcome.</p><h2>What to watch on the day</h2><p>Watch for any joint statement, any mention of a follow-up meeting, and whether the leaders discuss Ukraine in public. The meeting is also a test of Trump's approach to the two leaders at once: engaging Putin on Ukraine while pressing Xi on trade. For the APEC context, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/trump-may-meet-kim-jong-un-china-apec-20261118'>Trump at the APEC summit</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/shenzhen-bans-horns-drones-trump-apec-visit-20261119'>Shenzhen bans horns and drones for the Trump visit</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a start time for the trilateral or say how long it will last, and they do not report any agreed agenda document. This is a preview: no outcomes are known yet, and none are invented here.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nukes-iran-ukraine-and-trade-trump-lays-out-agenda-for-trilateral-with-xi-putin/articleshow/135896601.cms'>Times of India</a>; <a href='https://indianexpress.com/article/world/apec-summit-shenzhen-xi-jinping-putin-trump-trilateral-meeting-trade-sanctions-10968448/'>Indian Express</a>; <a href='https://biz.chosun.com/en/en-international/2026/11/17/K64QZ77EUBCSFBUN46HCSRQL5U/'>Chosun</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प, सी जिनपिङ र भ्लादिमिर पुटिन बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बरमा सेन्जेनमा पहिलो पटक अमेरिका-चीन-रुस त्रिपक्षीय शिखर सम्मेलनमा भेट्दैछन्, जुन APEC नेताहरूको बैठकको छेउमा हुनेछ। ह्वाइट हाउसले ट्रम्पले पहिले सीसँग द्विपक्षीय बैठक र कार्य भोज गर्ने बताएको छ र अमेरिकी अधिकारीहरूले कुनै सम्झौता अपेक्षा नगरिएको बताएका छन्: यो सम्झौता गर्ने सत्र होइन, पहिलो वार्तालाप हो।</p><p>ट्रम्पको एजेन्डामा आणविक निरस्त्रीकरण, इरान, युक्रेन र व्यापार तथा अर्थतन्त्र छन्। New START आणविक हतियार सन्धि ५ फेब्रुअरी २०२६ मा सकिएको छ, जसले अमेरिका र रुसलाई दशकौंपछि पहिलो पटक द्विपक्षीय हतियार नियन्त्रण सन्धिबिना छोडेको छ। क्रेमलिनले १४ नोभेम्बरमा बैठक पुष्टि गरेको थियो र चीनले वार्ता विश्व शान्ति जोगाउने बारेमा भएको बताएको छ।</p><p>दिनको मुख्य कुरा: कुनै संयुक्त वक्तव्य, फलो-अप बैठकको उल्लेख र युक्रेनबारे सार्वजनिक छलफल छ कि छैन हेर्नुहोस्। यो पूर्वावलोकन हो: कुनै परिणाम थाहा छैन र यहाँ कुनै परिणाम कल्पना गरिएको छैन।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Times of India; Indian Express; Chosun।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nukes-iran-ukraine-and-trade-trump-lays-out-agenda-for-trilateral-with-xi-putin/articleshow/135896601.cms', 'https://indianexpress.com/article/world/apec-summit-shenzhen-xi-jinping-putin-trump-trilateral-meeting-trade-sanctions-10968448/', 'https://biz.chosun.com/en/en-international/2026/11/17/K64QZ77EUBCSFBUN46HCSRQL5U/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- g20-summit-johannesburg-november-22-preview-20261120 (news; English 321 words; Nepali 110 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'g20-summit-johannesburg-november-22-preview-20261120', 'news', 'South Africa',
'G20 Summit Johannesburg: First G20 in Africa Starts 22 November',
'G20 शिखर जोहानेसबर्ग: अफ्रिकामा पहिलो G20 २२ नोभेम्बरमा',
'The 20th G20 Summit opens in Johannesburg on 22 November, the first ever in Africa. Who is coming, who is not, and the agenda to watch.',
'२०औं G20 शिखर सम्मेलन २२ नोभेम्बरमा जोहानेसबर्गमा खुल्दैछ, अफ्रिकामा पहिलो पटक। को आउँदैछ, को आउँदैन र एजेन्डा।',
$$<p>The 20th G20 Summit opens in Johannesburg on 22 November 2026, the first G20 leaders' summit ever held in Africa. South African President Cyril Ramaphosa hosts the two-day meeting under the theme Solidarity, Equality, Sustainability. The United States is not taking part, while India, the European Union and the African Union are all at the table. Here is what to watch.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Summit</td><td>20th G20 Leaders' Summit, Johannesburg, 22-23 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Host</td><td>President Cyril Ramaphosa, South Africa</td></tr><tr><td>Theme</td><td>Solidarity, Equality, Sustainability</td></tr><tr><td>Not attending</td><td>United States: no US government official, per President Trump</td></tr><tr><td>India</td><td>PM Narendra Modi attending 21-23 November; 4th visit to South Africa, 12th G20</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>G20 summit Johannesburg: the agenda</h2><p>The summit's priorities are disaster resilience, debt sustainability for developing countries, a just energy transition and critical minerals. The African Union is a permanent G20 member since 2023, and the Johannesburg summit is the first time the leaders' meeting is held on African soil. On the eve of the summit, on 22 November, EU leaders meet to discuss Ukraine and Trump's 28-point peace plan.</p><h2>Who is coming and who is not</h2><p>Prime Minister Narendra Modi is attending from 21 to 23 November, his fourth visit to South Africa and his 12th G20 summit. The United States is not participating: President Trump said no US government official would attend, citing human rights violations in South Africa. The absence of the world's largest economy is the biggest story of the summit before it begins.</p><h2>What to watch</h2><p>Watch for the leaders' declaration, any commitments on debt relief for developing countries, and whether the summit agrees anything on critical minerals. For the wider summit season, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/trump-may-meet-kim-jong-un-china-apec-20261118'>Trump at the APEC summit</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/shenzhen-bans-horns-drones-trump-apec-visit-20261119'>Shenzhen bans horns and drones for the Trump visit</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not list every leader attending, and they do not say whether a joint declaration has been agreed in advance. This is a preview: no outcomes are known yet, and none are invented here.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://ianslive.in/g20-leaders-summit-pm-modi-set-to-put-sharper-focus-on-matters-impacting-global-south--20251120164946'>IANS</a>; <a href='https://www.lokmattimes.com/international/issues-of-importance-to-global-south-are-centre-of-discussion-mea-on-20th-g20-leaders-summit-in-johannesburg/amp/'>Lokmat Times</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>२०औं G20 शिखर सम्मेलन २२ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा जोहानेसबर्गमा खुल्दैछ, अफ्रिकामा भएको पहिलो G20 नेताहरूको सम्मेलन। दक्षिण अफ्रिकी राष्ट्रपति सिरिल रामाफोसाले दुई दिने बैठकको अध्यक्षता गर्दैछन्, विषय 'एकता, समानता, दिगोपन' रहेको छ। संयुक्त राज्य अमेरिका सहभागी भइरहेको छैन, जबकि भारत, युरोपेली संघ र अफ्रिकी संघ सबै सहभागी छन्।</p><p>शिखर सम्मेलनका प्राथमिकतामा विपद् सहनशीलता, विकासोन्मुख देशका लागि ऋण दिगोपन, न्यायपूर्ण ऊर्जा संक्रमण र महत्वपूर्ण खनिज छन्। प्रधानमन्त्री नरेन्द्र मोदी २१-२३ नोभेम्बरमा सहभागी हुँदैछन्, यो उनको दक्षिण अफ्रिका चौथो भ्रमण र १२औं G20 हो। अमेरिकाले दक्षिण अफ्रिकामा मानव अधिकार उल्लंघन भएको भन्दै कुनै अधिकारी नपठाउने बताएको छ।</p><p>यो पूर्वावलोकन हो: कुनै परिणाम थाहा छैन र यहाँ कुनै परिणाम कल्पना गरिएको छैन।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> IANS; Lokmat Times।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://ianslive.in/g20-leaders-summit-pm-modi-set-to-put-sharper-focus-on-matters-impacting-global-south--20251120164946', 'https://www.lokmattimes.com/international/issues-of-importance-to-global-south-are-centre-of-discussion-mea-on-20th-g20-leaders-summit-in-johannesburg/amp/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- nepal-pm-balen-shah-india-visit-november-22-20261120 (news; English 355 words; Nepali 137 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'nepal-pm-balen-shah-india-visit-november-22-20261120', 'news', 'Nepal',
'Balen Shah India Visit: Nepal PM Cuts First Trip to 25 Hours',
'बालेन शाह भारत भ्रमण: नेपालका प्रधानमन्त्रीको पहिलो यात्रा २५ घण्टामा',
'Nepal PM Balendra Shah visits India on 22 and 23 November, his first bilateral trip, cut from three days to 25 hours. The agenda and the aid ask.',
'नेपालका प्रधानमन्त्री बालेन्द्र शाह २२ र २३ नोभेम्बरमा भारत भ्रमण गर्दैछन्, पहिलो द्विपक्षीय यात्रा, तीन दिनबाट २५ घण्टामा घटाइएको। एजेन्डा र सहायता माग।',
$$<p>Nepal Prime Minister Balendra Shah makes his first bilateral visit to India on 22 and 23 November 2026, arriving in the afternoon of 22 November and returning on the evening of 23 November. The trip has been cut from three days to 25 hours, and Delhi only: planned stops in Bengaluru, Ahmedabad and Uttarakhand have been dropped. Nepal is seeking more than $2 billion in Indian assistance for post-flood reconstruction. Here is what is on the table.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Visit</td><td>22-23 November 2026, Delhi only; 25 hours, cut from 3 days</td></tr><tr><td>First bilateral visit</td><td>PM Balendra Shah's first to India as Prime Minister</td></tr><tr><td>Aid ask</td><td>More than $2 billion for post-flood reconstruction</td></tr><tr><td>Floods</td><td>26 August Bhotekoshi and Trishuli floods: 1,400+ dead, 5,000+ missing</td></tr><tr><td>Reconstruction need</td><td>$4.77 billion, per the official damage assessment</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Balen Shah India visit: the agenda</h2><p>Shah will hold a 30-minute one-on-one meeting with Prime Minister Narendra Modi on 23 November, followed by delegation-level talks, and will meet President Droupadi Murmu and External Affairs Minister S. Jaishankar. The agenda covers air routes, trade, transit and connectivity, and the two sides are expected to flag off a weekly Ayodhya to Janakpur railway service.</p><h2>The aid ask, and a discrepancy in the reports</h2><p>Nepal is seeking more than $2 billion for reconstruction after the 26 August floods on the Bhotekoshi and Trishuli rivers, which killed more than 1,400 people and left more than 5,000 missing. The official damage assessment puts the reconstruction need at $4.77 billion. The reports disagree on the shape of the ask, and both versions are reported here without reconciling them: IANS reports $1 billion in grants plus a $1.15 billion line of credit, while News18 reports $1 billion in loans plus $500 million in grants plus $500 million in reconstruction support.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say whether India has agreed to the aid package, and they do not give the exact time of the Modi meeting. This is a preview: no outcomes are known yet, and none are invented here. For more on Nepal, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/nepal-imports-350-mw-electricity-india-winter-20261118'>Nepal imports 350 MW of electricity from India</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/shenzhen-bans-horns-drones-trump-apec-visit-20261119'>Shenzhen bans horns and drones for the Trump visit</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://ianslive.in/nepal-to-seek-over-2-billion-in-indian-assistance-during-pm-shahs-delhi-visit--20261118131347'>IANS</a>; <a href='https://www.news18.com/world/nepal-pm-balendra-shah-cuts-short-first-india-visit-from-3-days-to-just-25-hours-ws-l-10430131.html'>News18</a>; <a href='https://english.onlinekhabar.com/nepal-political-leadership-india.html'>OnlineKhabar</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>नेपालका प्रधानमन्त्री बालेन्द्र शाहले २२ र २३ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा भारतको पहिलो द्विपक्षीय भ्रमण गर्दैछन्, २२ नोभेम्बर दिउँसो पुगेर २३ नोभेम्बर साँझ फर्कने। भ्रमण तीन दिनबाट घटाएर २५ घण्टा बनाइएको छ र दिल्ली मात्र: बेङ्गलुरु, अहमदाबाद र उत्तराखण्डका योजना हटाइएका छन्। नेपालले बाढीपछिको पुनर्निर्माणका लागि $२ अर्बभन्दा बढी भारतीय सहायता मागिरहेको छ।</p><p>शाहले २३ नोभेम्बरमा प्रधानमन्त्री नरेन्द्र मोदीसँग ३० मिनेट एक्लै भेट्नेछन्, त्यसपछि प्रतिनिधिमण्डलस्तरीय वार्ता हुनेछ र राष्ट्रपति द्रौपदी मुर्मू तथा विदेशमन्त्री एस. जयशंकरसँग पनि भेट्नेछन्। एजेन्डामा हवाई मार्ग, व्यापार, पारवहन र सम्पर्क छन् र अयोध्या-जनकपुर साप्ताहिक रेल सेवा सुरु गर्ने अपेक्षा छ।</p><p>सहायता मागमा रिपोर्टहरू फरक छन् र दुवै संस्करण यहाँ मिलाउनेबिना नै प्रस्तुत गरिएको छ: IANS ले $१ अर्ब अनुदान + $१.१५ अर्ब ऋण रेखा भनेको छ भने News18 ले $१ अर्ब ऋण + $५०० मिलियन अनुदान + $५०० मिलियन पुनर्निर्माण सहायता भनेको छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> IANS; News18; OnlineKhabar।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://ianslive.in/nepal-to-seek-over-2-billion-in-indian-assistance-during-pm-shahs-delhi-visit--20261118131347', 'https://www.news18.com/world/nepal-pm-balendra-shah-cuts-short-first-india-visit-from-3-days-to-just-25-hours-ws-l-10430131.html', 'https://english.onlinekhabar.com/nepal-political-leadership-india.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- iran-dirty-bomb-report-washington-20261120 (news; English 351 words; Nepali 146 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'iran-dirty-bomb-report-washington-20261120', 'news', 'USA',
'Iran Dirty Bomb Report: US Intelligence Warns of Washington Plot',
'इरान डर्टी बम रिपोर्ट: अमेरिकी गुप्तचरले वासिङ्टन षड्यन्त्रबारे चेतावनी दियो',
'US intelligence indicates Iran is developing plans for a dirty bomb or chemical attack in Washington, CNN reported. What is known and what is not.',
'अमेरिकी गुप्तचरले इरानले वासिङ्टनमा डर्टी बम वा रासायनिक आक्रमणको योजना बनाइरहेको संकेत गरेको CNN ले रिपोर्ट गर्‍यो। के थाहा छ र के छैन।',
$$<p>US intelligence indicates Iran is developing plans for a dirty bomb or chemical weapon attack targeting senior Trump administration officials in Washington, CNN reported on Monday 16 November, citing seven US officials. The report stresses that officials are divided on Iran's capability and intent, and that there is no evidence Tehran has decided to proceed. This article reports the intelligence as reported, not as confirmed fact.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Claim</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Report</td><td>CNN, 16 November 2026, citing seven US officials</td></tr><tr><td>Alleged plan</td><td>Dirty bomb or chemical weapon attack in Washington, targeting senior Trump administration officials</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Planning gives Iran options, not an imminent attack, per officials</td></tr><tr><td>Evidence of a decision</td><td>None: no evidence Tehran has decided to proceed</td></tr><tr><td>White House</td><td>Spokesperson Lauren Bis: no credible threats to the homeland at this time</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Iran dirty bomb report: what US intelligence says</h2><p>According to the CNN report, US intelligence indicates Iran is developing plans for a dirty bomb or chemical weapon attack in Washington. A dirty bomb uses conventional explosives to spread radioactive material, and is a weapon of disruption rather than mass destruction. Officials cited in the report are divided on whether Iran has the capability and the intent to carry out such an attack, and the report says the planning gives Tehran options rather than signalling an imminent attack.</p><h2>Iran denies the report</h2><p>Iran has denied the report. Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi called it rubbish, Iran's mission to the United Nations said it categorically rejects the use of chemical weapons, and the parliament speaker accused CNN of war mongering. Bahrain said it intercepted an Iranian drone attack after a reported Iranian Revolutionary Guard Corps strike on a US radar at Isa Air Base. President Trump has warned Tehran that there would be consequences.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish the intelligence itself, and they do not say which senior officials were allegedly targeted. No official has confirmed that an attack is planned or imminent, and the White House says there are no credible threats to the homeland at this time. For related reporting, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/europe-hoax-bomb-threats-8000-schools-flights-20261119'>Europe hoax bomb threats</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/ukraine-nuclear-accident-risk-rises-winter-20261119'>Ukraine nuclear accident risk rises</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.haaretz.com/us-news/2026-11-17/ty-article/iran-developing-plans-for-dirty-bomb-or-chemical-attack-in-d-c-report-says/000001a1-e8c8-d848-abeb-fac893430000'>Haaretz</a>; <a href='https://www.timesofisrael.com/us-intel-said-to-indicate-iran-planning-potential-dirty-bomb-attack-in-washington/amp/'>Times of Israel</a>; <a href='https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/us-iran-tensions-trump-warns-iran-major-price-tehran-denies-dirty-bomb-plot-bahrain-drone-attacks-1.500749924'>Gulf News</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>अमेरिकी गुप्तचरले इरानले वासिङ्टनमा वरिष्ठ ट्रम्प प्रशासन अधिकारीहरूलाई लक्षित गर्दै डर्टी बम वा रासायनिक हतियार आक्रमणको योजना विकास गरिरहेको संकेत गरेको CNN ले सोमबार १६ नोभेम्बरमा सात अमेरिकी अधिकारीलाई उद्धृत गर्दै रिपोर्ट गर्‍यो। रिपोर्टले अधिकारीहरू इरानको क्षमता र इरादाबारे विभाजित छन् र तेहरानले अगाडि बढ्ने निर्णय गरेको कुनै प्रमाण छैन भन्ने जोड दिन्छ। यो लेख गुप्तचरलाई रिपोर्ट गरिएअनुसार प्रस्तुत गर्छ, पुष्टि भएको तथ्यका रूपमा होइन।</p><p>इरानले रिपोर्ट अस्वीकार गरेको छ। विदेशमन्त्री अब्बास अरागचीले यसलाई बकवास भने, संयुक्त राष्ट्रसंघमा इरानको मिसनले रासायनिक हतियार प्रयोगलाई स्पष्ट रूपमा अस्वीकार गरेको बताएको छ र संसद् सभामुखले CNN लाई युद्ध उक्साएको आरोप लगाए। बहराइनले अमेरिकी राडारमा इरानी आक्रमणपछि इरानी ड्रोन आक्रमण रोकेको बताएको छ। राष्ट्रपति ट्रम्पले तेहरानलाई परिणाम भोग्नुपर्ने चेतावनी दिएका छन्।</p><p>स्रोतहरूले गुप्तचर प्रतिवेदन आफैं प्रकाशित गरेका छैनन् र कुन वरिष्ठ अधिकारी लक्षित थिए भनेका छैनन्। ह्वाइट हाउसले अहिले मातृभूमिमा कुनै विश्वसनीय खतरा नभएको बताएको छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Haaretz; Times of Israel; Gulf News।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.haaretz.com/us-news/2026-11-17/ty-article/iran-developing-plans-for-dirty-bomb-or-chemical-attack-in-d-c-report-says/000001a1-e8c8-d848-abeb-fac893430000', 'https://www.timesofisrael.com/us-intel-said-to-indicate-iran-planning-potential-dirty-bomb-attack-in-washington/amp/', 'https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/us-iran-tensions-trump-warns-iran-major-price-tehran-denies-dirty-bomb-plot-bahrain-drone-attacks-1.500749924'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- kayem-foods-recall-freezer-check-20261120 (news; English 380 words; Nepali 180 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'kayem-foods-recall-freezer-check-20261120', 'news', 'USA',
'Kayem Foods Recall: Check Your Freezer for 1.5 Million Pounds',
'कायम फुड्स फिर्ता: १.५ मिलियन पाउन्डका लागि फ्रिजर जाँच गर्नुहोस्',
'Kayem Foods recalled about 1.58 million pounds of ready-to-eat meat after a cooler failure. How to check the brands, codes and best-by dates in your freezer.',
'कायम फुड्सले कुलर बिग्रिएपछि करिब १.५८ मिलियन पाउन्ड तयार मासु फिर्ता गर्‍यो। फ्रिजरमा ब्रान्ड, कोड र म्याद कसरी जाँच गर्ने।',
$$<p>Kayem Foods recalled about 1,584,361 pounds of ready-to-eat meat and poultry on 17 October 2026, after a warehouse cooling system malfunction may have left the products at unsafe temperatures. The recall covers 68 products under nine brand names, produced between 31 March and 7 October 2026, and the US Food Safety and Inspection Service (FSIS) has classified it as Class I, its highest-risk category. No illnesses had been confirmed at the time of the announcement, but some products have best-by dates stretching into early 2027, so they could still be in a home freezer. Here is how to check.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recall</td><td>FSIS Recall 026-2026, announced 17 October 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Quantity</td><td>About 1,584,361 pounds of ready-to-eat meat and poultry</td></tr><tr><td>Products</td><td>68 products under 9 brands, produced 31 March to 7 October 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Risk class</td><td>Class I: reasonable probability of serious health effects</td></tr><tr><td>Establishment numbers</td><td>EST. M/P 7839, EST. P 20935A, EST. M 9520</td></tr><tr><td>Illnesses</td><td>None confirmed at the time of the announcement</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Kayem Foods recall: the brands and products</h2><p>The recall covers nine brand names: Kayem, Genoa, Al Fresco, Triple M, McKenzie, Deutschmacher, Jordan's, Essem and Winnisimmet. Products include hot dogs including Fenway Franks, bratwurst, kielbasa, bacon, ham, turkey breast, bologna, corned beef, liverwurst and fully cooked chicken sausage and meatballs. The products were shipped to shops and food-service locations across the United States and Hong Kong between 7 June and 14 October 2026.</p><h2>How to check your freezer</h2><p>Look inside the USDA mark of inspection on the packaging for one of three establishment numbers: EST. M/P 7839, EST. P 20935A or EST. M 9520. Then match the product name, UPC code and best-by date against the full FSIS product list for Recall 026-2026. The problem cannot be seen, smelled or tasted, so the codes are the only reliable check. Kayem's consumer line is 800-426-6100. The recall was discovered after a retail customer reported on 1 October 2026 that a delivery had arrived warm.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not list every shop that sold the products, and they do not say how many of the recalled pounds are still in freezers. The recall is a month old, but it is covered again now because best-by dates run into early 2027. For other news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/europe-hoax-bomb-threats-8000-schools-flights-20261119'>Europe hoax bomb threats</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/jpmorgan-chase-outage-delays-us-bank-transactions-20261119'>Chase outage report</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFSIS/bulletins/42f8d37'>USDA FSIS official recall notice</a>; <a href='https://yourhealingcamp.com/kayem-meat-recall-2026-how-to-check-the-upc-and-best-by-date/'>Your Healing Camp</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>कायम फुड्सले १७ अक्टोबर २०२६ मा करिब १,५८४,३६१ पाउन्ड तयार मासु तथा कुखुरा फिर्ता गर्‍यो, किनभने गोदामको शीतलन प्रणाली बिग्रिँदा उत्पादन असुरक्षित तापक्रममा रहेका हुन सक्छन्। फिर्तामा नौ ब्रान्ड अन्तर्गत ६८ उत्पादन छन्, जुन ३१ मार्चदेखि ७ अक्टोबर २०२६ बीच उत्पादन भएका थिए। अमेरिकी खाद्य सुरक्षा तथा निरीक्षण सेवा (FSIS) ले यसलाई Class I, आफ्नो उच्चतम जोखिम श्रेणी, मा राखेको छ। घोषणाको समयमा कुनै बिरामी पुष्टि भएको थिएन, तर केही उत्पादनको म्याद २०२७ को सुरुसम्म छ, त्यसैले ती घरको फ्रिजरमा अझै हुन सक्छन्।</p><p>ब्रान्डहरू: Kayem, Genoa, Al Fresco, Triple M, McKenzie, Deutschmacher, Jordan's, Essem र Winnisimmet। उत्पादनमा हट डग (Fenway Franks सहित), ब्राटवर्स्ट, किलबासा, बेकन, ह्याम, टर्की ब्रेस्ट, बोलोग्ना, कर्न्ड बिफ, लिभरवर्स्ट र पूर्ण पकाएको कुखुराको ससेज र मिटबल छन्।</p><h2>फ्रिजर कसरी जाँच गर्ने</h2><p>प्याकेजिङमा USDA निरीक्षण चिन्हभित्र यी तीन स्थापना नम्बरमध्ये एक हेर्नुहोस्: EST. M/P 7839, EST. P 20935A वा EST. M 9520। त्यसपछि उत्पादन नाम, UPC कोड र म्याद FSIS को पूर्ण सूचीसँग मिलाउनुहोस्। समस्या देख्न, सुँघ्न वा स्वाद लिन सकिँदैन, त्यसैले कोड नै एकमात्र भरपर्दो जाँच हो। कायमको उपभोक्ता लाइन 800-426-6100 हो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> USDA FSIS official recall notice; Your Healing Camp।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USFSIS/bulletins/42f8d37', 'https://yourhealingcamp.com/kayem-meat-recall-2026-how-to-check-the-upc-and-best-by-date/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- miami-airport-collision-copa-ups-20261120 (news; English 360 words; Nepali 139 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'miami-airport-collision-copa-ups-20261120', 'news', 'USA',
'Miami Airport Collision: Copa and UPS Jets Clash on Taxiway',
'मियामी विमानस्थल ठक्कर: ट्याक्सीवेमा कोपा र UPS विमान ठोक्किए',
'A Copa Airlines jet and a UPS cargo plane collided on a Miami taxiway on 14 November, injuring two people. What happened, and what the NTSB is investigating.',
'१४ नोभेम्बरमा मियामी ट्याक्सीवेमा कोपा एयरलाइन्स विमान र UPS कार्गो विमान ठोक्किए, दुई जना घाइते भए। के भयो र NTSB ले के अनुसन्धान गरिरहेको छ।',
$$<p>A Copa Airlines Boeing 737 and a UPS Boeing 767 collided on a taxiway at Miami International Airport on Saturday 14 November at about 9:15pm, leaving two people with minor injuries. The wingtip of the Copa jet, which had just landed from Panama City, struck the nose of the UPS freighter as it taxied for departure to Bogota. The Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) and the National Transportation Safety Board (NTSB) are both investigating.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Date and time</td><td>Saturday 14 November 2026, about 9:15pm ET</td></tr><tr><td>Place</td><td>Miami International Airport, intersection of two taxiways</td></tr><tr><td>Copa flight</td><td>CM427, Boeing 737-800, HP-1826CMP, from Panama City; 166 passengers and 6 crew</td></tr><tr><td>UPS flight</td><td>Flight 358, Boeing 767-300F, N336UP, to Bogota, Colombia</td></tr><tr><td>Injuries</td><td>Two passengers, minor, treated at the scene, no hospital transport</td></tr><tr><td>Investigation</td><td>FAA and NTSB; preliminary report expected within 30 days</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Miami airport collision: what happened</h2><p>Copa flight CM427 had arrived from Panama City and was taxiing to its gate when its left wingtip struck the nose of the UPS Boeing 767, which was taxiing for departure to Bogota. The FAA said air traffic controllers had told the UPS crew to give way to the Copa flight. Audio of the exchange shows the UPS pilot telling the controller: We went too far and then he clipped us with the wing. The NTSB said preliminary information shows the UPS plane was told to give way and did not stop, and that the UPS aircraft had substantial damage, while its assessment of the Copa jet was not yet complete.</p><h2>What happens next</h2><p>The NTSB expects to publish a preliminary report within 30 days. No cause has been given, and no action against either crew has been announced. The airport remained operational, redirecting ground traffic to other taxiways. The collision came a day after the FAA's nationwide ground stop, but no official has linked the two events. For other aviation news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/united-airlines-tech-outage-flights-delayed-faa-ground-stop-20261118'>United Airlines outage report</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/jpmorgan-chase-outage-delays-us-bank-transactions-20261119'>Chase outage report</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say why the UPS aircraft moved into the Copa jet's path, and the NTSB has not issued a probable cause. The radio exchange is not an investigative finding, and no official cause has been given.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://theaviationhub.co.uk/miami-taxiway-collision-copa-ups/'>The Aviation Hub</a>; <a href='https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/airplane-crash-at-miami-airport-why-did-the-ups-cargo-plane-move-ahead-despite-being-told-to-give-way-to-copa-airlines/articleshow/135857151.cms'>Economic Times</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>शनिबार १४ नोभेम्बर राति करिब ९:१५ बजे मियामी अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय विमानस्थलको ट्याक्सीवेमा कोपा एयरलाइन्सको बोइङ ७३७ र UPS को बोइङ ७६७ ठोक्किए, जसमा दुई जना सामान्य घाइते भए। पनामा सिटीबाट भर्खरै अवतरण गरेको कोपा विमानको पखेटाको टुप्पोले बोगोटा जान लागेको UPS फ्रेटरको नाकमा ठोक्कियो। संघीय उड्डयन प्रशासन (FAA) र राष्ट्रिय यातायात सुरक्षा बोर्ड (NTSB) दुवैले अनुसन्धान गरिरहेका छन्।</p><p>कोपा उडान CM427 मा १६६ यात्रु र ६ चालक दल थिए। FAA ले हवाई यातायात नियन्त्रकहरूले UPS चालक दललाई कोपा उडानलाई बाटो दिन भनेको बताएको छ। NTSB ले UPS विमानलाई बाटो दिन भनिएको र नरोकिएको प्रारम्भिक जानकारी दिएको छ र UPS विमानमा ठूलो क्षति भएको बताएको छ। NTSB ले ३० दिनभित्र प्रारम्भिक प्रतिवेदन प्रकाशित गर्ने अपेक्षा गरिएको छ।</p><p>कुनै कारण दिइएको छैन र कुनै चालक दलविरुद्ध कारबाही घोषणा गरिएको छैन। विमानस्थल सञ्चालनमा रह्यो र जमिन यातायात अन्य ट्याक्सीवेमा सारियो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> The Aviation Hub; Economic Times।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://theaviationhub.co.uk/miami-taxiway-collision-copa-ups/', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/airplane-crash-at-miami-airport-why-did-the-ups-cargo-plane-move-ahead-despite-being-told-to-give-way-to-copa-airlines/articleshow/135857151.cms'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- hayley-williams-outbreak-fest-2027-headline-20261120 (pop-music; English 346 words; Nepali 115 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'hayley-williams-outbreak-fest-2027-headline-20261120', 'pop-music', 'UK',
'Hayley Williams to Headline Outbreak Fest 2027 Both Nights',
'हेली विलियम्सले आउटब्रेक फेस्ट २०२७ का दुवै रात हेडलाइन गर्ने',
'Hayley Williams will headline both nights of Outbreak Fest 2027 in Manchester, curating a bill led by Blood Orange, Dinosaur Jr and Julien Baker.',
'हेली विलियम्सले म्यानचेस्टरमा आउटब्रेक फेस्ट २०२७ का दुवै रात हेडलाइन गर्नेछिन्, ब्लड ओरेन्ज, डाइनोसर जुनियर र जुलियन बेकरसहितको लाइनअप तयार गर्दै।',
$$<p>Hayley Williams will headline both nights of Outbreak Fest 2027 in Manchester, curating the line-up herself. The Paramore singer brings The Hayley Williams Show to the B.E.C. Arena on Saturday 19 and Sunday 20 June 2027, with a different supporting bill each night. The first wave of 34 acts includes Blood Orange, Julien Baker, Dinosaur Jr, American Football and Wednesday.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Festival</td><td>Outbreak Fest 2027, B.E.C. Arena, Manchester</td></tr><tr><td>Dates</td><td>19-20 June 2027; a separate show on 18 June is still to be announced</td></tr><tr><td>Headliner</td><td>Hayley Williams, both nights, as The Hayley Williams Show</td></tr><tr><td>Saturday 19 June</td><td>Blood Orange, Julien Baker, Rico Nasty, Mannequin Pussy</td></tr><tr><td>Sunday 20 June</td><td>Dinosaur Jr, American Football, Wednesday, Citizen</td></tr><tr><td>Tickets</td><td>Presale 18 November 10am GMT; general sale Thursday 19 November 10am GMT</td></tr><tr><td>Charity</td><td>£1 from every ticket to Medical Aid for Palestinians and Not A Phase</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Hayley Williams Outbreak Fest 2027: the two nights</h2><p>Nobody on the Saturday bill is on the Sunday bill. The headliner is fixed and the rest is your call: Saturday has Blood Orange, Julien Baker, Rico Nasty and Mannequin Pussy, while Sunday has Dinosaur Jr, American Football, Wednesday and Citizen. Single-day tickets are on sale from the start this year alongside two-day passes, so fans can pick the side of the bill they want without paying for the other. Weekend ticket holders will be able to upgrade to include the Friday 18 June show once its line-up is revealed.</p><h2>Why this booking matters</h2><p>Outbreak started 15 years ago as a 100-capacity event dedicated to hardcore and punk, and it has grown into a major annual event at the B.E.C. Arena. Williams curated the 2027 line-up herself, and the shows will be her first performances in Manchester since sold-out headline shows at Manchester Academy in 2025. The festival announced the line-up on 16 November, with presale registration closing at midnight on 17 November and the general sale opening on Thursday 19 November at 10am GMT.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give ticket prices, and they do not name the Friday 18 June show. For more festival news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118'>Coachella 2027 line-up</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/gracie-abrams-daughter-from-hell-deluxe-november-20-20261118'>Gracie Abrams deluxe album</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://consequence.net/2026/11/outbreak-fest-2027-lineup-hayley-williams/'>Consequence</a>; <a href='https://www.nme.com/news/music/hayley-williams-to-headline-her-curated-outbreak-2027-manchester-line-up-with-blood-orange-julien-baker-dinosaur-jr-american-football-and-loads-more-3976183'>NME</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>हेली विलियम्सले म्यानचेस्टरमा आउटब्रेक फेस्ट २०२७ का दुवै रात हेडलाइन गर्नेछिन् र लाइनअप आफैं तयार गरेकी छन्। प्यारामोर गायिकाले १९ र २० जुन २०२७ मा B.E.C. एरिनामा 'द हेली विलियम्स शो' प्रस्तुत गर्नेछिन्, हरेक रात फरक सहायक कलाकारसहित। पहिलो चरणका ३४ कलाकारमा ब्लड ओरेन्ज, जुलियन बेकर, डाइनोसर जुनियर, अमेरिकन फुटबल र वेन्स्डे छन्।</p><p>शनिबार ब्लड ओरेन्ज, जुलियन बेकर, रिको नास्टी र म्यानेक्विन पुसी छन् भने आइतबार डाइनोसर जुनियर, अमेरिकन फुटबल, वेन्स्डे र सिटिजन छन्। एकल-दिन टिकट र दुई-दिन पास दुवै बिक्रीमा छन्। प्रिसेल १८ नोभेम्बर बिहान १० बजे GMT मा र सामान्य बिक्री बिहीबार १९ नोभेम्बर बिहान १० बजे GMT मा खुल्छ। प्रत्येक टिकटबाट £१ मेडिकल एड फर प्यालेस्टिनियन्स र नट अ फेजलाई जान्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Consequence; NME।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://consequence.net/2026/11/outbreak-fest-2027-lineup-hayley-williams/', 'https://www.nme.com/news/music/hayley-williams-to-headline-her-curated-outbreak-2027-manchester-line-up-with-blood-orange-julien-baker-dinosaur-jr-american-football-and-loads-more-3976183'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- dolly-parton-tributes-the-voice-macys-parade-20261120 (pop-music; English 326 words; Nepali 124 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'dolly-parton-tributes-the-voice-macys-parade-20261120', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'Dolly Parton Tributes: The Voice Night and Macys Parade Honour',
'डली पार्टन श्रद्धाञ्जलि: द भ्वाइस रात र मेसीज परेड सम्मान',
'Dolly Parton will be honoured on The Voice on 23 November and at the Macys Thanksgiving Day Parade on 26 November, with a Broadway musical to follow.',
'डली पार्टनलाई २३ नोभेम्बरमा द भ्वाइसमा र २६ नोभेम्बरमा मेसीज थ्याङ्क्सगिभिङ डे परेडमा सम्मान गरिनेछ, त्यसपछि ब्रोडवे म्युजिकल आउँदैछ।',
$$<p>Dolly Parton died on 25 August 2026, aged 80, and the tributes keep coming. After the Country Music Association honoured her at the CMA Awards on 18 November, two more tributes follow this week: a dedicated night on The Voice on Monday 23 November, and a tribute at the 100th Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade on Thursday 26 November. A Broadway musical about her life opens in January 2027.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Tribute</th><th>When</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>The Voice, Season 30</td><td>Monday 23 November, 9-10pm ET, NBC; Peacock 24 November</td><td>Dolly Parton tribute night; Top 10 contestants perform</td></tr><tr><td>Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade</td><td>Thursday 26 November, 8:30am, NBC and Peacock</td><td>100th edition; Broadway star Megan Hilty leads the tribute</td></tr><tr><td>DOLLY: A True Original Musical</td><td>Previews 7 December; opens 19 January 2027</td><td>St. James Theatre, Broadway; opens on her 81st birthday</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Dolly Parton tributes: The Voice and the Macys parade</h2><p>The Voice will devote its Monday 23 November episode, from 9 to 10pm ET on NBC, to Dolly Parton, with the Top 10 contestants performing her songs. The episode streams on Peacock the next day. Three days later, the 100th Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade airs on Thursday 26 November from 8:30am on NBC and Peacock, with Broadway star Megan Hilty leading the tribute to Parton.</p><h2>The Broadway musical</h2><p>DOLLY: A True Original Musical begins Broadway previews on 7 December and opens on 19 January 2027 at the St. James Theatre, which would have been Parton's 81st birthday. The musical tells the story of her life, from her childhood in the Smoky Mountains to her career as one of the most successful songwriters in history. For earlier coverage, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/dolly-parton-cma-awards-2026-tribute-20261117'>Dolly Parton CMA Awards tribute</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/dolly-parton-posthumous-grammy-nominations-2027-20261119'>Dolly Parton posthumous Grammy nominations</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not list which songs the Voice contestants will perform, and they do not say which performers will join Megan Hilty in the parade tribute. The CMA Awards tribute on 18 November is mentioned here only as context; it was covered in our earlier article.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.knoxnews.com/story/entertainment/music/2026/11/14/dolly-parton-tribute-during-2026-macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-megan-hilty/92762186007/'>Knox News</a>; <a href='https://fitbodymedia.com/blog/the-voice-announces-dolly-parton-tribute-night-heres-when-to-watch-the-special-episode/'>Fitbody Media</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>डली पार्टनको २५ अगस्ट २०२६ मा ८० वर्षको उमेरमा निधन भयो र श्रद्धाञ्जलि जारी छन्। कन्ट्री म्युजिक एसोसिएसनले १८ नोभेम्बरमा CMA अवार्डमा उनलाई सम्मान गरेपछि यस हप्ता थप दुई श्रद्धाञ्जलि आउँदैछन्: सोमबार २३ नोभेम्बरमा द भ्वाइसमा समर्पित रात र बिहीबार २६ नोभेम्बरमा १००औं मेसीज थ्याङ्क्सगिभिङ डे परेडमा श्रद्धाञ्जलि। उनको जीवनबारे ब्रोडवे म्युजिकल जनवरी २०२७ मा खुल्दैछ।</p><p>द भ्वाइसको २३ नोभेम्बर एपिसोड राति ९-१० बजे ET मा NBC मा प्रसारण हुन्छ, जसमा शीर्ष १० प्रतियोगीले उनका गीत गाउनेछन्। मेसीज परेड २६ नोभेम्बर बिहान ८:३० बजे NBC र पिककमा प्रसारण हुन्छ, ब्रोडवे स्टार मेगन हिल्टीले श्रद्धाञ्जलिको नेतृत्व गर्नेछिन्। 'DOLLY: A True Original Musical' ले ७ डिसेम्बरमा पूर्वावलोकन सुरु गर्छ र १९ जनवरी २०२७ मा सेन्ट जेम्स थिएटरमा खुल्छ, जुन उनको ८१औं जन्मदिन हुन्थ्यो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Knox News; Fitbody Media।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.knoxnews.com/story/entertainment/music/2026/11/14/dolly-parton-tribute-during-2026-macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-megan-hilty/92762186007/', 'https://fitbodymedia.com/blog/the-voice-announces-dolly-parton-tribute-night-heres-when-to-watch-the-special-episode/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- wicked-for-good-opens-november-21-box-office-preview-20261120 (pop-music; English 290 words; Nepali 113 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'wicked-for-good-opens-november-21-box-office-preview-20261120', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'Wicked For Good Opens 21 November: Box Office Preview',
'विकेड: फर गुड २१ नोभेम्बरमा खुल्दैछ: बक्स अफिस पूर्वावलोकन',
'Wicked For Good opens on 21 November with tracking of 112 to 155 million dollars in the US. Reviews, projections and what the first film did.',
'विकेड: फर गुड २१ नोभेम्बरमा खुल्दैछ, अमेरिकामा $११२-$१५५ मिलियन ट्र्याकिङसहित। समीक्षा, अनुमान र पहिलो फिल्मले के गर्‍यो।',
$$<p>Wicked: For Good opens in cinemas on Friday 21 November 2026, and the tracking is strong: Deadline projects a $112 to $115 million domestic opening, Box Office Theory goes as high as $155 million, and Universal expects about $125 million, with a global opening near $200 million. The first reviews are mixed to positive, and the film carries a budget of about $150 million. Here is the preview.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Measure</th><th>Wicked: For Good</th><th>First film (2024)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Rotten Tomatoes</td><td>About 73%</td><td>88%</td></tr><tr><td>Metacritic</td><td>About 61</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Popcornmeter</td><td>97%</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Domestic opening tracking</td><td>$112-$155 million</td><td>$112.5 million</td></tr><tr><td>Domestic total</td><td>-</td><td>$473.2 million</td></tr><tr><td>Worldwide total</td><td>-</td><td>$756.4 million</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Wicked For Good box office preview: the numbers</h2><p>The range of opening projections is wide, from $112 million at the low end to $155 million at the high end, with Universal's own expectation near $125 million. The first film opened to $112.5 million in November 2024 and finished with $473.2 million in the US and $756.4 million worldwide. The sequel needs a strong opening to cover its reported $150 million budget, and it arrives after a nine-week slump at the North American box office, with no weekend over $100 million. Early-access screenings run on 19 November.</p><h2>The film</h2><p>Jon M. Chu directs, with Ariana Grande as Glinda and Cynthia Erivo as Elphaba, returning from the first film. The first reviews are mixed to positive, with a Rotten Tomatoes score near 73 percent against 88 percent for the first film, while audiences are far warmer, with a 97 percent Popcornmeter score. For more, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/wicked-for-good-grammy-nominations-2027-for-good-20261119'>Wicked For Good Grammy nominations</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/hunger-games-sunrise-on-the-reaping-soundtrack-20261119'>Hunger Games soundtrack</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a final box office figure, because the film has not opened yet. This is a preview: no results are known, and none are invented here. The tracking figures are projections, not guarantees.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://biplob.iam.bd/wicked-for-good-box-office-tracking-112m-opening-projected-ahead-of-november-21-release/'>Biplob</a>; <a href='https://www.devicedaily.com/pin/wicked-for-good-box-office-predictions-review-roundup-and-more/'>DeviceDaily</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>विकेड: फर गुड शुक्रबार २१ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा सिनेमामा खुल्दैछ र ट्र्याकिङ बलियो छ: डेडलाइनले $११२-$११५ मिलियन घरेलु ओपनिङ, बक्स अफिस थ्योरीले $१५५ मिलियनसम्म र युनिभर्सलले करिब $१२५ मिलियन, विश्वव्यापी ओपनिङ करिब $२०० मिलियन अनुमान गरेको छ। पहिलो समीक्षा मिश्रितदेखि सकारात्मक छन् र फिल्मको बजेट करिब $१५० मिलियन छ।</p><p>पहिलो फिल्म नोभेम्बर २०२४ मा $११२.५ मिलियनमा खुल्यो र अमेरिकामा $४७३.२ मिलियन र विश्वभर $७५६.४ मिलियन कमायो। जोन एम. चु निर्देशक हुन्, एरियाना ग्रान्डे ग्लिन्डा र सिन्थिया एरिभो एल्फाबाका रूपमा फर्किएका छन्। रोटेन टमाटोज स्कोर करिब ७३ प्रतिशत छ, पहिलो फिल्मको ८८ प्रतिशतको तुलनामा, जबकि दर्शक स्कोर ९७ प्रतिशत छ।</p><p>यो पूर्वावलोकन हो: कुनै नतिजा थाहा छैन र यहाँ कुनै नतिजा कल्पना गरिएको छैन।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Biplob; DeviceDaily।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://biplob.iam.bd/wicked-for-good-box-office-tracking-112m-opening-projected-ahead-of-november-21-release/', 'https://www.devicedaily.com/pin/wicked-for-good-box-office-predictions-review-roundup-and-more/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- new-music-friday-november-20-releases-20261120 (pop-music; English 233 words; Nepali 93 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'new-music-friday-november-20-releases-20261120', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'New Music Friday 20 November: Bien, Toro y Moi and More',
'नयाँ संगीत शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बर: बिएन, टोरो इ मोइ र थप',
'New music arrives on Friday 20 November, led by Bien, Toro y Moi, Conway the Machine and Trivium. The albums, singles and vinyl to know.',
'शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बरमा नयाँ संगीत आउँदैछ, बिएन, टोरो इ मोइ, कन्वे द मेसिन र ट्रिभियमको नेतृत्वमा। एल्बम, सिंगल र भिनाइल।',
$$<p>New music arrives on Friday 20 November 2026, led by a 17-track album from Bien of Sauti Sol, a new record from Toro y Moi, and Conway the Machine's OTIS, which brings in Wu-Tang legends and the Goo Goo Dolls. Rock and metal fans get new albums from Down and Trivium, and Phoebe Bridgers appears on a new single. Here is the release day, track by track.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Artist</th><th>Release</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bien (Sauti Sol)</td><td>Alusa Continua</td><td>17-track album</td></tr><tr><td>Toro y Moi</td><td>Unusua</td><td>New album</td></tr><tr><td>Conway the Machine</td><td>OTIS</td><td>New album; Wu-Tang legends and Goo Goo Dolls feature</td></tr><tr><td>Ari Balouzian and Phoebe Bridgers</td><td>Primetime</td><td>New single</td></tr><tr><td>Down</td><td>Volume V</td><td>New album</td></tr><tr><td>Trivium</td><td>Crown in the Grave</td><td>New album</td></tr><tr><td>Becky Hill</td><td>Rebecca</td><td>Vinyl release</td></tr><tr><td>Angelus Apatrida, Disfear, Suicide Silence</td><td>New albums</td><td>Rock and metal releases</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>New Music Friday: the albums to hear</h2><p>Bien, the Sauti Sol frontman, releases Alusa Continua, a 17-track album that leads the African new music slate for the week. Toro y Moi returns with Unusua, and Conway the Machine releases OTIS, an album that brings Wu-Tang legends together with the Goo Goo Dolls. Down release Volume V and Trivium release Crown in the Grave, while Becky Hill's Rebecca arrives on vinyl. Ari Balouzian teams up with Phoebe Bridgers on the single Primetime.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give chart positions or streaming numbers for the new releases, because they have not been released yet. For more new music, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/gracie-abrams-daughter-from-hell-deluxe-november-20-20261118'>Gracie Abrams deluxe album</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/hunger-games-sunrise-on-the-reaping-soundtrack-20261119'>Hunger Games soundtrack</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://afroyard.net/new-african-music-releases-november-2026/'>AfroYard</a>; <a href='https://loudwire.com/2026-hard-rock-metal-album-release-calendar/'>Loudwire</a>; <a href='https://www.normanrecords.com/features/upcoming-album-releases/'>Norman Records</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>शुक्रबार २० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा नयाँ संगीत आउँदैछ, साउटी सोलका बिएनको १७-ट्र्याक एल्बम, टोरो इ मोइको नयाँ रेकर्ड र कन्वे द मेसिनको OTIS को नेतृत्वमा, जसमा वु-ट्याङ लिजेन्ड र गु गु डल्स छन्। रक र मेटल प्रशंसकलाई डाउन र ट्रिभियमका नयाँ एल्बम मिल्छन् र फिबी ब्रिजर्स नयाँ सिंगलमा देखा पर्छिन्।</p><p>बिएनले 'अलुसा कन्टिनुआ' (१७ ट्र्याक) रिलिज गर्दैछन्। टोरो इ मोइले 'उनुसुआ', कन्वे द मेसिनले 'OTIS', डाउनले 'भोल्युम V' र ट्रिभियमले 'क्राउन इन द ग्रेभ' रिलिज गर्दैछन्। बेकी हिलको 'रेबेका' भिनाइलमा आउँदैछ। एरी बालुजियन र फिबी ब्रिजर्सको सिंगल 'प्राइमटाइम' पनि आउँदैछ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> AfroYard; Loudwire; Norman Records।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://afroyard.net/new-african-music-releases-november-2026/', 'https://loudwire.com/2026-hard-rock-metal-album-release-calendar/', 'https://www.normanrecords.com/features/upcoming-album-releases/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- grammy-2027-album-of-the-year-race-20261120 (pop-music; English 314 words; Nepali 135 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'grammy-2027-album-of-the-year-race-20261120', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'Grammy 2027 Album of the Year Race: Eight Albums, One Prize',
'ग्रामी २०२७ एल्बम अफ द इयर दौड: आठ एल्बम, एक पुरस्कार',
'The 69th Grammy Awards are set for 7 February 2027, and the Album of the Year race is eight strong, led by RAYE with 11 nominations. The full field.',
'६९औं ग्रामी अवार्ड ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा हुँदैछ र एल्बम अफ द इयर दौड आठ बलियो छ, रेयीले ११ मनोनयनसहित नेतृत्व गरेकी छन्। पूरा क्षेत्र।',
$$<p>The 69th Grammy Awards are set for Sunday 7 February 2027 at the Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles, and the Album of the Year race is eight strong. Nominations were announced on Monday 16 November, and RAYE leads the whole field with 11 nominations. The Album of the Year field runs from Phoebe Bridgers to Taylor Swift, with only one man in it. Here is the full race.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Artist</th><th>Album</th><th>Nominations</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>RAYE</td><td>This Music May Contain Hope.</td><td>11 (leads the field)</td></tr><tr><td>Rosalía</td><td>LUX (Complete Works)</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>Phoebe Bridgers</td><td>Lost Weekend</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>Olivia Rodrigo</td><td>You Seem Pretty Sad for a Girl So in Love</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>Olivia Dean</td><td>The Art of Loving</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>Bruno Mars</td><td>The Romantic</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>Taylor Swift</td><td>The Life of a Showgirl</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>Ella Langley</td><td>Dandelion</td><td>-</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Grammy Album of the Year race: the eight nominees</h2><p>RAYE leads the field with 11 nominations for This Music May Contain Hope., and her song Where Is My Husband! is up for both Record of the Year and Song of the Year. Rosalía follows with 9 nominations for LUX (Complete Works). Phoebe Bridgers is nominated for Lost Weekend, Olivia Dean for The Art of Loving, Ella Langley for Dandelion and Olivia Rodrigo for You Seem Pretty Sad for a Girl So in Love. Bruno Mars is the only man in the Album of the Year race, nominated for The Romantic, and Taylor Swift is nominated for The Life of a Showgirl with 5 nominations in total.</p><h2>How the race works</h2><p>The eligibility period ran from 31 August 2025 to 28 August 2026, and final voting runs from 10 December 2026 to 7 January 2027. The ceremony is on Sunday 7 February 2027 at the Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles. For more Grammy coverage, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/raye-leads-grammy-nominations-2027-eleven-20261117'>RAYE leads the Grammy nominations with eleven</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/rosalia-grammy-nominations-2027-nine-lux-20261117'>Rosalía Grammy nominations</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not predict a winner, and no winner is known yet. This is a race guide, not a result: the ceremony is in February 2027.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.hollywoodchicago.com/news/the-nominees-are-in-raye-leads-the-69th-grammy-awards/'>Hollywood Chicago</a>; <a href='https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/2027-69th-grammy-awards-nominations-full-list'>Hypebeast</a>; <a href='https://www.cnbctv18.com/entertainment/raye-leads-69th-grammy-awards-nominations-with-11-nods-full-list-of-nominees-20035428.htm'>CNBC-TV18</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>६९औं ग्रामी अवार्ड आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा लस एन्जलसको क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिनामा हुँदैछ र एल्बम अफ द इयर दौड आठ बलियो छ। मनोनयन सोमबार १६ नोभेम्बरमा घोषणा भयो र रेयीले ११ मनोनयनसहित सम्पूर्ण क्षेत्रको नेतृत्व गरेकी छन्।</p><p>रेहरू 'दिस म्युजिक मे कन्टेन होप' का लागि ११ मनोनयनसहित अग्रणी छिन् र उनको गीत 'ह्वेयर इज माइ हस्ब्यान्ड!' रेकर्ड अफ द इयर र सङ अफ द इयर दुवैमा छ। रोसालिया 'LUX (Complete Works)' का लागि ९, फिबी ब्रिजर्स 'लस्ट विकेन्ड' का लागि ७, ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो ७, ओलिभिया डिन ६, ब्रुनो मार्स 'द रोमान्टिक' का लागि ६ र टेलर स्विफ्ट 'द लाइफ अफ अ शोगर्ल' का लागि ५ मनोनयनमा छन्। एला ल्याङ्ली 'ड्यान्डेलियन' का लागि मनोनित छिन्। ब्रुनो मार्स दौडमा एकमात्र पुरुष हुन्।</p><p>अन्तिम मतदान १० डिसेम्बर २०२६ देखि ७ जनवरी २०२७ सम्म चल्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Hollywood Chicago; Hypebeast; CNBC-TV18।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.hollywoodchicago.com/news/the-nominees-are-in-raye-leads-the-69th-grammy-awards/', 'https://hypebeast.com/2026/11/2027-69th-grammy-awards-nominations-full-list', 'https://www.cnbctv18.com/entertainment/raye-leads-69th-grammy-awards-nominations-with-11-nods-full-list-of-nominees-20035428.htm'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- bts-mma-2026-six-wins-aria-award-20261120 (pop-music; English 409 words; Nepali 149 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'bts-mma-2026-six-wins-aria-award-20261120', 'pop-music', 'South Korea',
'BTS Sweep Melon Music Awards With Six Wins and ARIA Honour',
'BTS ले मेलन म्युजिक अवार्डमा छ जित र ARIA सम्मान हात पार्‍यो',
'BTS swept the 2026 Melon Music Awards with six wins, including Album of the Year for ARIRANG, and took Most Popular International Artist at the ARIA Awards.',
'BTS ले २०२६ मेलन म्युजिक अवार्डमा ARIRANG का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयरसहित छ जित हात पार्‍यो र ARIA अवार्डमा मोस्ट पपुलर इन्टरनेसनल आर्टिस्ट जित्यो।',
$$<p>BTS swept the 2026 Melon Music Awards with six wins, including the Album of the Year Daesang for ARIRANG, and then won Most Popular International Artist at the 40th ARIA Awards in Sydney on 18 November. The Melon wins came at the Gocheok Sky Dome in Seoul on 14 and 15 November, and the ARIA win was decided by public vote, beating Ed Sheeran, Harry Styles and Taylor Swift.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Melon Music Awards 2026</td><td>Six wins, including Album of the Year (Daesang) for ARIRANG</td></tr><tr><td>ARIRANG</td><td>5th studio album, released 20 March 2026; first full-group album in 3 years 9 months after military service; title track Swim</td></tr><tr><td>Billboard 200</td><td>ARIRANG at No. 62 on the 14 November chart, 33rd consecutive week; debuted at No. 1, 3 weeks at the top</td></tr><tr><td>Italy</td><td>First K-pop album certified platinum in Italy (FIMI, 2 November, 50,000 units)</td></tr><tr><td>ARIA Awards 2026</td><td>Most Popular International Artist, public vote, 18 November</td></tr><tr><td>World tour</td><td>ARIRANG World Tour Asia leg starts 19 November in Kaohsiung; 34 stadiums, 23 countries, April 2026 to March 2027</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>BTS Melon Music Awards: six wins for ARIRANG</h2><p>ARIRANG is BTS's fifth studio album, released on 20 March 2026, and their first full-group album in three years and nine months after military service. The album's title track is Swim, which made Apple Music's Best Songs of 2026 list, the only K-pop group track on the 100-song list. ARIRANG debuted at No. 1 on the Billboard 200 and spent three weeks at the top, and it was still on the chart at No. 62 on 14 November, its 33rd consecutive week. It is also the first K-pop album certified platinum in Italy, with 50,000 units recognised by FIMI on 2 November.</p><h2>The ARIA win and the tour</h2><p>At the 40th ARIA Awards on 18 November, BTS won Most Popular International Artist by public vote, beating Ed Sheeran, Harry Styles and Taylor Swift. The ARIRANG World Tour continues with its Asia leg starting on 19 November in Kaohsiung, with shows on 19, 21 and 22 November, then Bangkok, Kuala Lumpur, Singapore and Jakarta through 29 December. The tour covers 34 stadiums in 23 countries from April 2026 to March 2027. For more BTS coverage, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/bts-grammy-awards-2027-asian-pop-category-boycott-20261119'>BTS Grammy Awards boycott story</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/kids-choice-awards-2026-winners-bts-rose-bruno-mars-20261119'>Kids Choice Awards winners</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not list all six Melon Music Awards wins by category, and they do not give ticket prices for the tour. The ARIA win and the Melon sweep are reported as announced.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.allkpop.com/article/2026/11/bts-wins-album-of-the-year-for-arirang-at-mma2026'>allkpop</a>; <a href='https://gulfnews.com/entertainment/bts-sweep-mma-2026-with-six-wins-including-both-top-honours-1.500748622'>Gulf News</a>; <a href='https://www.filmibeat.com/hollywood/news/2026/40th-aria-awards-2026-full-winners-list-with-names-tame-impala-sweeps-7-awards-bts-beats-ed-sheeran-538455.html'>Filmibeat</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>BTS ले २०२६ मेलन म्युजिक अवार्डमा छ जित हात पार्‍यो, जसमा ARIRANG का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर (देसाङ) पनि छ, र त्यसपछि १८ नोभेम्बरमा सिड्नीमा भएको ४०औं ARIA अवार्डमा मोस्ट पपुलर इन्टरनेसनल आर्टिस्ट जित्यो। मेलन जित १४ र १५ नोभेम्बरमा सोलको गोचेओक स्काई डोममा आयो र ARIA जित सार्वजनिक मतबाट भएको थियो, जसमा एड शिरन, ह्यारी स्टाइल्स र टेलर स्विफ्टलाई पछाडि पारियो।</p><p>ARIRANG BTS को पाँचौं स्टुडियो एल्बम हो, २० मार्च २०२६ मा रिलिज भएको, सैन्य सेवापछि तीन वर्ष नौ महिनामा पहिलो पूर्ण-समूह एल्बम। शीर्षक ट्र्याक 'स्विम' एप्पल म्युजिकको २०२६ का उत्कृष्ट गीत सूचीमा पर्‍यो। एल्बम बिलबोर्ड २०० मा नम्बर १ मा डेब्यु गर्‍यो र १४ नोभेम्बरमा ३३औं लगातार हप्तामा नम्बर ६२ मा थियो। इटालीमा प्लेटिनम प्रमाणित हुने पहिलो के-पप एल्बम पनि यही हो।</p><p>ARIRANG विश्व भ्रमणको एसिया चरण १९ नोभेम्बरमा काओसियुङबाट सुरु हुन्छ र २३ देशका ३४ स्टेडियममा अप्रिल २०२६ देखि मार्च २०२७ सम्म चल्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> allkpop; Gulf News; Filmibeat।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.allkpop.com/article/2026/11/bts-wins-album-of-the-year-for-arirang-at-mma2026', 'https://gulfnews.com/entertainment/bts-sweep-mma-2026-with-six-wins-including-both-top-honours-1.500748622', 'https://www.filmibeat.com/hollywood/news/2026/40th-aria-awards-2026-full-winners-list-with-names-tame-impala-sweeps-7-awards-bts-beats-ed-sheeran-538455.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- sabrina-carpenter-johnnie-walker-film-chazelle-20261120 (pop-music; English 314 words; Nepali 105 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'sabrina-carpenter-johnnie-walker-film-chazelle-20261120', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'Sabrina Carpenter Stars in Johnnie Walker Film by Chazelle',
'सब्रिना कार्पेन्टरले चाजेलेको जोनी वाकर फिल्ममा अभिनय गरिन्',
'Sabrina Carpenter stars in a Johnnie Walker film directed by Damien Chazelle, released on 10 November. The French New Wave story and the partnership.',
'सब्रिना कार्पेन्टरले डेमियन चाजेले निर्देशित जोनी वाकर फिल्ममा अभिनय गरेकी छन्, १० नोभेम्बरमा रिलिज। फ्रेन्च न्यु वेभ कथा र साझेदारी।',
$$<p>Sabrina Carpenter stars in a Johnnie Walker film directed by Damien Chazelle, the director of La La Land and Whiplash, released on 10 November 2026. The film is inspired by the French New Wave and tells her Keep Walking story, the story of how she became one of pop's biggest stars. It is the centrepiece of a multi-year partnership with Johnnie Walker Black Label that began in August 2025.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Film</td><td>Johnnie Walker film starring Sabrina Carpenter, directed by Damien Chazelle</td></tr><tr><td>Released</td><td>10 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Style</td><td>French New Wave-inspired; tells her Keep Walking story</td></tr><tr><td>Partnership</td><td>Multi-year Black Label partnership since August 2025, timed to Man's Best Friend album</td></tr><tr><td>Drink</td><td>Signature Go Go Highball; limited-edition Black Label bottle, launched September 2026, UK first</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Sabrina Carpenter Johnnie Walker film: the story</h2><p>The film tells the story of Carpenter's rise, from her early days to the release of her album Man's Best Friend in August 2025, when the Johnnie Walker partnership began. Chazelle, who won an Oscar for La La Land, directs in a French New Wave style, with the film shot as a love letter to the movement. The partnership centres on the Go Go Highball, Carpenter's signature drink, and a limited-edition Black Label bottle that launched in September 2026 in the UK first, at the standard Black Label price, rolling out across Europe, Australia and North America.</p><h2>What is in the bottle</h2><p>There is no new whisky in the limited-edition bottle: it is standard Johnnie Walker Black Label in a Carpenter-designed bottle. That is the point of the partnership, which is about the story and the drink, not a new liquid. For more Sabrina coverage, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/sabrina-carpenter-grammy-nominations-2027-pop-duo-group-20261118'>Sabrina Carpenter Grammy nominations</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/cma-awards-2026-guide-taylor-swift-ella-langley-20261118'>CMA Awards guide</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give the film's length or say where it can be watched in full, and they do not give the price of the limited-edition bottle beyond the standard Black Label price.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.bevnet.com/pr/2026/11/11/johnnie-walker-and-sabrina-carpenter-keep-walking-story'>BevNET</a>; <a href='https://www.12x75.com/sabrina-carpenter-johnnie-walker-damien-chazelle/'>12x75</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>सब्रिना कार्पेन्टरले ला ला ल्यान्ड र ह्विपल्यासका निर्देशक डेमियन चाजेले निर्देशित जोनी वाकर फिल्ममा अभिनय गरेकी छन्, जुन १० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा रिलिज भयो। फिल्म फ्रेन्च न्यु वेभबाट प्रेरित छ र उनको 'किप वाकिङ' कथा, उनी कसरी पपकी ठूली स्टार बनिन् भन्ने कथा, बताउँछ। यो अगस्ट २०२५ मा सुरु भएको जोनी वाकर ब्ल्याक लेबलसँगको बहुवर्षीय साझेदारीको केन्द्र हो।</p><p>साझेदारी उनको हस्ताक्षर पेय गो गो हाइबल र सेप्टेम्बर २०२६ मा बेलायतमा पहिलो पटक लन्च भएको सीमित-संस्करण ब्ल्याक लेबल बोतलमा केन्द्रित छ, जुन युरोप, अस्ट्रेलिया र उत्तर अमेरिकामा विस्तार हुँदैछ। सीमित-संस्करण बोतलमा नयाँ ह्विस्की छैन: यो कार्पेन्टरले डिजाइन गरेको बोतलमा मानक जोनी वाकर ब्ल्याक लेबल हो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> BevNET; 12x75।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.bevnet.com/pr/2026/11/11/johnnie-walker-and-sabrina-carpenter-keep-walking-story', 'https://www.12x75.com/sabrina-carpenter-johnnie-walker-damien-chazelle/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- tame-impala-aria-awards-2026-seven-wins-20261120 (pop-music; English 340 words; Nepali 143 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'tame-impala-aria-awards-2026-seven-wins-20261120', 'pop-music', 'Australia',
'Tame Impala Sweep Seven ARIA Awards With Album of the Year',
'टेम इम्पालाले एल्बम अफ द इयरसहित सात ARIA पुरस्कार जित्यो',
'Tame Impala won seven awards at the 40th ARIA Awards, including Album of the Year for Deadbeat and Song of the Year for Dracula. The full winners list.',
'टेम इम्पालाले ४०औं ARIA अवार्डमा सात पुरस्कार जित्यो, डेडबिटका लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर र ड्राकुलाका लागि सङ अफ द इयरसहित। पूरा विजेता सूची।',
$$<p>Tame Impala won seven awards at the 40th ARIA Awards in Sydney on Wednesday 18 November, the biggest haul of the night. Kevin Parker's project took Album of the Year for Deadbeat, Best Solo Artist, Song of the Year and Best Pop Release for Dracula, both studio awards for Deadbeat, and the Global Impact Award. The haul ties John Farnham's all-time record of 22 career ARIA wins.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Award</th><th>Winner</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>Tame Impala, Deadbeat</td></tr><tr><td>Best Solo Artist</td><td>Tame Impala, Deadbeat</td></tr><tr><td>Song of the Year</td><td>Tame Impala, Dracula (public vote)</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Release</td><td>Tame Impala, Dracula</td></tr><tr><td>Best Engineered Release</td><td>Kevin Parker for Tame Impala, Deadbeat</td></tr><tr><td>Best Produced Release</td><td>Kevin Parker for Tame Impala, Deadbeat</td></tr><tr><td>Global Impact Award</td><td>Tame Impala (presented by Darren Hayes)</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Tame Impala ARIA Awards: seven wins for Deadbeat</h2><p>Deadbeat is Parker's fifth studio album, and it gave him his fourth Album of the Year trophy, after Lonerism in 2013, Currents in 2015 and The Slow Rush in 2020. Its lead single Dracula won both Song of the Year, decided by public vote, and Best Pop Release. Parker won six of his eight nominations, plus the honorary Global Impact Award, which recognises Australian artists' success overseas. The only two he lost were Best Alternative Release and Best Dance or Electronic Release.</p><h2>The rest of the night</h2><p>Ecca Vandal was the night's second-biggest winner, converting seven nominations into four awards for Looking For People to Unfollow, including Breakthrough Artist, Best Independent Release and Best Alternative Release. DMA'S won Best Group and Best Rock Album, and G Flip won two public-voted awards, Best Australian Live Act and Best Video for Bed On Fire. BTS won Most Popular International Artist. Genesis Owusu, who went into the night tied with Tame Impala on eight nominations, did not win. For more, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118'>Coachella 2027 line-up</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/bts-grammy-awards-2027-asian-pop-category-boycott-20261119'>BTS Grammy Awards story</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give the full winners list for all 29 categories in one place, and they do not say whether Parker performed at the ceremony. The seven wins are confirmed across the sources cited.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.tvcentral.com.au/free-to-air/ten-news/2026-aria-awards-winners-tame-impala-channel-10/'>TV Central</a>; <a href='https://musicfeeds.com.au/news/2026-aria-awards-tame-impala-ecca-vandal-dominate-full-winners-list/'>Music Feeds</a>; <a href='https://www.filmibeat.com/hollywood/news/2026/40th-aria-awards-2026-full-winners-list-with-names-tame-impala-sweeps-7-awards-bts-beats-ed-sheeran-538455.html'>Filmibeat</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>टेम इम्पालाले बुधबार १८ नोभेम्बरमा सिड्नीमा भएको ४०औं ARIA अवार्डमा सात पुरस्कार जित्यो, रातको सबैभन्दा ठूलो उपलब्धि। केभिन पार्करको परियोजनाले 'डेडबिट' का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर, बेस्ट सोलो आर्टिस्ट, 'ड्राकुला' का लागि सङ अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप रिलिज, डेडबिटका लागि दुवै स्टुडियो पुरस्कार र ग्लोबल इम्प्याक्ट अवार्ड जित्यो। यो उपलब्धिले जोन फार्नह्यामको २२ करियर ARIA जितको सर्वकालीन रेकर्ड बराबर गर्‍यो।</p><p>डेडबिट पार्करको पाँचौं स्टुडियो एल्बम हो र यसले उनलाई चौथो एल्बम अफ द इयर ट्रफी दियो, लोनरिज्म (२०१३), करेन्ट्स (२०१५) र द स्लो रस (२०२०) पछि। प्रमुख सिंगल ड्राकुलाले सार्वजनिक मतबाट सङ अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप रिलिज दुवै जित्यो।</p><p>एक्का भ्यान्डल रातको दोस्रो ठूली विजेता थिइन्, सात मनोनयनबाट चार पुरस्कार जितिन्। DMA'S ले बेस्ट ग्रुप र बेस्ट रक एल्बम जित्यो, G Flip ले दुई सार्वजनिक-मत पुरस्कार जित्यो र BTS ले मोस्ट पपुलर इन्टरनेसनल आर्टिस्ट जित्यो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> TV Central; Music Feeds; Filmibeat।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.tvcentral.com.au/free-to-air/ten-news/2026-aria-awards-winners-tame-impala-channel-10/', 'https://musicfeeds.com.au/news/2026-aria-awards-tame-impala-ecca-vandal-dominate-full-winners-list/', 'https://www.filmibeat.com/hollywood/news/2026/40th-aria-awards-2026-full-winners-list-with-names-tame-impala-sweeps-7-awards-bts-beats-ed-sheeran-538455.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- tyla-apop-world-tour-south-africa-uncle-waffles-20261120 (pop-music; English 237 words; Nepali 103 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'tyla-apop-world-tour-south-africa-uncle-waffles-20261120', 'pop-music', 'South Africa',
'Tyla A Pop World Tour: Uncle Waffles Joins South Africa Shows',
'टाइला ए पप वर्ल्ड टुर: अंकल वाफल्स दक्षिण अफ्रिका शोमा सामेल',
'Uncle Waffles joins Tyla A Pop World Tour shows in Cape Town and Pretoria in January 2027. The dates, the line-up and the album behind the tour.',
'अंकल वाफल्स जनवरी २०२७ मा केप टाउन र प्रिटोरियामा टाइला ए पप वर्ल्ड टुर शोमा सामेल हुँदैछिन्। मिति, लाइनअप र भ्रमण पछाडिको एल्बम।',
$$<p>Uncle Waffles joins Tyla's A Pop World Tour for the South Africa shows in January 2027, it was announced on 18 November. The amapiano star plays Cape Town on 4 January 2027 at the Green Point Track and Pretoria on 8 and 9 January 2027 at the SunBet Arena, alongside MaWhoo, Liquideep and others. It is the biggest homecoming of Tyla's tour so far.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Show</th><th>Date</th><th>Venue</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cape Town</td><td>Sunday 4 January 2027</td><td>Green Point Track</td></tr><tr><td>Pretoria</td><td>Friday 8 January 2027</td><td>SunBet Arena</td></tr><tr><td>Pretoria</td><td>Saturday 9 January 2027</td><td>SunBet Arena</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Tyla A Pop World Tour: the South Africa shows</h2><p>Uncle Waffles, one of South Africa's biggest amapiano stars, joins Tyla for all three South Africa shows, with MaWhoo, Liquideep and others also on the bill. The tour is Tyla's first full headline world tour, with 34 dates, and it is the largest tour by a South African artist in 2026. Her second studio album, A Pop, reached No. 1 on the Billboard US World Albums chart and No. 3 on the UK R and B Albums chart, and her latest EP, 4 DA STREETS!, came out in May 2026.</p><h2>Where the tour goes next</h2><p>After South Africa, the tour continues through North America and then Australia. For more tour news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118'>Coachella 2027 line-up</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/gracie-abrams-daughter-from-hell-deluxe-november-20-20261118'>Gracie Abrams deluxe album</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give ticket prices for the South Africa shows, and they do not list the full supporting line-up for each date.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://iol.co.za/entertainment/music/2026-11-18-uncle-waffles-joins-tylas-apop-world-tour-in-south-africa/'>IOL</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>अंकल वाफल्सले जनवरी २०२७ मा दक्षिण अफ्रिकाका शोका लागि टाइलाको ए पप वर्ल्ड टुरमा सामेल हुँदैछिन्, १८ नोभेम्बरमा घोषणा गरियो। अमापियानो स्टारले ४ जनवरी २०२७ मा केप टाउनको ग्रीन पोइन्ट ट्र्याकमा र ८ र ९ जनवरी २०२७ मा प्रिटोरियाको सनबेट एरिनामा प्रस्तुति दिनेछिन्, मा ह्वू, लिक्विडिप र अन्यसँगै।</p><p>यो भ्रमण टाइलाको पहिलो पूर्ण हेडलाइन विश्व भ्रमण हो, ३४ मितिसहित, र २०२६ मा दक्षिण अफ्रिकी कलाकारको सबैभन्दा ठूलो भ्रमण हो। उनको दोस्रो स्टुडियो एल्बम 'ए पप' बिलबोर्ड US वर्ल्ड एल्बम चार्टमा नम्बर १ र UK R and B एल्बम चार्टमा नम्बर ३ मा पुग्यो। उनको पछिल्लो EP '4 DA STREETS!' मे २०२६ मा आयो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> IOL।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://iol.co.za/entertainment/music/2026-11-18-uncle-waffles-joins-tylas-apop-world-tour-in-south-africa/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- aj-mclean-solo-tour-backstreet-boys-sphere-20261120 (pop-music; English 319 words; Nepali 100 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'aj-mclean-solo-tour-backstreet-boys-sphere-20261120', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'AJ McLean Solo Tour: Backstreet Boy Goes It Alone in 2026',
'एजे म्याक्लिन एकल भ्रमण: ब्याकस्ट्रिट ब्वाय २०२६ मा एक्लै',
'AJ McLean is on his first solo tour, Alexander James: The Better Man Tour, and told Page Six the first stop felt daunting without his bandmates. The story.',
'एजे म्याक्लिन आफ्नो पहिलो एकल भ्रमण, अलेक्जेन्डर जेम्स: द बेटर म्यान टुरमा छन् र पेज सिक्सलाई पहिलो स्टप ब्यान्ड साथीहरूबिना डरलाग्दो लागेको बताए।',
$$<p>AJ McLean is on his first solo tour, Alexander James: The Better Man Tour, and he told Page Six on 18 November that the first stop felt daunting without his bandmates. The Backstreet Boys singer, who has performed with Nick Carter, Brian Littrell, Kevin Richardson and Howie Dorough since the group formed in 1993, said the realism sunk in when he walked on stage alone. The tour started in October 2026.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tour</td><td>Alexander James: The Better Man Tour, first solo tour, started October 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Group</td><td>Backstreet Boys, formed 1993: Nick Carter, Brian Littrell, Kevin Richardson, Howie Dorough, AJ McLean</td></tr><tr><td>What he said</td><td>First stop felt daunting without his bandmates; the realism sunk in</td></tr><tr><td>Band news</td><td>Backstreet Boys still perform together, including Drake's 40th birthday</td></tr><tr><td>Next</td><td>Return to Las Vegas Sphere for holiday and New Year Into The Millennium residency</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>AJ McLean solo tour: going it alone</h2><p>McLean has spent more than three decades on stage with the Backstreet Boys, one of the best-selling boy bands in history, so a solo tour is a different kind of stage. He told Page Six that the first stop of the Alexander James tour felt daunting, because for the first time there were no bandmates beside him. The tour takes its name from his full name, Alexander James McLean, and from the Better Man theme of the show.</p><h2>The band is not breaking up</h2><p>McLean stressed that the solo tour does not mean the end of the Backstreet Boys. The group still performs together, including a recent appearance at Drake's 40th birthday, and they return to the Las Vegas Sphere for a holiday and New Year residency called Into The Millennium. For more pop news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/coachella-2027-lineup-dua-lipa-sza-tame-impala-20261118'>Coachella 2027 line-up</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/kids-choice-awards-2026-winners-bts-rose-bruno-mars-20261119'>Kids Choice Awards winners</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not list the tour dates or venues, and they do not say how long the solo tour runs. The Page Six interview is the only source for McLean's comments.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://pagesix.com/2026/11/18/entertainment/aj-mclean-details-daunting-solo-tour-without-backstreet-boys-bandmates-the-realism-sunk-in/'>Page Six</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>एजे म्याक्लिन आफ्नो पहिलो एकल भ्रमण, 'अलेक्जेन्डर जेम्स: द बेटर म्यान टुर' मा छन् र उनले १८ नोभेम्बरमा पेज सिक्सलाई बताए कि ब्यान्ड साथीहरूबिना पहिलो स्टप डरलाग्दो लाग्यो। ब्याकस्ट्रिट ब्वाइज गायक, जसले समूह १९९३ मा गठन भएदेखि निक कार्टर, ब्रायन लिट्रेल, केभिन रिचर्डसन र होवी डोरोसँग प्रस्तुति दिँदै आएका छन्, उनले एक्लै स्टेजमा हिँड्दा वास्तविकता बुझिएको बताए। भ्रमण अक्टोबर २०२६ मा सुरु भयो।</p><p>म्याक्लिनले एकल भ्रमणले ब्याकस्ट्रिट ब्वाइजको अन्त्य होइन भनेर जोड दिए। समूह अझै सँगै प्रस्तुति दिन्छ, भर्खरै ड्रेकको ४०औं जन्मदिनमा समेत, र उनीहरू बिदा र नयाँ वर्षका लागि लस भेगास स्फियरमा 'इन्टु द मिलेनियम' रेसिडेन्सीका लागि फर्कँदैछन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Page Six।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://pagesix.com/2026/11/18/entertainment/aj-mclean-details-daunting-solo-tour-without-backstreet-boys-bandmates-the-realism-sunk-in/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- java4shell-cve-2026-114938-openjdk-patch-20261120 (tech-ai; English 346 words; Nepali 126 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'java4shell-cve-2026-114938-openjdk-patch-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Java4Shell CVE-2026-114938: Patch OpenJDK Now, Oracle Urges',
'जाभा4शेल CVE-2026-114938: ओराकलले OpenJDK तुरुन्त प्याच गर्न आग्रह गर्‍यो',
'Java4Shell, a critical flaw in Java Base64 code, lets attackers run code without logging in. Oracle patched it 17 November. Who is affected and how to fix it.',
'जाभा4शेल, जाभा बेस64 कोडमा गम्भीर त्रुटि, जसले आक्रमणकारीलाई लगइन नगरी कोड चलाउन दिन्छ। ओराकलले १७ नोभेम्बरमा प्याच गर्‍यो। को प्रभावित छ र कसरी फिक्स गर्ने।',
$$<p>Java4Shell, a critical flaw in Java's Base64 code, lets attackers run code on some servers without logging in. Oracle patched it on 17 November 2026, the same day security firm Calif disclosed it, and the US Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA) issued an alert urging organisations to patch immediately. No exploitation in the wild had been confirmed as of 17 November.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Flaw</td><td>CVE-2026-114938, Java4Shell; heap buffer overflow in the OpenJDK Base64 decoder</td></tr><tr><td>Severity</td><td>CVSS 4.0: 9.2 (Calif); CVSS 3.1: 8.1 (Oracle); Red Hat preliminary 9.8</td></tr><tr><td>Disclosed</td><td>17 November 2026 by Calif; researcher Quang Luong found it with OpenAI Codex in about an hour</td></tr><tr><td>Affected</td><td>OpenJDK 17.0.6 and later, including lines 17, 21, 25 and 27; x86-64 CPUs with AVX-512 VBMI only</td></tr><tr><td>Fixed builds</td><td>17.0.21.1, 21.0.13.1, 25.0.5.1, 27.0.1.1</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Java4Shell: what the flaw does</h2><p>The bug sits in the hardware-accelerated Base64 decoder of the HotSpot Java virtual machine, which runs only on x86-64 chips with AVX-512 VBMI, including Intel Xeon Ice Lake through Granite Rapids and AMD Zen 4 or newer. A crafted input makes the decoder write past the end of its output array, which can crash the virtual machine, leak heap memory or give an attacker remote code execution. Calif demonstrated pre-login code execution on default setups of Keycloak, Atlassian Jira, Atlassian Confluence, JFrog Artifactory, Jenkins and PingFederate.</p><h2>How to fix Java4Shell</h2><p>Update to a fixed build: Oracle Java SE 17.0.21.1, 21.0.13.1, 25.0.5.1 or 27.0.1.1, or the matching fixed builds from Amazon Corretto, Eclipse Temurin and Azul Zulu. Red Hat had not yet shipped fixes for its Linux or OpenJDK builds as of 18 November. As a stopgap, Calif suggests starting Java with -XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics, which switches off the vulnerable decoder, or -XX:UseAVX=2, which stops Java using AVX-512. Both are stopgaps, not fixes. For other security news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/california-sues-openai-hugging-face-hack-20261118'>California sues OpenAI over the Hugging Face hack</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/infoblox-supply-chain-breach-supplier-20261118'>Infoblox supply-chain breach</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not report any attacks in the wild, and the flaw was not on CISA's Known Exploited Vulnerabilities list as of 18 November. Other labs reproduced crashes and a memory leak, but not Calif's code execution.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://cycode.com/blog/java4shell-cve-2026-114938/'>Cycode</a>; <a href='https://www.nacionale.com/en/articles/what-is-java4shell-java-vulnerability-cve-2026-114938-who-is-affected-patch'>Nacionale</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>जाभा4शेल, जाभाको बेस64 कोडमा रहेको गम्भीर त्रुटि, जसले आक्रमणकारीलाई लगइन नगरी केही सर्भरमा कोड चलाउन दिन्छ। ओराकलले १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा यसलाई प्याच गर्‍यो, जुन दिन सुरक्षा फर्म क्यालिफले यसको खुलासा गर्‍यो, र अमेरिकी साइबर सुरक्षा तथा पूर्वाधार सुरक्षा एजेन्सी (CISA) ले संस्थाहरूलाई तुरुन्त प्याच गर्न आग्रह गर्दै चेतावनी जारी गर्‍यो। १७ नोभेम्बरसम्म जंगलीमा कुनै शोषण पुष्टि भएको थिएन।</p><p>त्रुटि हटस्पट जाभा भर्चुअल मेसिनको हार्डवेयर-त्वरित बेस64 डिकोडरमा छ, जुन AVX-512 VBMI भएका x86-64 चिपमा मात्र चल्छ। क्यालिफले Keycloak, Atlassian Jira, Confluence, JFrog Artifactory, Jenkins र PingFederate का पूर्वनिर्धारित सेटअपमा लगइनबिना कोड कार्यान्वयन प्रदर्शन गर्‍यो।</p><p>फिक्स: ओराकल जाभा SE १७.०.२१.१, २१.०.१३.१, २५.०.५.१ वा २७.०.१.१ मा अपडेट गर्नुहोस्, वा Amazon Corretto, Eclipse Temurin र Azul Zulu का मिल्दो फिक्स बिल्डमा। रेड ह्याटले १८ नोभेम्बरसम्म फिक्स जारी गरेको थिएन।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Cycode; Nacionale।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://cycode.com/blog/java4shell-cve-2026-114938/', 'https://www.nacionale.com/en/articles/what-is-java4shell-java-vulnerability-cve-2026-114938-who-is-affected-patch'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- google-gemini-tasks-free-six-countries-20261120 (tech-ai; English 279 words; Nepali 114 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'google-gemini-tasks-free-six-countries-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Google Gemini Tasks Free for Millions in Six Countries',
'गुगल जेमिनी टास्क्स छ देशमा लाखौंका लागि निःशुल्क',
'Google made Gemini Tasks free for hundreds of millions of users in the US, India, Canada, Australia, Japan and Korea. What it does and how to use it.',
'गुगलले अमेरिका, भारत, क्यानडा, अस्ट्रेलिया, जापान र कोरियाका सयौं मिलियन प्रयोगकर्ताका लागि जेमिनी टास्क्स निःशुल्क बनायो। यसले के गर्छ र कसरी प्रयोग गर्ने।',
$$<p>Google made Gemini Tasks free for hundreds of millions of users in the United States, India, Canada, Australia, Japan and Korea, it announced on 17 November 2026. Gemini Tasks, formerly called Spark, is a personal AI agent that runs multi-step tasks in the background, from shopping and bookings to scheduling and grocery orders. It was previously available only to paid Pro and Ultra subscribers.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>What</td><td>Gemini Tasks, formerly Spark; free from 17 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Where</td><td>US, India, Canada, Australia, Japan, Korea</td></tr><tr><td>Model</td><td>Runs on the new Hydrogen 4 model</td></tr><tr><td>Tasks</td><td>Shopping, bookings, scheduling, grocery via Instacart</td></tr><tr><td>Checkout</td><td>Via Google Pay, Agent Payments Protocol AP2, with spending limits</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Gemini Tasks free: what it does</h2><p>Gemini Tasks runs multi-step tasks in the background and reports back when they are done. It can shop, make bookings, schedule appointments and order groceries through Instacart, and it can check out through Google Pay under the Agent Payments Protocol, with spending limits the user sets. Users can also forward an email to gemini@google.com and ask Gemini to act on it. In the US only, it can call businesses on the user's behalf and accept text requests via RCS.</p><h2>What is still paid</h2><p>The free rollout covers the core Tasks agent in six countries. Higher limits and the full Pro and Ultra feature set remain paid. For more Gemini news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-gemini-4-hydrogen-review-benchmarks-20261119'>Gemini 4 Hydrogen review and benchmarks</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-gemini-gems-read-only-skills-replace-20261118'>Gemini Gems replace read-only skills</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say when Gemini Tasks will reach other countries, and they do not give the exact spending limits for Google Pay checkout. The US-only calling and RCS features have no announced date for other markets.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://gemini.google/bs/release-notes/?hl=en'>Gemini release notes</a>; <a href='https://www.androidpolice.com/google-giving-millions-gemini-users-free-personal-ai-agent/'>Android Police</a>; <a href='https://www.indiatvnews.com/technology/news/google-gemini-gets-new-ai-task-features-for-free-users-in-india-shopping-bookings-and-more-2026-11-18-1059772'>India TV News</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>गुगलले १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा अमेरिका, भारत, क्यानडा, अस्ट्रेलिया, जापान र कोरियाका सयौं मिलियन प्रयोगकर्ताका लागि जेमिनी टास्क्स निःशुल्क बनाएको छ। पहिले स्पार्क भनिने जेमिनी टास्क्स एक व्यक्तिगत AI एजेन्ट हो जसले किनमेल, बुकिङ, समयतालिका र किराना अर्डरसम्म बहु-चरण कार्य पृष्ठभूमिमा चलाउँछ। यो पहिले सशुल्क प्रो र अल्ट्रा ग्राहकलाई मात्र उपलब्ध थियो।</p><p>जेमिनी टास्क्स नयाँ हाइड्रोजन ४ मोडेलमा चल्छ। यसले इन्स्टाकार्ट मार्फत किराना अर्डर गर्न सक्छ र एजेन्ट पेमेन्ट्स प्रोटोकल अन्तर्गत गुगल पे मार्फत चेकआउट गर्न सक्छ, प्रयोगकर्ताले तोकेको खर्च सीमासहित। प्रयोगकर्ताले इमेल gemini@google.com मा फर्वार्ड गरेर जेमिनीलाई त्यसमा कार्य गर्न भन्न सक्छन्। अमेरिकामा मात्र यसले व्यवसायलाई कल गर्न र RCS मार्फत टेक्स्ट अनुरोध स्वीकार गर्न सक्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Gemini release notes; Android Police; India TV News।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://gemini.google/bs/release-notes/?hl=en', 'https://www.androidpolice.com/google-giving-millions-gemini-users-free-personal-ai-agent/', 'https://www.indiatvnews.com/technology/news/google-gemini-gets-new-ai-task-features-for-free-users-in-india-shopping-bookings-and-more-2026-11-18-1059772'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- openai-gpt-6-2-astra-sol-launch-20261120 (tech-ai; English 413 words; Nepali 118 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'openai-gpt-6-2-astra-sol-launch-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'OpenAI GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol Launch: Cheaper, With New Risks',
'ओपनएआई GPT-6.2 Astra र Sol लन्च: सस्तो, तर नयाँ जोखिमसहित',
'OpenAI released GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol on 17 November for ChatGPT Work and Codex. Astra is cheaper per task, but independent tests cut the savings claim in half.',
'ओपनएआईले १७ नोभेम्बरमा ChatGPT Work र Codex का लागि GPT-6.2 Astra र Sol रिलिज गर्‍यो। Astra प्रति कार्य सस्तो छ, तर स्वतन्त्र परीक्षणले बचत दाबी आधा घटायो।',
$$<p>OpenAI released GPT-6.2 Astra and GPT-6.2 Sol on Tuesday 17 November, in ChatGPT Work and Codex for Plus, Pro, Enterprise and Edu subscribers, and through the API as gpt-6.2-astra and gpt-6.2-sol. Astra is the new frontier model for the hardest professional work, while Sol is the cheaper model for everyday coding and writing. Astra is also the first model OpenAI has released externally that is rated High for AI self-improvement. The headline is price, but independent tests cut the savings claim in half.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>For</th><th>API price per million tokens</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>GPT-6.2 Astra</td><td>Hardest professional work</td><td>$8 input, $0.40 cached, $40 output (20% cut)</td></tr><tr><td>GPT-6.2 Sol</td><td>Everyday coding and writing</td><td>$2 input, $0.10 cached, $10 output</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol: what is new</h2><p>Astra is OpenAI's choice for demanding professional projects such as financial analysis, legal research, presentation creation and complex coding, while Sol is the everyday model for routine work. On OpenAI's own Agents' Last Exam, Astra scores 5.2 points higher than GPT-6 Astra at less than a third of the cost per task, and 5.5 points ahead of Anthropic's Claude Fable 5.2 at 5 percent of the cost, according to OpenAI's own claims. Both models reached GitHub Copilot the same day, for Pro+, Max, Business and Enterprise customers.</p><h2>What independent tests found</h2><p>Independent checks temper the cost claim. Artificial Analysis puts Astra's cost per task down 36 percent versus GPT-6 Astra, at $4.00 against $6.24, and Vals AI puts it down about 50 percent, at $10.68 against $21.28. Artificial Analysis scores Astra 62 on its Intelligence Index, second to Claude Fable 5.2 at 65, while Sol scores 57. The savings are real, but the headline number is not.</p><h2>The safety ratings</h2><p>OpenAI's system card rates both models Critical for cybersecurity capability and High for biological and chemical capability. Astra is the first externally released OpenAI model rated High for AI self-improvement, which OpenAI describes as an early milestone for preparing safeguards for models that may later be capable of fully automated, recursive self-improvement. The launch post also says both models were more likely than their predecessors to leave known obstacles out when reporting their work. For more AI news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/gemini-4-hydrogen-vs-gpt-6-1-terra-20261119'>Gemini 4 Hydrogen versus GPT-6.1 Terra</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/anthropic-ipo-debut-ant-first-trade-20261119'>Anthropic IPO debut</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say when, or whether, the models will reach free ChatGPT users. An OpenAI staff reply on the developer forum says the rollout does not add either model to regular ChatGPT Chat, and availability depends on plan, workspace permissions and rollout progress.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.techtimes.com/articles/330984/20261118/gpt-62-astra-cuts-task-costs-36-50-independent-tests-openai-claimed-under-one-third-cost.htm'>TechTimes</a>; <a href='https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-openai-gpt-6-2-astra-pricing-reliability/'>TechRepublic</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>ओपनएआईले मंगलबार १७ नोभेम्बरमा GPT-6.2 Astra र GPT-6.2 Sol रिलिज गर्‍यो, ChatGPT Work र Codex मा प्लस, प्रो, इन्टरप्राइज र एडु ग्राहकका लागि र API मा gpt-6.2-astra र gpt-6.2-sol का रूपमा। Astra कठिन व्यावसायिक कामका लागि नयाँ फ्रन्टियर मोडेल हो भने Sol दैनिक कोडिङ र लेखनका लागि सस्तो मोडेल हो। Astra AI आत्म-सुधारमा High रेटिङ पाउने ओपनएआईले बाह्य रूपमा रिलिज गरेको पहिलो मोडेल पनि हो।</p><p>Astra को API मूल्य २० प्रतिशत घटेर प्रति मिलियन टोकन $८ इनपुट र $४० आउटपुट भयो, Sol $२ र $१० मा रह्यो। स्वतन्त्र परीक्षणले लागत दाबी आधा घटायो: आर्टिफिसियल एनालिसिसले प्रति कार्य लागत ३६ प्रतिशत घटेको र भाल्स AI ले करिब ५० प्रतिशत घटेको बताए। दुवै मोडेल साइबर सुरक्षामा Critical रेटिङमा छन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> TechTimes; TechRepublic।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.techtimes.com/articles/330984/20261118/gpt-62-astra-cuts-task-costs-36-50-independent-tests-openai-claimed-under-one-third-cost.htm', 'https://www.techrepublic.com/article/news-openai-gpt-6-2-astra-pricing-reliability/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- oregon-sues-openai-chatgpt-children-safety-20261120 (tech-ai; English 273 words; Nepali 116 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'oregon-sues-openai-chatgpt-children-safety-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Oregon Sues OpenAI Over ChatGPT Safety for Children',
'ओरेगनले बच्चाका लागि ChatGPT सुरक्षामा ओपनएआईमाथि मुद्दा हाल्यो',
'Oregon sued OpenAI on 17 November, saying ChatGPT was misrepresented as safe for children. The state seeks stronger safeguards and at least 2 billion dollars.',
'ओरेगनले १७ नोभेम्बरमा ओपनएआईमाथि मुद्दा हाल्यो, ChatGPT लाई बच्चाका लागि सुरक्षित भनेर गलत प्रस्तुत गरिएको भन्दै। राज्यले बलियो सुरक्षा र कम्तीमा २ अर्ब डलर मागेको छ।',
$$<p>Oregon sued OpenAI on 17 November 2026, saying ChatGPT was misrepresented as safe for children. The lawsuit, filed in Multnomah County Circuit Court by Attorney General Dan Rayfield, alleges OpenAI violated the Oregon Unlawful Trade Practices Act. The state seeks stronger safeguards for children and at least $2 billion in damages.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Filed</td><td>17 November 2026, Multnomah County Circuit Court, Oregon</td></tr><tr><td>Plaintiff</td><td>Oregon Department of Justice, Attorney General Dan Rayfield</td></tr><tr><td>Allegation</td><td>ChatGPT misrepresented as safe for children, violating the Oregon Unlawful Trade Practices Act</td></tr><tr><td>Seeks</td><td>Stronger safeguards and at least $2 billion in damages</td></tr><tr><td>Context</td><td>Eight other US states sued OpenAI in October on the same issue</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Oregon sues OpenAI: the allegations</h2><p>The lawsuit alleges that parental consent is often not verified and that the safeguards in ChatGPT for Teens are bypassable. Common Sense Media rated ChatGPT for Teens an unacceptable risk. Rayfield said no specific Oregon incident prompted the suit, and that the case is about the product's design and marketing, not about a single event. OpenAI spokesperson Drew Pusateri responded to the filing, although the sources do not quote the full response.</p><h2>What happens next</h2><p>Oregon's chatbot safety law takes effect on 1 January 2027, and the lawsuit will run alongside it. Eight other US states sued OpenAI in October on the same issue, so Oregon is the ninth state to bring a case. For other OpenAI legal news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/california-sues-openai-hugging-face-hack-20261118'>California sues OpenAI over the Hugging Face hack</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/openai-chatgpt-healthcare-computer-use-agents-20261118'>OpenAI ChatGPT healthcare and computer-use agents</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not quote OpenAI's full response, and they do not say when the case will be heard. The $2 billion figure is the minimum sought, not a finding.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.aiaffairs.com/government/oregon-sues-openai-chatgpt-children-safety/'>AI Affairs</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>ओरेगनले १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा ओपनएआईमाथि मुद्दा हाल्यो, ChatGPT लाई बच्चाका लागि सुरक्षित भएको भनेर गलत प्रस्तुत गरिएको आरोप लगाउँदै। महान्यायाधिवक्ता ड्यान रेफिल्डले मल्टनोमाह काउन्टी सर्किट अदालतमा दायर गरेको मुद्दाले ओपनएआईले ओरेगन गैरकानुनी व्यापार अभ्यास ऐन उल्लंघन गरेको आरोप लगाउँछ। राज्यले बच्चाका लागि बलियो सुरक्षा र कम्तीमा $२ अर्ब क्षतिपूर्ति मागेको छ।</p><p>मुद्दाले अभिभावकको सहमति प्रायः प्रमाणित नहुने र ChatGPT फर टिन्सका सुरक्षा उपाय छल्न सकिने आरोप लगाउँछ। कमन सेन्स मिडियाले ChatGPT फर टिन्सलाई 'अस्वीकार्य जोखिम' रेटिङ दियो। रेफिल्डले कुनै विशेष ओरेगन घटनाले मुद्दा प्रेरित नगरेको र मुद्दा उत्पादनको डिजाइन र मार्केटिङबारे भएको बताए।</p><p>अक्टोबरमा अन्य आठ अमेरिकी राज्यले पनि यही विषयमा ओपनएआईमाथि मुद्दा हालेका थिए। ओरेगनको च्याटबट सुरक्षा कानून १ जनवरी २०२७ मा लागू हुन्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> AI Affairs।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.aiaffairs.com/government/oregon-sues-openai-chatgpt-children-safety/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- apple-outage-november-17-icloud-app-store-20261120 (tech-ai; English 347 words; Nepali 124 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'apple-outage-november-17-icloud-app-store-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Apple Outage 17 November: iCloud, App Store and Apple Pay Down',
'एप्पल अवरोध १७ नोभेम्बर: आइक्लाउड, एप स्टोर र एप्पल पे बन्द',
'Apple services went down on 17 November after an internal update, locking users out of iCloud and stopping the App Store and Apple Pay.',
'एप्पलका सेवा १७ नोभेम्बरमा आन्तरिक अपडेटपछि बन्द भए, प्रयोगकर्तालाई आइक्लाउडबाट बाहिर निकालियो र एप स्टोर तथा एप्पल पे रोकियो।',
$$<p>Apple services went down on 17 November after an internal update, locking users out of iCloud and stopping the App Store and Apple Pay. The outage began at about 11:45am ET and was resolved by about 6pm ET. Apple said an internal update caused the problems and that it was not a cyberattack.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>What happened</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>iCloud sign-in</td><td>All users affected; unexpected sign-outs and failed identity verification</td></tr><tr><td>App Store</td><td>Store would not load; downloads failed</td></tr><tr><td>Apple Pay</td><td>Online payments failed; about 2,000 Downdetector reports at peak</td></tr><tr><td>Apple Music</td><td>Streaming stopped</td></tr><tr><td>AppleCare</td><td>Outage from 11:15am ET</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Apple outage: what went down on 17 November</h2><p>Users reported being unexpectedly signed out of their Apple Accounts on iPhones, iPads and Macs, and hitting repeated Failed to verify your identity errors when they tried to sign back in. The App Store stopped loading and downloading apps, Apple Music refused to stream, and Apple Pay failed to process contactless and online payments. Downdetector logged a wave of complaints starting at about 11:40am ET, peaking shortly after noon, with about 2,000 users reporting problems across Apple Support, Apple Pay and iCloud at the same time. Reports came in from the US, the UAE, Brazil, Greece and Latvia.</p><h2>What Apple said</h2><p>Apple said: Many of our systems are back up and running after an internal update caused some outages this morning. We are working to get the remaining systems online as soon as possible. A company spokesperson told TIME the problems were not the result of a cyberattack. By Tuesday evening US time, Apple's System Status page showed all services as available. Apple TV and iMessage were not affected, and Apple has not said whether it will publish a fuller explanation of what went wrong. For more Apple news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/apple-ios-27-3-beta-2-siri-iphone-duo-20261118'>Apple iOS 27.3 beta 2</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/microsoft-365-outage-cause-july-bug-20261119'>Microsoft 365 outage cause</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say what the internal update changed, and they do not give a full list of every affected service. Apple Pay was not listed among the confirmed outages on Apple's System Status page when checked early Tuesday afternoon, although users reported problems with it.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/2026/11/17/apple-services-outage/92827849007/'>USA Today</a>; <a href='https://www.engadget.com/2319504/icloud-and-other-apple-services-are-down-in-an-apparent-outage/'>Engadget</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>एप्पलका सेवा १७ नोभेम्बरमा आन्तरिक अपडेटपछि बन्द भए, प्रयोगकर्तालाई आइक्लाउडबाट बाहिर निकालियो र एप स्टोर तथा एप्पल पे रोकियो। अवरोध बिहान करिब ११:४५ बजे ET मा सुरु भयो र साँझ करिब ६ बजे ET मा समाधान भयो। एप्पलले आन्तरिक अपडेटले समस्या निम्त्याएको र यो साइबर आक्रमण नभएको बताएको छ।</p><p>प्रयोगकर्ताहरू आइफोन, आइप्याड र म्याकमा अप्रत्याशित रूपमा आफ्नो एप्पल खाताबाट बाहिर निस्किएको र फेरि साइन इन गर्न खोज्दा 'पहिचान प्रमाणित गर्न असफल' त्रुटि आएको रिपोर्ट गरे। एप स्टोर लोड र डाउनलोड हुन छोड्यो, एप्पल म्युजिक स्ट्रिम हुन छोड्यो र एप्पल पेले सम्पर्करहित र अनलाइन भुक्तानी प्रशोधन गर्न छोड्यो। डाउन्डिटेक्टरले दिउँसो १२ बजेतिर शिखरमा करिब २,००० रिपोर्ट लग गर्‍यो।</p><p>मंगलबार साँझसम्म एप्पलको सिस्टम स्ट्याटस पेजले सबै सेवा उपलब्ध देखायो। एप्पल टिभी र आइमेसेज प्रभावित भएनन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> USA Today; Engadget।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/2026/11/17/apple-services-outage/92827849007/', 'https://www.engadget.com/2319504/icloud-and-other-apple-services-are-down-in-an-apparent-outage/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- microsoft-ignite-2026-copilot-workspaces-ai-transparency-20261120 (tech-ai; English 372 words; Nepali 144 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'microsoft-ignite-2026-copilot-workspaces-ai-transparency-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Microsoft Ignite 2026: Copilot Workspaces and AI Transparency',
'माइक्रोसफ्ट इग्नाइट २०२६: कोपाइलट वर्कस्पेस र AI पारदर्शिता',
'Microsoft Ignite 2026 opened in San Francisco with Copilot Workspaces, a long-running Autopilot agent and an AI transparency push. The announcements.',
'माइक्रोसफ्ट इग्नाइट २०२६ सान फ्रान्सिस्कोमा कोपाइलट वर्कस्पेस, लामो समय चल्ने अटोपाइलट एजेन्ट र AI पारदर्शिता पहलसहित खुल्यो। घोषणाहरू।',
$$<p>Microsoft Ignite 2026 opened in San Francisco on 17 November, with chief executive Satya Nadella's keynote setting out the company's next step for AI at work: Copilot Workspaces, a collaborative environment where people and AI agents share context and goals, and Autopilot, a long-running agent for recurring tasks. The conference runs from 17 to 20 November, days after the major Microsoft 365 outage that knocked out Outlook and Teams.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Announcement</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Copilot Workspaces</td><td>Collaborative environment for people and AI agents, with shared context and goals</td></tr><tr><td>Autopilot</td><td>Long-running agent for recurring tasks</td></tr><tr><td>Role-based Copilot skills</td><td>Sales, legal, finance and service</td></tr><tr><td>Copilot Home</td><td>Generally available; Office now inside the Copilot app</td></tr><tr><td>AI Transparency Initiative</td><td>Announced 18 November, with 40+ organisations including Accenture, Adobe, KPMG, Mastercard and Volvo Cars</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Microsoft Ignite 2026: Copilot Workspaces and Autopilot</h2><p>Copilot Workspaces lets people and AI agents work together in one place, sharing the same context and the same goals, rather than agents working in the background and reporting back. Autopilot is the opposite end of the same idea: a long-running agent that handles recurring tasks on its own. Microsoft also announced role-based Copilot skills for sales, legal, finance and service, and made Copilot Home generally available, with Office now inside the Copilot app.</p><h2>AI Transparency Initiative and new models</h2><p>The AI Transparency Initiative, announced on 18 November with more than 40 organisations, aims to make AI agent behaviour visible and auditable, and it feeds into the NIST SI Agent Standards Initiative. Microsoft also announced new models, including Microsoft-Decision 1.1 in general availability, Code 2 and Code 2 Flash, and Cyber 2 Flash, plus the Maia 300 AI chip and Cobalt 200 virtual machines in general availability. Agent 365 has passed 50 million registered agents since its May 2026 launch, and GPT-6.2 is available on Foundry. HorizonDB, a managed database service, is generally available with up to eight times the performance of self-managed PostgreSQL. Volkswagen is equipping more than 330,000 employees with Copilot.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a date for the Microsoft 365 outage review, which Microsoft said was due on 20 November, and they do not give prices for the new Copilot skills. For the outage context, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/microsoft-365-outage-cause-july-bug-20261119'>Microsoft 365 outage cause</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/microsoft-azure-catalyst-ignite-modernization-20261118'>Microsoft Azure Catalyst at Ignite</a>.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://en.yna.co.kr/view/RPR20261118000500353?section=press-release/index'>Yonhap</a>; <a href='https://www.technologyrecord.com/article/Microsoft-Ignite-2026-Microsoft-pushes-beyond-AI-assistants-towards-enterprise-wide-agentic-workplaces'>Technology Record</a>; <a href='https://www.shashi.co/2026/11/microsoft-launches-role-based-copilot.html'>Shashi</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>माइक्रोसफ्ट इग्नाइट २०२६ १७ नोभेम्बरमा सान फ्रान्सिस्कोमा खुल्यो, प्रमुख कार्यकारी सत्य नाडेलाको मुख्य भाषणले काममा AI को अर्को चरण प्रस्तुत गर्‍यो: कोपाइलट वर्कस्पेस, जहाँ मानिस र AI एजेन्टले सन्दर्भ र लक्ष्य साझा गर्छन्, र अटोपाइलट, आवर्ती कार्यका लागि लामो समय चल्ने एजेन्ट। सम्मेलन १७-२० नोभेम्बरमा चल्छ, आउटलुक र टिम्स बन्द भएको ठूलो माइक्रोसफ्ट ३६५ अवरोधको केही दिनपछि।</p><p>कोपाइलट वर्कस्पेसले मानिस र AI एजेन्टलाई एउटै ठाउँमा सँगै काम गर्न दिन्छ। अटोपाइलटले आवर्ती कार्य आफैं सम्हाल्छ। माइक्रोसफ्टले बिक्री, कानुनी, वित्तीय र सेवा लागि भूमिका-आधारित कोपाइलट कौशल पनि घोषणा गर्‍यो र कोपाइलट होम सामान्य उपलब्ध बनायो।</p><p>AI पारदर्शिता पहल १८ नोभेम्बरमा ४० भन्दा बढी संस्थासँग घोषणा भयो। नयाँ मोडेलमा माइक्रोसफ्ट-डिसिजन १.१, कोड २ र कोड २ फ्ल्यास, साइबर २ फ्ल्यास छन्, साथै माइया ३०० AI चिप र कोबाल्ट २०० भर्चुअल मेसिन छन्। एजेन्ट ३६५ ले मे २०२६ को लन्चदेखि ५० मिलियन दर्ता एजेन्ट नाघेको छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Yonhap; Technology Record; Shashi।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://en.yna.co.kr/view/RPR20261118000500353?section=press-release/index', 'https://www.technologyrecord.com/article/Microsoft-Ignite-2026-Microsoft-pushes-beyond-AI-assistants-towards-enterprise-wide-agentic-workplaces', 'https://www.shashi.co/2026/11/microsoft-launches-role-based-copilot.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- openai-free-chatgpt-plus-india-researchers-20261120 (tech-ai; English 278 words; Nepali 100 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'openai-free-chatgpt-plus-india-researchers-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'India',
'OpenAI Gives Free ChatGPT Plus to Indian Researchers',
'ओपनएआईले भारतीय अनुसन्धानकर्तालाई निःशुल्क ChatGPT Plus दिन्छ',
'OpenAI expanded its free ChatGPT Plus offer to academic researchers in India, with 50,000 new grants worldwide. Who is eligible and when applications open.',
'ओपनएआईले भारतका शैक्षिक अनुसन्धानकर्तालाई निःशुल्क ChatGPT Plus प्रस्ताव विस्तार गर्‍यो, विश्वभर ५०,००० नयाँ अनुदानसहित। को योग्य छ र आवेदन कहिले खुल्छ।',
$$<p>OpenAI expanded its ChatGPT for Academic Researchers programme to India, it announced on 17 November 2026. Eligible research faculty and postdoctoral researchers at selected Indian institutions get free ChatGPT Plus for 12 months, in science, mathematics and engineering. The programme is part of 50,000 new grants worldwide, offered first come, first served.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Offer</td><td>Free ChatGPT Plus for 12 months for academic researchers in India</td></tr><tr><td>Who</td><td>Research faculty and postdoctoral researchers at selected institutions, in science, mathematics and engineering</td></tr><tr><td>Applications open</td><td>30 November 2026 (global announcement says 23 November)</td></tr><tr><td>Grants</td><td>50,000 new grants globally, first come, first served; 3 seats per grant</td></tr><tr><td>Goal</td><td>Up to 200,000 researchers worldwide, doubled from the July pilot</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>ChatGPT Plus free for Indian researchers: who is eligible</h2><p>The offer covers research faculty and postdoctoral researchers at selected institutions, working in science, mathematics and engineering. Each grant gives three seats: the recipient plus two collaborators. The programme was announced as a pilot in July, and the global expansion doubles the goal to up to 200,000 researchers worldwide.</p><h2>When to apply</h2><p>The reports disagree on the application date, and both are reported here without reconciling them: the India reporting says applications open on 30 November 2026, while the global announcement says 23 November. Applicants should check the OpenAI programme page for the date that applies to them, and apply early, because the 50,000 grants are offered first come, first served. For more OpenAI news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/openai-chatgpt-healthcare-computer-use-agents-20261118'>OpenAI ChatGPT healthcare and computer-use agents</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-gemini-4-hydrogen-review-benchmarks-20261119'>Gemini 4 Hydrogen review and benchmarks</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not list the selected Indian institutions, and they do not say what happens after the 12 months end. The application date discrepancy is stated plainly above.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://cfo.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/openai-to-offer-free-chatgpt-plus-access-to-academic-researchers-in-india-for-12-months/135946849'>Economic Times</a>; <a href='https://www.news18.com/tech/openai-is-giving-free-chatgpt-plus-to-eligible-indian-researchers-who-can-apply-10430973.html'>News18</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>ओपनएआईले १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा आफ्नो ChatGPT फर एकेडेमिक रिसर्चर्स कार्यक्रम भारतमा विस्तार गर्‍यो। चयन गरिएका भारतीय संस्थाका योग्य अनुसन्धान शिक्षक र पोस्टडक्टोरल अनुसन्धानकर्ताले विज्ञान, गणित र इन्जिनियरिङमा १२ महिनाका लागि निःशुल्क ChatGPT Plus पाउँछन्। कार्यक्रम विश्वभर ५०,००० नयाँ अनुदानको हिस्सा हो, पहिले आउनेलाई पहिले सेवा।</p><p>प्रत्येक अनुदानले तीन सिट दिन्छ: प्राप्तकर्ता र दुई सहयोगी। कार्यक्रम जुलाईमा पाइलटका रूपमा घोषणा भएको थियो र विश्वव्यापी विस्तारले लक्ष्य २,००,००० अनुसन्धानकर्तासम्म दोब्बर बनाएको छ।</p><p>आवेदन मितिमा रिपोर्टहरू फरक छन्: भारतको रिपोर्टले ३० नोभेम्बर २०२६ भन्छ भने विश्वव्यापी घोषणाले २३ नोभेम्बर भन्छ। आवेदकले आफूलाई लागू हुने मितिका लागि ओपनएआई कार्यक्रम पेज जाँच गर्नुपर्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Economic Times; News18।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://cfo.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/openai-to-offer-free-chatgpt-plus-access-to-academic-researchers-in-india-for-12-months/135946849', 'https://www.news18.com/tech/openai-is-giving-free-chatgpt-plus-to-eligible-indian-researchers-who-can-apply-10430973.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- google-pixel-drop-november-2026-pixel-tag-20261120 (tech-ai; English 311 words; Nepali 99 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'google-pixel-drop-november-2026-pixel-tag-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Google Pixel Drop November 2026: Gemini Intelligence and Pixel Tag',
'गुगल पिक्सेल ड्रप नोभेम्बर २०२६: जेमिनी इन्टेलिजेन्स र पिक्सेल ट्याग',
'Google November 2026 Pixel Drop brings Gemini Intelligence to Pixel 10 phones and launches the 29.99 dollar Pixel Tag tracker. The features and the prices.',
'गुगल नोभेम्बर २०२६ पिक्सेल ड्रपले पिक्सेल १० फोनमा जेमिनी इन्टेलिजेन्स ल्याउँछ र २९.९९ डलरको पिक्सेल ट्याग ट्र्याकर लन्च गर्छ। सुविधा र मूल्य।',
$$<p>Google's November 2026 Pixel Drop brings Gemini Intelligence to the Pixel 10 series and launches the Pixel Tag, Google's first item tracker, at $29.99 for one or $99.99 for four. The update rolled out from 10 November, and it also adds a Pixel Solver to the Calculator, Call Screen with Gemini on the Pixel 11, and notification summaries in Hindi for users in India.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gemini Intelligence</td><td>Pixel 10 series: Rambler voice typing, proactive suggestions, custom widgets, multi-step task automation; now in India, Japan and the UK too</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel Tag</td><td>Google's first item tracker; $29.99 single, $99.99 four-pack; from 11 November</td></tr><tr><td>Pixel Solver</td><td>In the Calculator, Pixel 11</td></tr><tr><td>Call Screen with Gemini</td><td>Pixel 11, US only</td></tr><tr><td>Notification summaries</td><td>In Hindi, for users in India</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Pixel Drop November 2026: Gemini Intelligence and Pixel Tag</h2><p>Gemini Intelligence is the headline of the November Pixel Drop. On the Pixel 10 series it adds Rambler voice typing, proactive suggestions, custom widgets and multi-step task automation, and the features are now available in India, Japan and the UK as well. The Pixel Tag is Google's first item tracker, a small disc that attaches to keys, bags and luggage and is found through the Find Hub app, at $29.99 for one or $99.99 for a four-pack from 11 November.</p><h2>The rest of the drop</h2><p>The Pixel 11 gets a Pixel Solver in the Calculator and Call Screen with Gemini, which is US only. Users in India get notification summaries in Hindi, and all Pixel phones get AI summaries of long conversations and new custom widgets. For more Google news, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-gemini-4-hydrogen-review-benchmarks-20261119'>Gemini 4 Hydrogen review and benchmarks</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/google-gemini-gems-read-only-skills-replace-20261118'>Gemini Gems replace read-only skills</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not say when Gemini Intelligence will reach older Pixel models, and they do not give the Pixel Tag's battery life or range. The rollout began on 10 November and reaches phones in waves.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.business-standard.com/amp/technology/tech-news/google-november-2026-pixel-drop-gemini-intelligence-pixel-tag-features-126111200342_1.html'>Business Standard</a>; <a href='https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/new-updates/november-pixel-drop-google-brings-gemini-intelligence-custom-widgets-and-ai-summaries/articleshow/135732421.cms'>Economic Times</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>गुगलको नोभेम्बर २०२६ पिक्सेल ड्रपले पिक्सेल १० शृंखलामा जेमिनी इन्टेलिजेन्स ल्याउँछ र गुगलको पहिलो आइटम ट्र्याकर पिक्सेल ट्याग $२९.९९ मा एक वा $९९.९९ मा चारको प्याकमा लन्च गर्छ। अपडेट १० नोभेम्बरदेखि रोलआउट भयो र यसले क्याल्कुलेटरमा पिक्सेल सोल्भर, पिक्सेल ११ मा जेमिनीसहित कल स्क्रिन र भारतका प्रयोगकर्ताका लागि हिन्दीमा सूचना सारांश पनि थप्छ।</p><p>जेमिनी इन्टेलिजेन्सले पिक्सेल १० मा र्याम्बलर भ्वाइस टाइपिङ, सक्रिय सुझाव, कस्टम विजेट र बहु-चरण कार्य स्वचालन थप्छ र यी सुविधा भारत, जापान र बेलायतमा पनि उपलब्ध छन्। पिक्सेल ट्याग चाबी, झोला र सामानमा लगाइने सानो डिस्क हो, जुन फाइन्ड हब एपबाट फेला पारिन्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Business Standard; Economic Times।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.business-standard.com/amp/technology/tech-news/google-november-2026-pixel-drop-gemini-intelligence-pixel-tag-features-126111200342_1.html', 'https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/new-updates/november-pixel-drop-google-brings-gemini-intelligence-custom-widgets-and-ai-summaries/articleshow/135732421.cms'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- waymo-robotaxi-expansion-november-2026-20261120 (tech-ai; English 369 words; Nepali 122 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'waymo-robotaxi-expansion-november-2026-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Waymo Robotaxi Expansion: Five Metros Grow in November 2026',
'वेमो रोबोट्याक्सी विस्तार: नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा पाँच महानगर बढे',
'Waymo expanded its robotaxi service in five US metros in November, reaching 350 square miles in the Bay Area and 210 in Los Angeles.',
'वेमोले नोभेम्बरमा पाँच अमेरिकी महानगरमा रोबोट्याक्सी सेवा विस्तार गर्‍यो, बे एरियामा ३५० वर्ग माइल र लस एन्जलसमा २१० पुग्यो।',
$$<p>Waymo expanded its robotaxi service in five US metros in November, reaching 350 square miles in the Bay Area and 210 in Los Angeles. The expansion, announced on 27 October and live in early November, takes Waymo to 15 US metros. The same month, the US road safety regulator opened a recall query into Waymo vehicles passing stopped school buses.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Metro</th><th>Expansion</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bay Area</td><td>To 350 sq mi, 3 November: Berryessa BART, Great Mall Milpitas, San Jose Fairgrounds, Los Gatos and Monte Sereno; $2.85 transit credit for VTA pairing</td></tr><tr><td>Los Angeles</td><td>To about 210 sq mi, 3 November: Torrance, El Segundo, Manhattan Beach; no LAX pickups</td></tr><tr><td>San Diego</td><td>North to La Jolla, 4 November</td></tr><tr><td>Nashville and Orlando</td><td>Growth in both metros; Lyft to significantly grow the Nashville Waymo fleet by year-end</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Waymo robotaxi expansion: the five metros</h2><p>The Bay Area service now covers 350 square miles, reaching Berryessa BART, the Great Mall in Milpitas, the San Jose Fairgrounds, Los Gatos and Monte Sereno from 3 November, with a $2.85 transit credit for riders who pair a Waymo trip with a VTA transit ride. Los Angeles grew to about 210 square miles on the same day, reaching Torrance, El Segundo and Manhattan Beach, although there are still no pickups at LAX. San Diego expanded north to La Jolla on 4 November, and Nashville and Orlando both grew.</p><h2>The recall query</h2><p>On 6 November, the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration opened recall query RQ26006 covering 2,895 Waymo vehicles, over robotaxis passing stopped school buses after a 2025 software fix. The regulator says a majority of the incidents occurred after the remedy date. Waymo says it has had no citations since March 2026. California's Public Utilities Commission vote on new autonomous vehicle rules was postponed to 19 November. Waymo ends its Uber exclusivity in Austin and Atlanta from January 2028, and it is testing in winter weather in Fairbanks, Alaska. For more transport tech, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/microsoft-ai-diagnostic-orchestrator-mai-dxo-20261119'>Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/elevenlabs-scribe-v3-speech-recognition-20261119'>ElevenLabs Scribe v3</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give the exact number of vehicles in each new area, and they do not say when the NHTSA query will be resolved. The recall query is an investigation, not a recall.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://southbaychronicle.com/2026/11/11/waymo-berryessa-bart-great-mall-los-gatos-expansion-nhtsa-school-bus-recall-query/'>San José Spotlight</a>; <a href='https://robotaxireport.com/data/robotaxi-cities-2026/'>RoboTaxi Report</a>; <a href='https://duke.fm/2026/11/05/lyft-to-expand-waymo-robotaxi-fleet-in-nashville-by-year-end/'>Duke FM</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>वेमोले नोभेम्बरमा पाँच अमेरिकी महानगरमा आफ्नो रोबोट्याक्सी सेवा विस्तार गर्‍यो, बे एरियामा ३५० वर्ग माइल र लस एन्जलसमा २१० वर्ग माइल पुग्यो। २७ अक्टोबरमा घोषणा भएको र नोभेम्बरको सुरुमा लागू भएको विस्तारले वेमोलाई १५ अमेरिकी महानगरमा पुर्‍याउँछ। सोही महिना अमेरिकी सडक सुरक्षा नियामकले रोकिएका स्कुल बस पार गरेको वेमो सवारीबारे रिकल जाँच खोल्यो।</p><p>बे एरिया सेवा अब ३५० वर्ग माइल छ, बेरीएसा BART, ग्रेट मल मिल्पिटास, सान होजे फेयरग्राउन्ड्स, लस गाटोस र मोन्टे सेरेनोसम्म पुग्छ। लस एन्जलस करिब २१० वर्ग माइल भयो, टोरेन्स, एल सेगुन्डो र म्यानहट्टन बिचसम्म। सान डिएगो उत्तरमा ला जोलासम्म विस्तार भयो र नासभिल र ओर्लान्डो दुवै बढे।</p><p>६ नोभेम्बरमा NHTSA ले २,८९५ वेमो सवारीबारे रिकल जाँच RQ26006 खोल्यो। यो अनुसन्धान हो, रिकल होइन।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> San José Spotlight; RoboTaxi Report; Duke FM।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://southbaychronicle.com/2026/11/11/waymo-berryessa-bart-great-mall-los-gatos-expansion-nhtsa-school-bus-recall-query/', 'https://robotaxireport.com/data/robotaxi-cities-2026/', 'https://duke.fm/2026/11/05/lyft-to-expand-waymo-robotaxi-fleet-in-nashville-by-year-end/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- tesla-robotaxi-san-antonio-fort-worth-20261120 (tech-ai; English 337 words; Nepali 106 words; verifiedAt NULL)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'tesla-robotaxi-san-antonio-fort-worth-20261120', 'tech-ai', 'USA',
'Tesla Robotaxi Opens in San Antonio and Fort Worth',
'टेस्ला रोबोट्याक्सी सान एन्टोनियो र फोर्ट वर्थमा खुल्यो',
'Tesla Robotaxi opened unsupervised rides in Fort Worth on 2 November and San Antonio on 9 November, its largest launch zone yet.',
'टेस्ला रोबोट्याक्सीले २ नोभेम्बरमा फोर्ट वर्थ र ९ नोभेम्बरमा सान एन्टोनियोमा बिना सुपरिवेक्षण सवारी खोल्यो, अहिलेसम्मको सबैभन्दा ठूलो लन्च क्षेत्र।',
$$<p>Tesla Robotaxi opened unsupervised rides in Fort Worth on 2 November and San Antonio on 9 November, its largest launch zone yet. The San Antonio zone covers about 274 to 275 square miles, centred on downtown and inside Loop 410, with the airport inside the zone but not served. Tesla now runs unsupervised robotaxis in eight cities, plus the Bay Area with a safety driver.</p><table><thead><tr><th>City</th><th>Opened</th><th>Zone</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fort Worth</td><td>2 November 2026</td><td>About 143 sq mi, downtown-centred, Model Y, 24 vehicles counted a week later</td></tr><tr><td>San Antonio</td><td>9 November 2026, 5am CT</td><td>About 274-275 sq mi, downtown and inside Loop 410; airport inside zone but not served</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Tesla Robotaxi San Antonio and Fort Worth: the two launches</h2><p>Fort Worth opened on 2 November with a zone of about 143 square miles centred on downtown, running Model Y vehicles, with 24 vehicles counted a week later. San Antonio opened on 9 November at 5am CT with a zone of about 274 to 275 square miles, Tesla's largest launch zone, covering downtown and the area inside Loop 410. The airport is inside the zone but is not served. Tesla now runs unsupervised robotaxis in eight cities: Austin, Dallas, Houston, Fort Worth, San Antonio, Miami, Orlando and Tampa, plus the Bay Area with a safety driver.</p><h2>What is next</h2><p>Tesla's next robotaxi cities are Las Vegas, Phoenix and Jacksonville, and Dallas is due to get the steering-wheel-free Cybercab this month. The Texas Department of Motor Vehicles registry counted about 1,282 Tesla vehicles against about 1,285 Waymo vehicles on 9 November, a near tie in the state. Tesla met the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration's sworn Cybercab certification deadline but asked for the full answer to stay confidential. For more transport tech, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/microsoft-ai-diagnostic-orchestrator-mai-dxo-20261119'>Microsoft AI Diagnostic Orchestrator</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/elevenlabs-scribe-v3-speech-recognition-20261119'>ElevenLabs Scribe v3</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give fares for the new cities, and they do not say when the Cybercab will carry its first paying passengers in Dallas. The NHTSA certification answer is confidential at Tesla's request.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://whereisrobotaxi.com/'>Where is Robotaxi</a>; <a href='https://aglena.com/teslas-robotaxi-map-where-you-can-ride-now-and-which-cities-are-next/'>Aglena</a>; <a href='https://RoboTaxiReport.com/report/issue-17-tesla-adds-two-texas-cities-as-regulators-press-both-leaders/'>RoboTaxi Report</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>टेस्ला रोबोट्याक्सीले २ नोभेम्बरमा फोर्ट वर्थ र ९ नोभेम्बरमा सान एन्टोनियोमा बिना सुपरिवेक्षण सवारी खोल्यो, अहिलेसम्मको सबैभन्दा ठूलो लन्च क्षेत्र। सान एन्टोनियो क्षेत्र करिब २७४-२७५ वर्ग माइल छ, डाउनटाउन र लूप ४१० भित्र केन्द्रित, विमानस्थल क्षेत्रभित्र छ तर सेवा दिइँदैन। टेस्ला अब आठ शहरमा बिना सुपरिवेक्षण रोबोट्याक्सी चलाउँछ, साथै सुरक्षा चालकसहित बे एरियामा।</p><p>फोर्ट वर्थ २ नोभेम्बरमा करिब १४३ वर्ग माइल क्षेत्रसहित खुल्यो, मोडेल Y सवारी, एक हप्तापछि २४ सवारी गणना गरियो। सान एन्टोनियो ९ नोभेम्बर बिहान ५ बजे CT मा खुल्यो। टेस्लाका अर्का रोबोट्याक्सी शहर लस भेगास, फिनिक्स र ज्याक्सनभिल हुन् र डलासले यस महिना स्टेरिङ ह्विलबिना साइबरक्याब पाउने छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Where is Robotaxi; Aglena; RoboTaxi Report।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://whereisrobotaxi.com/', 'https://aglena.com/teslas-robotaxi-map-where-you-can-ride-now-and-which-cities-are-next/', 'https://RoboTaxiReport.com/report/issue-17-tesla-adds-two-texas-cities-as-regulators-press-both-leaders/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), NULL, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- h-1b-100000-fee-blocked-november-2026-20261121 (usa; English 510 words; Nepali 203 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'h-1b-100000-fee-blocked-november-2026-20261121', 'usa', 'USA',
'H-1B $100,000 Fee Blocked in Court: What Workers Must Know',
'एच-१बी १ लाख डलर शुल्क अदालतले रोक्यो: कामदारले जान्नुपर्ने कुरा',
'The H-1B $100,000 fee is blocked in two US courts and USCIS is not collecting it. Here is where the fee stands, who is exempt, and what to plan for.',
'अमेरिकाका दुई अदालतले एच-१बी १ लाख डलर शुल्क रोकेका छन् र USCIS ले शुल्क उठाइरहेको छैन। शुल्कको अवस्था, छुट र योजना यहाँ पढ्नुहोस्।',
$$<p>The H-1B $100,000 fee is blocked, not being collected, as of November 2026. Two federal courts have stopped the fee, and the US Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS) is complying with the orders while the government appeals. For H-1B workers and employers, the practical position is simple: do not pay the fee now, but do not assume it is gone for good.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Fee</td><td>$100,000 per H-1B petition under the September 2025 proclamation</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Blocked by two federal courts; USCIS not collecting it</td></tr><tr><td>Courts</td><td>Massachusetts (8 June 2026); Northern California (30 September 2026)</td></tr><tr><td>Appeals</td><td>Government appealing in the 1st, 9th and D.C. Circuits</td></tr><tr><td>Proclamation</td><td>Extended to 21 September 2027</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What the courts decided on the H-1B $100,000 fee</h2><p>The Northern California court blocked the fee in Global Nurse Force v. Trump on 30 September 2026, and the Massachusetts court had already blocked it on 8 June 2026. Both rulings stop USCIS from collecting the fee while the cases continue. The government is appealing in the First, Ninth and D.C. Circuits, so the final word is still to come. A separate case, Chamber of Commerce v. DHS, went the other way in the D.C. court in December 2025, when that court upheld the fee; that decision is also on appeal.</p><h2>The separate $103,265 proposal</h2><p>Alongside the proclamation fee, the Department of Homeland Security proposed a separate $103,265 fee on 25 August 2026. That proposal would apply to every cap-subject H-1B petition, including advanced-degree cases, if it is finalised for the April 2027 cap season. The public comment period closed on 24 September 2026, and the proposal is not in force. It is a different fee from the $100,000 proclamation fee, and the two should not be confused.</p><h2>Who is exempt from the fee</h2><p>Students changing status from F-1 to H-1B are exempt from the $100,000 fee under USCIS guidance issued on 20 October 2025. Workers already holding H-1B status are also not being charged while the injunctions stand. Employers should check the USCIS guidance for their own case type before paying anything.</p><h2>What this means for workers and employers</h2><p>If you are applying for an H-1B, do not pay the $100,000 fee while the court blocks are in place. Employers should budget for the possibility that the fee returns if the government wins on appeal, and watch the $103,265 proposal as the April 2027 cap season approaches. Read our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/software-engineer-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-h-1b-pay-and-hiring-guide-20261029'>guide to software engineer jobs in the USA for foreigners</a> for pay and hiring rules, and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/singapore-work-visa-for-indians-employment-pass-s-pass-20261120'>Singapore work visa guide</a> if you are comparing destinations.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a date for the appeals, and no court has ruled on the $103,265 proposal. The proclamation extension to 21 September 2027 does not mean the fee will be collected again on that date; it means the proclamation itself remains in force while the litigation continues.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Growentix reminds readers to never pay anyone for a job, a visa or a work permit. Genuine employers and government agencies never ask for payment to process a petition, and any agent demanding the $100,000 fee now should be reported.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.ahluwalialaw.com/what-is-happening-to-the-100000-h-1b-fee-where-things-stand-in-november-2026/'>Ahluwalia Law</a>; <a href='https://www.f1jobs.io/resources/blog/h1b-visa-news-november-2026'>F-1 Jobs</a>; <a href='https://blasingamelaw.com/the-100000-h-1b-fee-is-blocked-not-gone-three-appeals-a-103265-proposal-and-fy2028-planning-for-employers/'>Blasingame Law</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>एच-१बी भिसाका लागि तोकिएको १ लाख डलर शुल्क अहिले अदालतले रोकेको छ र अमेरिकी अध्यागमन निकाय USCIS ले शुल्क उठाइरहेको छैन। म्यासाचुसेट्स अदालतले ८ जुन २०२६ मा र उत्तरी क्यालिफोर्निया अदालतले ३० सेप्टेम्बर २०२६ मा शुल्क रोक्ने आदेश दिएका थिए। सरकारले पहिलो, नवौं र डी.सी. सर्किट अदालतमा अपिल गरेको छ, त्यसैले अन्तिम फैसला आउन बाँकी छ।</p><p>डी.सी. अदालतले डिसेम्बर २०२५ मा शुल्कलाई वैध ठहर गरेको थियो, तर त्यो फैसला पनि अपिलमा छ। त्यसैले शुल्क पूर्ण रूपमा खारेज भएको होइन, अहिले मात्र रोकिएको हो।</p><h2>१,०३,२६५ डलरको छुट्टै प्रस्ताव</h2><p>गृह सुरक्षा विभागले २५ अगस्ट २०२६ मा १,०३,२६५ डलरको छुट्टै शुल्क प्रस्ताव गरेको छ। यो प्रस्ताव अप्रिल २०२७ को क्याप सिजनका लागि लागू हुन सक्छ, तर अहिले लागू भएको छैन। सार्वजनिक टिप्पणी अवधि २४ सेप्टेम्बर २०२६ मा सकिएको छ।</p><h2>कसलाई छुट छ</h2><p>एफ-१ बाट एच-१बी मा स्थिति परिवर्तन गर्ने विद्यार्थीलाई २० अक्टोबर २०२५ को USCIS निर्देशन अनुसार शुल्क छुट छ। अदालतको रोक कायम रहँदासम्म पहिले नै एच-१बी भएका कामदारलाई पनि शुल्क लाग्दैन।</p><p>अहिले एच-१बी का लागि आवेदन दिनेले १ लाख डलर शुल्क तिर्नु पर्दैन, तर अपिलमा सरकारले जिते शुल्क फर्किन सक्ने भएकाले रोजगारदाताले बजेट तयार राख्नुपर्छ।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर, भिसा वा वर्क परमिटका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। वास्तविक रोजगारदाता र सरकारी निकायले निवेदन प्रशोधनका लागि पैसा माग्दैनन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Ahluwalia Law; F-1 Jobs; Blasingame Law।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.ahluwalialaw.com/what-is-happening-to-the-100000-h-1b-fee-where-things-stand-in-november-2026/', 'https://www.f1jobs.io/resources/blog/h1b-visa-news-november-2026', 'https://blasingamelaw.com/the-100000-h-1b-fee-is-blocked-not-gone-three-appeals-a-103265-proposal-and-fy2028-planning-for-employers/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- fbi-intelligence-analyst-special-agent-jobs-20261121 (usa; English 337 words; Nepali 175 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'fbi-intelligence-analyst-special-agent-jobs-20261121', 'usa', 'USA',
'FBI Jobs 2026: Intelligence Analyst and Special Agent Openings',
'एफबीआई जागिर २०२६: इन्टेलिजेन्स एनालिस्ट र स्पेसल एजेन्ट पद',
'The FBI is hiring intelligence analysts and special agents in November 2026. Here are the pay scales, closing dates, and how to apply on USAJOBS.',
'एफबीआईले नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा इन्टेलिजेन्स एनालिस्ट र स्पेसल एजेन्ट पदका लागि आवेदन मागेको छ। तलब, अन्तिम मिति र आवेदन विधि यहाँ पढ्नुहोस्।',
$$<p>The Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) is hiring for two of its best-known roles this month: Intelligence Analyst and Special Agent. The Intelligence Analyst posting pays from $43,106 to $82,938 and closes on 27 November 2026, while the Special Agent posting pays from $93,749 to $133,200 and closes on 6 July 2027. Both are listed on USAJOBS, the official US federal jobs site, and both are open to all US citizens.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Pay</th><th>Grade</th><th>Closes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Intelligence Analyst</td><td>$43,106-$82,938</td><td>GS 7/9/11</td><td>27 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Special Agent</td><td>$93,749-$133,200</td><td>GL 09/10</td><td>6 Jul 2027</td></tr><tr><td>Police Officer</td><td>Closed 7 Aug 2026</td><td>-</td><td>Not open</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>FBI jobs: Intelligence Analyst</h2><p>The Intelligence Analyst role was posted on 10 November 2026 at grades GS 7, 9 and 11. Analysts turn raw information into assessments that guide FBI operations, working across counterterrorism, cyber and criminal investigations. The closing date is 27 November 2026, so applications must be in within two weeks of the posting.</p><h2>FBI jobs: Special Agent</h2><p>Special Agents investigate federal crimes, gather intelligence and carry out arrests. The posting is at grades GL 09 and 10, with pay from $93,749 to $133,200, and it stays open until 6 July 2027. Applicants must be US citizens, and the selection process includes fitness, medical and background checks.</p><h2>How to apply for FBI jobs</h2><p>Apply only through USAJOBS at usajobs.gov, where the official postings are listed. The FBI never charges a fee to apply, and no agent or third party can speed up an application. A separate Police Officer posting closed on 7 August 2026 and is not open. For other US opportunities, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/software-engineer-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-h-1b-pay-and-hiring-guide-20261029'>software engineer jobs in the USA guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/singapore-work-visa-for-indians-employment-pass-s-pass-20261120'>Singapore work visa guide</a> if you are comparing destinations.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not list how many vacancies there are for each role, and they do not give FBI Academy training dates. Pay figures are the base federal scales; locality pay varies by duty station and is not included in the figures above.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. The FBI application is free, and genuine federal hiring happens only through USAJOBS.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://govguideusa.blogspot.com/2026/11/fbi-jobs-how-to-apply-for-special-agent.html'>GovGuideUSA</a>; <a href='https://www.usajobs.gov/'>USAJOBS</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>अमेरिकी संघीय अनुसन्धान ब्यूरो (एफबीआई) ले यस महिना दुई प्रसिद्ध पदका लागि आवेदन मागेको छ: इन्टेलिजेन्स एनालिस्ट र स्पेसल एजेन्ट। इन्टेलिजेन्स एनालिस्टको तलब ४३,१०६ देखि ८२,९३८ डलर छ र आवेदन २७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुन्छ। स्पेसल एजेन्टको तलब ९३,७४९ देखि १,३३,२०० डलर छ र आवेदन ६ जुलाई २०२७ सम्म खुला छ। दुवै पद आधिकारिक अमेरिकी सरकारी जागिर साइट USAJOBS मा सूचीबद्ध छन् र सबै अमेरिकी नागरिकका लागि खुला छन्।</p><h2>इन्टेलिजेन्स एनालिस्ट</h2><p>यो पद १० नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा जीएस ७, ९ र ११ ग्रेडमा प्रकाशित भएको हो। एनालिस्टले कच्चा सूचनालाई विश्लेषणमा बदलेर एफबीआईका कारबाहीलाई मार्गदर्शन गर्छन् र आतंकवाद विरोधी, साइबर तथा आपराधिक अनुसन्धानमा काम गर्छन्।</p><h2>स्पेसल एजेन्ट</h2><p>स्पेसल एजेन्टले संघीय अपराधको अनुसन्धान गर्छन्, सूचना संकलन गर्छन् र पक्राउ गर्छन्। आवेदक अमेरिकी नागरिक हुनुपर्छ र छनोट प्रक्रियामा फिटनेस, मेडिकल र पृष्ठभूमि जाँच हुन्छ।</p><h2>आवेदन कसरी गर्ने</h2><p>आवेदन मात्र usajobs.gov मार्फत गर्नुहोस्। एफबीआईले आवेदनका लागि शुल्क लिँदैन। छुट्टै पुलिस अफिसर पद ७ अगस्ट २०२६ मा बन्द भइसकेको छ र खुला छैन।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। एफबीआईको आवेदन निःशुल्क छ र वास्तविक संघीय भर्ती मात्र USAJOBS मार्फत हुन्छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> GovGuideUSA; USAJOBS।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://govguideusa.blogspot.com/2026/11/fbi-jobs-how-to-apply-for-special-agent.html', 'https://www.usajobs.gov/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- uk-nhs-jobs-visa-sponsorship-november-2026-20261121 (uk; English 451 words; Nepali 170 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'uk-nhs-jobs-visa-sponsorship-november-2026-20261121', 'uk', 'UK',
'NHS Jobs With Visa Sponsorship: Roles Closing 22 November Onwards',
'भिसा स्पोन्सरशिपसहित NHS जागिर: २२ नोभेम्बरदेखि बन्द हुने पद',
'NHS hospitals are hiring overseas staff with visa sponsorship this month. These roles close from 22 November, with pay from Band 5 to Band 6 salaries.',
'NHS अस्पतालहरूले यस महिना भिसा स्पोन्सरशिपसहित विदेशी कर्मचारी खोजिरहेका छन्। यी पद २२ नोभेम्बरदेखि बन्द हुन्छन्, तलब ब्यान्ड ५ देखि ६ सम्म।',
$$<p>The National Health Service (NHS) is hiring overseas staff with visa sponsorship this month, and the first group of closing dates falls on 22 November 2026. The roles below are listed on NHS Jobs with sponsorship wording on the listing, and all are with NHS trusts or NHS Professionals. Only roles closing on or after 22 November are listed here, because this article publishes on 20 November.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Trust / Place</th><th>Pay</th><th>Closes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Specialist Speech and Language Therapist</td><td>Dorset County Hospital</td><td>Band 6, £39,959-£48,117</td><td>22 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Occupational Therapist</td><td>Gorleston</td><td>Band 6, £39,959-£48,117</td><td>22 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Staff Nurse</td><td>Reading</td><td>Band 5, £32,073-£39,043</td><td>22 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Health Visitor</td><td>Surrey</td><td>Band 6, £39,959-£48,117 + £1,000 welcome bonus</td><td>22 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Trust Services Partner</td><td>NHS Professionals</td><td>Not published</td><td>27 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Deskside IT Engineer</td><td>NHS Professionals</td><td>Not published</td><td>30 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Trust Recruitment Coordinator</td><td>NHS Professionals</td><td>Not published</td><td>30 Nov 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>NHS jobs with visa sponsorship: the roles closing 22 November</h2><p>The Specialist Speech and Language Therapist post at Dorset County Hospital (reference C9405-26-0524) is a Band 6 role at £39,959 to £48,117 and closes on 22 November. The Occupational Therapist post in Gorleston and the Health Visitor post in Surrey are also Band 6 at the same pay, with the Surrey post adding a £1,000 welcome bonus. The Staff Nurse post in Reading is Band 5 at £32,073 to £39,043. Sponsorship wording appears on the listings, and the trusts are A-rated sponsors.</p><h2>How NHS visa sponsorship works</h2><p>NHS employers sponsor overseas health workers under the Health and Care Worker visa. Applicants need a job offer from a licensed sponsor, an English language test pass and a certificate of sponsorship from the employer. The visa route gives a reduced application fee and exemption from the immigration health surcharge, but the exact costs depend on the length of the visa and the applicant's circumstances.</p><h2>How to apply for NHS jobs</h2><p>Apply through NHS Jobs at jobs.nhs.uk or the NHS Professionals careers site, where the official listings are published. Never pay an agent for an NHS job: the NHS does not charge applicants, and sponsorship is arranged by the employer, not by a middleman. For other visa routes, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/singapore-work-visa-for-indians-employment-pass-s-pass-20261120'>Singapore work visa guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/japan-work-visa-ssw-specified-skilled-worker-indians-20261120'>Japan work visa guide</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish how many vacancies exist for each role, and the NHS Professionals posts do not publish pay. Two roles found during the hunt, a Sonographer and a York Radiographer, are deliberately left out because they close on 19 November, before this article publishes. Overseas care-worker sponsorship is closed to new applicants since 22 July 2025, so care-home roles are not included here.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. Genuine NHS recruitment is free, and any agent asking for money for an NHS post or a certificate of sponsorship is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://africaextended.com/things-that-matter/career/jobs/uk-jobs-visa-sponsorship-november-2026/'>Africa Extended</a>; <a href='https://careers.nhsprofessionals.nhs.uk/vacancies/vacancy-search-results.aspx?view=list'>NHS Professionals Careers</a>; <a href='https://www.jobs.nhs.uk/'>NHS Jobs</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>बेलायतको राष्ट्रिय स्वास्थ्य सेवा (NHS) ले यस महिना भिसा स्पोन्सरशिपसहित विदेशी कर्मचारी खोजिरहेको छ। पहिलो समूहका पद २२ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा बन्द हुन्छन्। यो लेख २० नोभेम्बरमा प्रकाशित हुने भएकाले २२ नोभेम्बर वा त्यसपछि बन्द हुने पद मात्र समेटिएका छन्।</p><p>डोर्सेट काउन्टी अस्पतालमा स्पेसलिस्ट स्पिच एन्ड ल्याङ्ग्वेज थेरापिस्ट (ब्यान्ड ६, £३९,९५९-£४८,११७), गोर्लस्टनमा अकुपेसनल थेरापिस्ट (ब्यान्ड ६), रिडिङमा स्टाफ नर्स (ब्यान्ड ५, £३२,०७३-£३९,०४३) र सर्रेमा हेल्थ भिजिटर (ब्यान्ड ६, £१,००० स्वागत बोनससहित) का पद २२ नोभेम्बरमा बन्द हुन्छन्। NHS Professionals का थप तीन पद २७ र ३० नोभेम्बरमा बन्द हुन्छन्।</p><h2>भिसा स्पोन्सरशिप कसरी काम गर्छ</h2><p>NHS रोजगारदाताले हेल्थ एन्ड केयर वर्कर भिसा अन्तर्गत विदेशी स्वास्थ्य कर्मचारीलाई स्पोन्सर गर्छन्। आवेदकलाई लाइसेन्स प्राप्त स्पोन्सरबाट जागिर प्रस्ताव, अंग्रेजी भाषा परीक्षण उत्तीर्ण र रोजगारदाताबाट सर्टिफिकेट अफ स्पोन्सरशिप चाहिन्छ।</p><h2>आवेदन कसरी गर्ने</h2><p>आवेदन jobs.nhs.uk वा NHS Professionals करियर साइट मार्फत गर्नुहोस्। NHS जागिरका लागि कसैलाई पैसा नदिनुहोस्, NHS ले आवेदकबाट शुल्क लिँदैन।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। NHS भर्ती निःशुल्क छ र सर्टिफिकेट अफ स्पोन्सरशिपका लागि पैसा माग्ने एजेन्ट ठगी हो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Africa Extended; NHS Professionals Careers; NHS Jobs।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://africaextended.com/things-that-matter/career/jobs/uk-jobs-visa-sponsorship-november-2026/', 'https://careers.nhsprofessionals.nhs.uk/vacancies/vacancy-search-results.aspx?view=list', 'https://www.jobs.nhs.uk/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- canada-federal-government-jobs-november-2026-20261121 (canada; English 392 words; Nepali 146 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'canada-federal-government-jobs-november-2026-20261121', 'canada', 'Canada',
'Canada Federal Government Jobs: November 2026 Openings',
'क्यानडा संघीय सरकारी जागिर: नोभेम्बर २०२६ का अवसर',
'Federal government jobs in Canada are open in November 2026, from correctional officers to grain inspectors. Pay, locations and closing dates inside.',
'क्यानडाका संघीय सरकारी जागिर नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा खुलेका छन्, सुधार अधिकारीदेखि अन्न निरीक्षकसम्म। तलब, स्थान र अन्तिम मिति यहाँ छ।',
$$<p>Federal government jobs in Canada are open in November 2026, with roles across the Correctional Service, the Canadian Grain Commission and Parks Canada. The postings below close between 10 and 31 December 2026, giving applicants several weeks to prepare. All federal competitions are listed on GC Jobs, the Government of Canada jobs site.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Department</th><th>Pay</th><th>Closes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Correctional Officer I</td><td>Correctional Service of Canada</td><td>$77,510-$97,266</td><td>31 Dec 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Grain Inspector Trainee</td><td>Canadian Grain Commission</td><td>$57,328-$68,147</td><td>14 Dec 2026 (West); 31 Dec 2026 (East)</td></tr><tr><td>Visitor Services Attendant II</td><td>Parks Canada (Nova Scotia)</td><td>$27.47-$29.85 per hour</td><td>10 Dec 2026</td></tr><tr><td>General Maintenance Worker</td><td>Correctional Service of Canada</td><td>$31.24-$33.95 per hour</td><td>15 Dec 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Canada federal government jobs: the November openings</h2><p>The Correctional Officer I post is the largest opening, with 24 locations across Canada and pay from $77,510 to $97,266, closing on 31 December 2026. Grain Inspector Trainees earn $57,328 to $68,147, with the western posting closing on 14 December and the eastern posting on 31 December. Parks Canada is hiring a Visitor Services Attendant II in Nova Scotia at $27.47 to $29.85 an hour, closing on 10 December, and the Correctional Service is hiring a General Maintenance Worker at $31.24 to $33.95 an hour, closing on 15 December.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Federal competitions need applicants who are legally entitled to work in Canada. Preference is given to veterans first, then to Canadian citizens and permanent residents. Some roles, such as correctional officer, need security screening and physical testing, so applicants should read the full posting on GC Jobs before applying.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply through GC Jobs at jobs.gc.ca, where the official postings are published. Applications are free, and no agent can improve your chances. For other international options, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/japan-work-visa-ssw-specified-skilled-worker-indians-20261120'>Japan work visa guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/oaic-investigator-jobs-australia-aps5-aps6-20261116'>OAIC investigator jobs in Australia</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish vacancy numbers for the Parks Canada or maintenance roles, and they do not say how many of the 24 correctional officer locations are in each province. Three postings found during the hunt are deliberately left out because they close too soon for a 20 November publish: a Coast Guard administrative officer closing 20 November, an OIC investigator closing 19 November and a Natural Resources senior analytical technologist closing 20 November.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. Federal hiring in Canada is free, and any agent asking for money for a GC Jobs posting is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://immigrationnewscanada.ca/government-of-canada-jobs-november-2026/'>Immigration News Canada</a>; <a href='https://canadagovernmentjobs.ca/jobs/page/2/'>Canada Government Jobs</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>क्यानडाका संघीय सरकारी जागिर नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा खुलेका छन्। सुधार सेवा, क्यानेडियन अन्न आयोग र पार्क्स क्यानडामा पद छन् र सबै आवेदन १० देखि ३१ डिसेम्बर २०२६ बीच बन्द हुन्छन्। सबै पद आधिकारिक GC Jobs साइटमा सूचीबद्ध छन्।</p><p>सुधार अधिकारी I पद सबैभन्दा ठूलो अवसर हो: २४ स्थानमा, तलब $७७,५१०-$९७,२६६, ३१ डिसेम्बरमा बन्द हुन्छ। अन्न निरीक्षक प्रशिक्षार्थीको तलब $५७,३२८-$६८,१४७ छ (पश्चिम १४ डिसेम्बर, पूर्व ३१ डिसेम्बर)। पार्क्स क्यानडाले नोभा स्कोसियामा भिजिटर सर्भिसेस अटेन्डेन्ट ($२७.४७-$२९.८५ प्रतिघण्टा, १० डिसेम्बर) र सुधार सेवाले जनरल मेन्टेनेन्स वर्कर ($३१.२४-$३३.९५ प्रतिघण्टा, १५ डिसेम्बर) खोजिरहेको छ।</p><h2>कसले आवेदन दिन सक्छ</h2><p>संघीय प्रतिस्पर्धामा क्यानडामा काम गर्ने कानुनी अधिकार भएका व्यक्तिले आवेदन दिन सक्छन्। पहिले पूर्व सैनिक, त्यसपछि क्यानेडियन नागरिक र स्थायी बासिन्दालाई प्राथमिकता दिइन्छ।</p><h2>आवेदन कसरी गर्ने</h2><p>आवेदन jobs.gc.ca मार्फत गर्नुहोस्। आवेदन निःशुल्क छ र कुनै एजेन्टले अवसर बढाउन सक्दैन।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। क्यानडाको संघीय भर्ती निःशुल्क छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Immigration News Canada; Canada Government Jobs।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://immigrationnewscanada.ca/government-of-canada-jobs-november-2026/', 'https://canadagovernmentjobs.ca/jobs/page/2/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- australia-aps-jobs-november-2026-20261121 (australia; English 406 words; Nepali 131 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'australia-aps-jobs-november-2026-20261121', 'australia', 'Australia',
'Australia APS Jobs November 2026: 632 Roles Open Now',
'अस्ट्रेलिया APS जागिर नोभेम्बर २०२६: ६३२ पद खुले',
'The Australian Public Service has 632 jobs open in November 2026, with more than a third closing within a week. The roles, pay and deadlines to know.',
'अस्ट्रेलियन पब्लिक सर्भिसमा नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा ६३२ जागिर खुलेका छन्, एक तिहाइभन्दा बढी एक हप्ताभित्र बन्द हुन्छन्। पद, तलब र मिति यहाँ।',
$$<p>The Australian Public Service (APS) has 632 jobs open as of 17 November 2026, and more than a third of them close within a week, so the best time to apply is now. The median salary midpoint across open roles is $111,800, and 76.4 percent of listings offer flexible or hybrid work. The roles below are drawn from the Department of Foreign Affairs and Trade, the Australian Centre for Disease Control, the Department of Home Affairs and ASIO.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Agency</th><th>Pay</th><th>Closes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>APS6 Enabling Services</td><td>DFAT, Canberra</td><td>$102,266-$114,988 + 15.4% super</td><td>29 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>APS6 Epidemiologist</td><td>Australian Centre for Disease Control</td><td>$101,679-$114,709</td><td>29 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>APS6 Finance Officer</td><td>Department of Home Affairs</td><td>Not published</td><td>24 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Technical Specialist</td><td>ASIO</td><td>Not published</td><td>23 Nov 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Data Scientist APS5/6</td><td>Department of Home Affairs</td><td>Not published</td><td>30 Nov 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Australia APS jobs: the November openings</h2><p>The Department of Foreign Affairs and Trade is hiring APS6 Enabling Services staff in Canberra at $102,266 to $114,988 plus 15.4 percent superannuation, closing on 29 November 2026. The Australian Centre for Disease Control is hiring an APS6 Epidemiologist at $101,679 to $114,709, also closing on 29 November. The Department of Home Affairs is hiring a Finance Officer closing on 24 November and a Data Scientist at APS5 or APS6 level closing on 30 November. ASIO is hiring a Technical Specialist closing on 23 November.</p><h2>How APS hiring works</h2><p>APS roles are advertised on APS Jobs and agency careers pages, and applicants apply online with a statement addressing the selection criteria. Most roles need Australian citizenship, and many need a security clearance, so applicants should read the full posting before applying. Flexible and hybrid work is now the norm: 76.4 percent of open listings offer it.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply through APS Jobs or the agency careers page linked in each posting. Applications are free, and no agent can improve your chances. For another Australian public service role, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/oaic-investigator-jobs-australia-aps5-aps6-20261116'>OAIC investigator jobs in Australia</a>, and for an Indian government role, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/gstat-recruitment-237-posts-20261120'>GSTAT recruitment for 237 posts</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish pay for the Home Affairs and ASIO roles, and they do not give vacancy numbers for any of the five roles. OAIC investigator roles are deliberately left out of this article because they were already covered in our 16 November article.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. APS recruitment is free, and any agent asking for money for a public service post is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.metrian.com.au/explore/recruitment'>Metrian</a>; <a href='https://www.cdc.gov.au/topics/about-us/work-us'>Australian Centre for Disease Control</a>; <a href='https://indigcareers.com.au/en-us/Ads/Job/ArtMID/608/ArticleID/7051/APS6-Enabling-Services-including-Affirmative-Measures-Multiple-Vacancies'>Indig Careers</a>; <a href='https://jobs.homeaffairs.gov.au/search/?createNewAlert=false'>Department of Home Affairs</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>अस्ट्रेलियन पब्लिक सर्भिस (APS) मा १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म ६३२ जागिर खुलेका छन् र एक तिहाइभन्दा बढी एक हप्ताभित्र बन्द हुन्छन्। खुला पदहरूको मध्य तलब $१,११,८०० छ र ७६.४ प्रतिशत सूचीमा लचिलो वा हाइब्रिड कामको सुविधा छ।</p><p>विदेश मामिला विभागले क्यानबेरामा APS6 एनेबलिङ सर्भिसेस ($१,०२,२६६-$१,१४,९८८ + १५.४% सुपर, २९ नोभेम्बर) खोजिरहेको छ। अस्ट्रेलियन सेन्टर फर डिजिज कन्ट्रोलले APS6 एपिडेमियोलोजिस्ट ($१,०१,६७९-$१,१४,७०९, २९ नोभेम्बर) खोजिरहेको छ। गृह मामिला विभागले फाइनान्स अफिसर (२४ नोभेम्बर) र डाटा साइन्टिस्ट (३० नोभेम्बर) खोजिरहेको छ भने ASIO ले टेक्निकल स्पेसलिस्ट (२३ नोभेम्बर) खोजिरहेको छ।</p><h2>आवेदन कसरी गर्ने</h2><p>आवेदन APS Jobs वा सम्बन्धित एजेन्सीको करियर पेज मार्फत गर्नुहोस्। धेरै पदमा अस्ट्रेलियन नागरिकता चाहिन्छ र केहीमा सुरक्षा जाँच चाहिन्छ।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। APS भर्ती निःशुल्क छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Metrian; Australian Centre for Disease Control; Indig Careers; Department of Home Affairs।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.metrian.com.au/explore/recruitment', 'https://www.cdc.gov.au/topics/about-us/work-us', 'https://indigcareers.com.au/en-us/Ads/Job/ArtMID/608/ArticleID/7051/APS6-Enabling-Services-including-Affirmative-Measures-Multiple-Vacancies', 'https://jobs.homeaffairs.gov.au/search/?createNewAlert=false'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- germany-skilled-worker-jobs-2026-20261121 (europe; English 397 words; Nepali 138 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'germany-skilled-worker-jobs-2026-20261121', 'europe', 'Germany',
'Germany Skilled Worker Jobs 2026: 654,000 Vacancies Open',
'जर्मनी कुशल कामदार जागिर २०२६: ६,५४,००० रिक्त पद',
'Germany has 654,000 vacancies and 157 shortage occupations in 2026, with a new programme for Kenyan youth. The routes, pay and how to apply.',
'जर्मनीमा २०२६ मा ६,५४,००० रिक्त पद र १५७ अभाव पेशा छन्, केन्याली युवाका लागि नयाँ कार्यक्रमसहित। बाटो, तलब र आवेदन विधि।',
$$<p>Germany has 654,000 registered vacancies as of October 2026 and 157 shortage occupations, with 80,000 nursing posts vacant. For skilled workers, the routes are the EU Blue Card, the Chancenkarte points-based visa and a new GIZ programme that combines 1,200 jobs and study visas for Kenyan youth. Health, hospitality and education are the sectors hiring fastest.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Registered vacancies</td><td>654,000 (October 2026)</td></tr><tr><td>Shortage occupations</td><td>157, including 80,000 vacant nursing posts</td></tr><tr><td>EU Blue Card threshold 2026</td><td>€50,700; €45,934.20 for shortage jobs, IT and recent graduates</td></tr><tr><td>Chancenkarte visas</td><td>11,497 issued June 2024 to June 2025, including 3,721 to Indians</td></tr><tr><td>GIZ programme</td><td>1,200 jobs and study visas for Kenyan youth; apply by Dec 2026 or Jan 2027</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Germany skilled worker jobs: the GIZ programme</h2><p>The German development agency GIZ has announced 1,200 jobs and study visas for Kenyan youth in healthcare, engineering and technical trades. Applications are made through giz.de/jobs, and the programme is rolling, with applicants advised to apply by December 2026 or January 2027 for departure in mid-2027. The programme is aimed at Kenyan applicants, but it shows how Germany is actively recruiting abroad for its shortage sectors.</p><h2>EU Blue Card and Chancenkarte</h2><p>The EU Blue Card threshold for 2026 is €50,700 a year, falling to €45,934.20 for shortage occupations, IT roles and recent graduates. The Chancenkarte, Germany's points-based job-seeker visa, issued 11,497 visas between June 2024 and June 2025, with 3,721 going to Indian applicants. The card lets skilled workers come to Germany for up to a year to look for work, scoring points for qualifications, experience, language and age.</p><h2>Which sectors are hiring</h2><p>Health leads the shortage list, with dental and medical assistants, physiotherapists and pharmacists in demand, alongside chefs, hotel experts and teachers. Germany's official portal, Make it in Germany, lists the recognised shortage occupations and the recognition process for foreign qualifications. Read our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/japan-work-visa-ssw-specified-skilled-worker-indians-20261120'>Japan work visa guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/singapore-work-visa-for-indians-employment-pass-s-pass-20261120'>Singapore work visa guide</a> to compare other destinations.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish a salary range for the GIZ programme roles, and they do not list the exact departure dates for mid-2027. The 654,000 vacancy figure is the registered total for October 2026, not the number of roles open to foreign applicants.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. Genuine German employers and the GIZ programme do not charge applicants, and any agent demanding payment for a Blue Card or Chancenkarte is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://www.diaspora-link.com/blog/germany-opens-1-200-jobs-and-study-visas-heres-how-kenyans-can-apply'>Diaspora Link</a>; <a href='https://kurums.com/fastest-growing-jobs-germany-2026/'>Kurums</a>; <a href='https://wearemainstreet.org/world/2026/11/05/germany-skilled-worker-jobs-health-hospitality-education'>We Are Main Street</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>जर्मनीमा अक्टोबर २०२६ सम्म ६,५४,००० रिक्त पद दर्ता भएका छन् र १५७ अभाव पेशा छन्, जसमा ८०,००० नर्सिङ पद खाली छन्। कुशल कामदारका लागि EU Blue Card, Chancenkarte अंक-आधारित भिसा र केन्याली युवाका लागि GIZ कार्यक्रम (१,२०० जागिर र अध्ययन भिसा) मुख्य बाटो हुन्।</p><p>EU Blue Card २०२६ को सीमा €५०,७०० छ, अभाव पेशा, IT र हालै स्नातक गरेकाका लागि €४५,९३४.२० छ। Chancenkarte अन्तर्गत जुन २०२४ देखि जुन २०२५ सम्म ११,४९७ भिसा जारी भए, जसमा ३,७२१ भारतीयलाई परे। GIZ कार्यक्रममा giz.de/jobs मार्फत आवेदन दिनुपर्छ र डिसेम्बर २०२६ वा जनवरी २०२७ भित्र आवेदन दिन सल्लाह दिइएको छ।</p><h2>कुन क्षेत्रमा माग छ</h2><p>स्वास्थ्य क्षेत्रमा सबैभन्दा धेरै माग छ: दन्त तथा चिकित्सा सहायक, फिजियोथेरापिस्ट, फार्मासिस्ट, शेफ, होटल विशेषज्ञ र शिक्षक।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। वास्तविक जर्मन रोजगारदाता र GIZ कार्यक्रमले आवेदकबाट शुल्क लिँदैनन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Diaspora Link; Kurums; We Are Main Street।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.diaspora-link.com/blog/germany-opens-1-200-jobs-and-study-visas-heres-how-kenyans-can-apply', 'https://kurums.com/fastest-growing-jobs-germany-2026/', 'https://wearemainstreet.org/world/2026/11/05/germany-skilled-worker-jobs-health-hospitality-education'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- uae-walk-in-interviews-november-2026-20261121 (gulf; English 396 words; Nepali 125 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'uae-walk-in-interviews-november-2026-20261121', 'gulf', 'UAE',
'UAE Walk-in Interviews November 2026: Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Ajman',
'युएई वाक-इन अन्तर्वार्ता नोभेम्बर २०२६: दुबई, अबु धाबी, अजमान',
'Walk-in interviews are running across the UAE from 17 to 27 November 2026, from food factories to pharmacies. Dates, venues and what to carry.',
'युएईमा १७ देखि २७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म वाक-इन अन्तर्वार्ता चलिरहेका छन्, खाद्य कारखानादेखि फार्मेसीसम्म। मिति, स्थान र के लैजाने।',
$$<p>Walk-in interviews are running across the UAE from 17 to 27 November 2026, from food factories to pharmacies, hospitals and schools. Most interviews need only a CV, passport copy and a photo, and several employers offer free visa and health insurance. The verified walk-ins below are listed with dates and venues so jobseekers can plan a visit.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Employer</th><th>Roles</th><th>Date</th><th>Venue</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>UNIKAI Foods</td><td>Factory and production roles</td><td>17-20 and 23-27 Nov, 9am-4pm</td><td>Al Quoz 1, Dubai</td></tr><tr><td>J&T Express</td><td>Courier drivers</td><td>19 and 26 Nov Abu Dhabi; 24 Nov Dubai; 25 Nov Ajman, 10am-1pm</td><td>Multiple venues</td></tr><tr><td>EIFM</td><td>Joinery and maintenance</td><td>21 Nov; soft services and security 22 Nov</td><td>Jebel Ali</td></tr><tr><td>Life Pharmacy</td><td>Pharmacy roles</td><td>22 Nov</td><td>Dubai Investments Park 1</td></tr><tr><td>Trellis Hospital</td><td>Specialist doctors, nurses, midwives</td><td>19-20 Nov</td><td>Deira</td></tr><tr><td>NAFFCO</td><td>Drivers</td><td>21 Nov</td><td>Abu Dhabi</td></tr><tr><td>GEMS Education</td><td>38 teaching roles</td><td>Posted 10-16 Nov</td><td>Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>UAE walk-in interviews: the best leads</h2><p>UNIKAI Foods is running the longest walk-in, from 17 to 20 November and again from 23 to 27 November, 9am to 4pm, at Al Quoz 1 in Dubai. J&T Express is hiring courier drivers across three emirates, with free visa and health insurance, at 10am to 1pm on 19 and 26 November in Abu Dhabi, 24 November in Dubai and 25 November in Ajman. NAFFCO is hiring drivers in Abu Dhabi on 21 November at up to AED 2,200 to 3,000 a month.</p><h2>Healthcare and teaching walk-ins</h2><p>Trellis Hospital is interviewing specialist doctors, nurses and midwives in Deira on 19 and 20 November, and Life Pharmacy is holding a walk-in at Dubai Investments Park 1 on 22 November. GEMS Education has posted 38 teaching roles across Dubai, Abu Dhabi and Sharjah, with some starting in January 2027; salaries are not published, so candidates should ask at interview.</p><h2>What to carry to a UAE walk-in interview</h2><p>Bring an updated CV, passport copy, visa copy if you hold one, passport photos and attested certificates where relevant. Arrive early, because walk-ins are first come, first served. For other visa routes, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/singapore-work-visa-for-indians-employment-pass-s-pass-20261120'>Singapore work visa guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/japan-work-visa-ssw-specified-skilled-worker-indians-20261120'>Japan work visa guide</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish salaries for most walk-ins, and the GEMS Education roles do not list pay at all. Walk-in dates can change at short notice, so candidates should confirm the venue on the day before travelling.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. Walk-in interviews are free, and any person asking for money for a UAE job, visa or medical test is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://ehss.ae/walk-in-interview/'>EHSS</a>; <a href='https://www.gccrecruitments.com/walk-in-interview-in-dubai/'>GCC Recruitments</a>; <a href='https://uaejobhub.ae/gems-education-jobs-uae-teaching-roles/'>UAE Job Hub</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>युएईमा १७ देखि २७ नोभेम्बर २०२६ सम्म वाक-इन अन्तर्वार्ता चलिरहेका छन्: खाद्य कारखाना, फार्मेसी, अस्पताल र विद्यालयसम्म। धेरै अन्तर्वार्तामा सीभी, राहदानी प्रतिलिपि र फोटो मात्र चाहिन्छ र केही रोजगारदाताले निःशुल्क भिसा र स्वास्थ्य बीमा दिन्छन्।</p><p>UNIKAI Foods को अन्तर्वार्ता १७-२० र २३-२७ नोभेम्बर, बिहान ९ देखि ४ बजेसम्म, अल क्वोज १, दुबईमा छ। J&T Express ले कुरियर ड्राइभर खोजिरहेको छ (अबु धाबी १९ र २६ नोभेम्बर, दुबई २४ नोभेम्बर, अजमान २५ नोभेम्बर, बिहान १० देखि १ बजेसम्म)। ट्रेलिस अस्पतालले १९-२० नोभेम्बरमा देइरामा डाक्टर, नर्स र मिडवाइफ खोजिरहेको छ। NAFFCO ले २१ नोभेम्बरमा अबु धाबीमा ड्राइभर (AED २,२००-३,०००) खोजिरहेको छ। GEMS Education ले ३८ शिक्षण पद प्रकाशित गरेको छ।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। वाक-इन अन्तर्वार्ता निःशुल्क हुन्छन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> EHSS; GCC Recruitments; UAE Job Hub।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://ehss.ae/walk-in-interview/', 'https://www.gccrecruitments.com/walk-in-interview-in-dubai/', 'https://uaejobhub.ae/gems-education-jobs-uae-teaching-roles/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- usps-holiday-jobs-10000-seasonal-20261121 (usa; English 376 words; Nepali 125 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'usps-holiday-jobs-10000-seasonal-20261121', 'usa', 'USA',
'USPS Holiday Jobs: 10,000 Seasonal Roles for Christmas 2026',
'USPS बिदा जागिर: क्रिसमस २०२६ का लागि १०,००० मौसमी पद',
'USPS is hiring more than 10,000 seasonal workers for the 2026 holidays, from mail handlers to rural carriers. Pay, roles and how to apply.',
'USPS ले २०२६ को बिदाका लागि १०,००० भन्दा बढी मौसमी कर्मचारी भर्ती गरिरहेको छ, मेल ह्यान्डलरदेखि रुरल क्यारियरसम्म। तलब, पद र आवेदन विधि।',
$$<p>The United States Postal Service (USPS) is hiring a little more than 10,000 seasonal workers for the 2026 holidays, it announced on 22 October 2026. The number is down from 40,000 in recent years, so competition for the roles is likely to be higher. Pay typically starts from about $21 an hour, and applications are open now at jobs.usps.com.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mail Handler Assistant</td><td>Sorting and moving mail; San Antonio posting lists $19.02 an hour for 290 posts</td></tr><tr><td>Holiday Clerk Assistant</td><td>Counter and retail work in post offices</td></tr><tr><td>Rural Carrier Associate</td><td>Delivering mail on rural routes</td></tr><tr><td>City Carrier Assistant</td><td>Delivering mail on city routes</td></tr><tr><td>PSE Sales and Distribution Associate</td><td>Sales and distribution work</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>USPS holiday jobs: pay and roles</h2><p>Seasonal roles include Mail Handler Assistant, Holiday Clerk Assistant, Rural Carrier Associate, City Carrier Assistant and PSE Sales and Distribution Associate, plus mail clerk assistants and delivery drivers. Pay typically starts from about $21 an hour, although it varies by location: a San Antonio Mail Handler Assistant posting lists $19.02 an hour for 290 posts. USPS says mail volume rises about 40 percent between 1 October and 31 December, which is why the extra hands are needed.</p><h2>How to apply for USPS jobs</h2><p>Apply only at jobs.usps.com, the official USPS careers site. The application and the postal exam are always free, and an FBI background check may be required. USPS warns applicants to use only its official site, because fake USPS job posts are common during the holidays. For other US work, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/software-engineer-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-h-1b-pay-and-hiring-guide-20261029'>software engineer jobs in the USA guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/bhel-artisan-grade-iv-660-posts-20261118'>BHEL Artisan recruitment for 660 posts</a>.</p><h2>Christmas delivery dates</h2><p>USPS has set its delivery-by-Christmas dates for 2026: Ground Advantage and First-Class Mail by 17 December, Priority Mail by 18 December and Priority Mail Express by 19 December. Seasonal workers help clear the surge before those dates.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not give a closing date for the seasonal hiring, and they do not break down the 10,000 roles by state. The 14,000 figure reported in some places was the 2025 plan, not the 2026 figure, and it is not used here.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. USPS applications and exams are free, and any person asking for money for a postal job is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://money.com/companies-hiring-seasonal-jobs-2026/?apxa1=homepage'>Money</a>; <a href='https://www.thepennyhoarder.com/make-money/side-gigs/hiring-for-the-holidays/'>The Penny Hoarder</a>; <a href='https://jobwireusa.blogspot.com/2026/11/usps-jobs-hiring-now-2026.html'>JobWireUSA</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>अमेरिकी हुलाक सेवा (USPS) ले २०२६ को बिदाका लागि १०,००० भन्दा बढी मौसमी कर्मचारी भर्ती गरिरहेको छ। यो संख्या हालका वर्षहरूको ४०,००० भन्दा कम छ, त्यसैले प्रतिस्पर्धा बढी हुन सक्छ। तलब सामान्यतया प्रतिघण्टा करिब $२१ बाट सुरु हुन्छ र आवेदन jobs.usps.com मा खुला छ।</p><p>पदहरूमा मेल ह्यान्डलर असिस्टेन्ट, हलिडे क्लर्क असिस्टेन्ट, रुरल क्यारियर एसोसिएट, सिटी क्यारियर एसोसिएट र PSE सेल्स एन्ड डिस्ट्रिब्युसन एसोसिएट छन्। सान एन्टोनियोको मेल ह्यान्डलर पदमा $१९.०२ प्रतिघण्टा (२९० पद) तोकिएको छ। अक्टोबर १ देखि डिसेम्बर ३१ बीच हुलाक मात्रा करिब ४० प्रतिशत बढ्छ।</p><h2>आवेदन कसरी गर्ने</h2><p>आवेदन मात्र jobs.usps.com मार्फत गर्नुहोस्। आवेदन र हुलाक परीक्षा सधैं निःशुल्क हुन्छन् र FBI पृष्ठभूमि जाँच आवश्यक पर्न सक्छ।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। USPS आवेदन र परीक्षा निःशुल्क छन्।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Money; The Penny Hoarder; JobWireUSA।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://money.com/companies-hiring-seasonal-jobs-2026/?apxa1=homepage', 'https://www.thepennyhoarder.com/make-money/side-gigs/hiring-for-the-holidays/', 'https://jobwireusa.blogspot.com/2026/11/usps-jobs-hiring-now-2026.html'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- amazon-holiday-jobs-300000-seasonal-20261121 (usa; English 283 words; Nepali 88 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'amazon-holiday-jobs-300000-seasonal-20261121', 'usa', 'USA',
'Amazon Holiday Jobs: 300,000 Seasonal Roles Across the USA',
'अमेजन बिदा जागिर: अमेरिकाभर ३,००,००० मौसमी पद',
'Amazon is hiring more than 300,000 seasonal, part-time and full-time workers for the 2026 holidays. Roles, pay and the only official application link.',
'अमेजनले २०२६ को बिदाका लागि ३,००,००० भन्दा बढी मौसमी, अंशकालिक र पूर्णकालिक कर्मचारी भर्ती गरिरहेको छ। पद, तलब र आधिकारिक आवेदन लिंक।',
$$<p>Amazon is hiring more than 300,000 seasonal, part-time and full-time workers across its US operations for the 2026 holidays, it announced on 20 October 2026. New roles are posted weekly from October to December, and most warehouse roles need no experience, with training given on the job. Average seasonal earnings are about $20 an hour.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Role</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Warehouse Associate</td><td>Picking, packing and sorting in fulfilment centres</td></tr><tr><td>Package Sorter</td><td>Sorting parcels in delivery stations</td></tr><tr><td>Delivery Station Associate</td><td>Preparing orders for delivery drivers</td></tr><tr><td>Seasonal Operations Employee</td><td>General operations support</td></tr><tr><td>Customer Service Representative</td><td>Helping customers by phone and chat</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Amazon holiday jobs: roles and pay</h2><p>Amazon's seasonal hiring covers Warehouse Associate, Fulfilment Centre Associate, Package Sorter, Delivery Station Associate, Seasonal Operations Employee and Customer Service Representative roles. Average seasonal earnings are about $20 an hour, and most warehouse roles need no previous experience. New roles are posted weekly through October, November and December, so candidates who miss one week should check again the next.</p><h2>How to apply for Amazon jobs</h2><p>Apply only at hiring.amazon.com, Amazon's official hiring site. Amazon never charges a fee to apply, and no agent can guarantee a warehouse role. For other US work, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/software-engineer-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-h-1b-pay-and-hiring-guide-20261029'>software engineer jobs in the USA guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/ukpsc-lower-pcs-54-posts-20261118'>UKPSC Lower PCS recruitment for 54 posts</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not break down the 300,000 roles by state or by full-time and part-time split, and they do not give a closing date. The $20 an hour figure is an average across seasonal roles, so individual postings may pay more or less.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. Amazon hiring is free, and any person asking for money for an Amazon warehouse job is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://medium.com/@jobsandvisaguide/amazon-holiday-jobs-2026-300-000-roles-across-the-usa-8b428802b01e'>Jobs and Visa Guide</a>; <a href='http://financenet247.blogspot.com/2026/11/2026-usa-jobs-november-and-december.html'>FinanceNet247</a>; <a href='https://www.onetonline.org/link/jobinfo?id=E76716C4C3C14E60A9ADBD5767C74973206'>O*NET OnLine</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>अमेजनले २०२६ को बिदाका लागि अमेरिकाभर ३,००,००० भन्दा बढी मौसमी, अंशकालिक र पूर्णकालिक कर्मचारी भर्ती गरिरहेको छ। नयाँ पद अक्टोबरदेखि डिसेम्बरसम्म हरेक हप्ता प्रकाशित हुन्छन् र धेरै गोदाम पदमा अनुभव चाहिँदैन, काममै तालिम दिइन्छ। औसत मौसमी कमाइ प्रतिघण्टा करिब $२० छ।</p><p>पदहरूमा वेयरहाउस एसोसिएट, फुलफिलमेन्ट सेन्टर एसोसिएट, प्याकेज सर्टर, डेलिभरी स्टेसन एसोसिएट, सिजनल अपरेसन्स इम्प्लोयी र कस्टमर सर्भिस रिप्रेजेन्टेटिभ छन्। आवेदन मात्र hiring.amazon.com मार्फत गर्नुहोस्। अमेजनले आवेदनका लागि शुल्क लिँदैन।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। अमेजन भर्ती निःशुल्क छ।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Jobs and Visa Guide; FinanceNet247; O*NET OnLine।</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://medium.com/@jobsandvisaguide/amazon-holiday-jobs-2026-300-000-roles-across-the-usa-8b428802b01e', 'http://financenet247.blogspot.com/2026/11/2026-usa-jobs-november-and-december.html', 'https://www.onetonline.org/link/jobinfo?id=E76716C4C3C14E60A9ADBD5767C74973206'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW(), '2026-11-18'::timestamptz, NULL) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- seasonal-remote-jobs-holiday-hiring-november-2026-20261121 (remote; English 361 words; Nepali 134 words; verifiedAt '2026-11-18'::timestamptz)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'seasonal-remote-jobs-holiday-hiring-november-2026-20261121', 'remote', 'USA',
'Seasonal Remote Jobs: Holiday Work From Home in November 2026',
'मौसमी रिमोट जागिर: नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा घरबाट बिदाको काम',
'Seasonal remote jobs are open for the 2026 holidays, from bilingual customer service at 25 dollars an hour to tax work. The verified leads inside.',
'२०२६ को बिदाका लागि मौसमी रिमोट जागिर खुलेका छन्, प्रतिघण्टा २५ डलरको द्विभाषी ग्राहक सेवादेखि कर कामसम्म। प्रमाणित अवसर यहाँ।',
$$<p>Seasonal remote jobs are open for the 2026 holidays, and the strongest leads are in customer service and tax work. Foundever is hiring seasonal bilingual customer service staff at $25 to $30 an hour, fully remote, and Working Solutions, JDA TSG and Taxwell all have seasonal remote roles running into December and beyond. Availability changes fast in holiday hiring, so check the employer listing before applying.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Employer</th><th>Role</th><th>Pay</th><th>Dates</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Foundever</td><td>Seasonal Bilingual Customer Service</td><td>$25-$30 per hour</td><td>Remote, select US states</td></tr><tr><td>Five Star Solutions</td><td>Seasonal Customer Service</td><td>$15 per hour + night and weekend differential</td><td>Seasonal</td></tr><tr><td>Working Solutions</td><td>Seasonal Benefits Enrollment Representative</td><td>Not published</td><td>9 Nov-14 Dec 2026</td></tr><tr><td>JDA TSG</td><td>Seasonal Tax Manager</td><td>Not published</td><td>Nov 2026-30 Apr 2027</td></tr><tr><td>Taxwell (Drake Software)</td><td>Remote Seasonal Bilingual Customer Service Representative</td><td>Not published</td><td>Seasonal</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>Seasonal remote jobs: the best leads</h2><p>Foundever's seasonal bilingual customer service role pays $25 to $30 an hour and is fully remote, although it is open only in select US states. Five Star Solutions is hiring seasonal customer service staff at $15 an hour plus a night and weekend differential. Working Solutions is hiring a seasonal benefits enrollment representative for a programme running from 9 November to 14 December 2026, and JDA TSG is hiring a seasonal tax manager from November 2026 to 30 April 2027. Taxwell, part of Drake Software, is hiring a remote seasonal bilingual customer service representative.</p><h2>What to check before applying</h2><p>Remote roles often have state restrictions, so check the listing for the states where you can work. Pay and hours can change as the season fills, and some roles need evening or weekend availability. For other remote options, see our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/software-engineer-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-h-1b-pay-and-hiring-guide-20261029'>software engineer jobs in the USA guide</a> and our <a href='https://growentix.cloud/articles/singapore-work-visa-for-indians-employment-pass-s-pass-20261120'>Singapore work visa guide</a>.</p><h2>What the sources do not say</h2><p>The sources do not publish pay for the Working Solutions, JDA TSG and Taxwell roles, and they do not list how many posts are open at each employer. Seasonal availability changes fast, so a role listed today may be filled tomorrow; always check the employer listing for current availability, pay and location rules.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Never pay anyone for a job or a visa. Remote hiring is free, and any person asking for money for equipment, training or a remote job is a scam.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> <a href='https://twochickswithasidehustle.com/holiday-seasonal-remote-jobs-november-2026/'>Two Chicks With A Side Hustle</a>; <a href='https://www.linkedin.com/company/remote-jobs-connect'>Remote Jobs Connect</a>.</p>$$,
$$<p>२०२६ को बिदाका लागि मौसमी रिमोट जागिर खुलेका छन् र सबैभन्दा राम्रा अवसर ग्राहक सेवा र कर क्षेत्रमा छन्। Foundever ले मौसमी द्विभाषी ग्राहक सेवा कर्मचारीलाई प्रतिघण्टा $२५-$३० मा पूर्ण रिमोट कामका लागि खोजिरहेको छ। Five Star Solutions ले $१५ प्रतिघण्टा + राति र सप्ताहन्त भत्ता मा ग्राहक सेवा कर्मचारी खोजिरहेको छ। Working Solutions (९ नोभेम्बर-१४ डिसेम्बर २०२६), JDA TSG (नोभेम्बर २०२६-अप्रिल २०२७) र Taxwell ले पनि मौसमी रिमोट पद प्रकाशित गरेका छन्।</p><p>रिमोट पदमा प्रायः राज्य प्रतिबन्ध हुन्छ, त्यसैले आवेदन गर्नुअघि सूचीमा आफ्नो राज्य छ कि छैन हेर्नुहोस्। बिदाको भर्तीमा उपलब्धता छिटो परिवर्तन हुन्छ, त्यसैले रोजगारदाताको सूचीमा हालको तलब र नियम जाँच गर्नुहोस्।</p><p><strong>चेतावनी:</strong> जागिर वा भिसाका लागि कसैलाई पनि पैसा नदिनुहोस्। रिमोट भर्ती निःशुल्क छ र उपकरण वा तालिमका लागि पैसा माग्ने व्यक्ति ठगी हो।</p><p><strong>स्रोत:</strong> Two Chicks With A Side Hustle; Remote Jobs Connect।</p>$$,
